msgstr "收下一首心歌。"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:29
msgid "Sung Whole"
msgstr "九歌齊鳴"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:29
msgid "Hear all nine Heartsongs, across your runs."
msgstr "跨局累計聽過全部九首心歌。"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:30
msgid "It Glows"
msgstr "它在發光"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:30
msgid "Find an enchanted thing."
msgstr "找到一件附魔物品。"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:31
msgid "A Perfect Read"
msgstr "完美判斷"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:31
msgid "Tick exactly what's in a chest before you open it."
msgstr "開箱前，一樣不差地勾選出寶箱裡的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:32
msgid "Never Wrong"
msgstr "從不出錯"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:32
msgid "Make five perfect reads in a row."
msgstr "連續做出五次完美判斷。"

#: scripts/Core/Achievements.cs:33
