#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:155
msgid "Rotten: it stands {0} seconds of shaking, all told."
msgstr "已腐朽：前後總共只經得起搖{0}秒。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:156
msgid "Packed in straw: everything needs a strength harder to stir."
msgstr "塞滿稻草：每樣東西都要高一檔的力度才搖得動。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:157
msgid "On a skittish mare: no hard shake."
msgstr "箱子馱在易受驚的母馬背上：不能猛搖。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:158
msgid "A day of mourning: no hard shake."
msgstr "哀悼日：不能猛搖。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:159
msgid "Each strength you try after the first puts the price up {0}."
msgstr "第一種力度之後，每多試一種，價格就漲{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:160
msgid "Read it exactly right and she gives back a third of the price."
msgstr "判斷分毫不差的話，賣家會退還三分之一的價格。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:161
msgid "A contest: read it exactly right, and you win {0}g."
msgstr "比賽：判斷分毫不差，就能贏得{0}金。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:162
msgid "The best {0} inside goes back to him, for {1}g."
msgstr "箱裡最好的{0}要歸還給他，他會付你{1}金。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:163
msgid "The dearest thing inside is his."
msgstr "箱裡最貴重的東西歸他。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:164
msgid ""
"His price is your slip: exactly right, a quarter off; wrong, what it holds and a quarter more."
msgstr "他按你的估價單要價：判斷分毫不差，減價四分之一；判斷有誤，就按箱裡的實值再加四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:165
msgid "Buy, and everyone after him today asks {0}."
msgstr "買下的話，今天在他之後來的人都會要價{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:165
msgid "twice as much"
msgstr "翻倍"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:167
msgid "a hard shake"
msgstr "猛搖"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:168
msgid "a drop"
msgstr "摔一下"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:169
msgid "the lodestone"
msgstr "磁石"

#: scripts/Core/Kin.cs:170
msgid "Minds {0}: half again if you do."
msgstr "介意{0}：你若這麼做，價格漲一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:72
msgid ""
"Pip never shakes anything and has no idea what it's worth: he'll ask you to name a price. First, shake it at every strength."
msgstr "皮普從來不搖箱子，也完全不知道它值多少：他會請你出價。首先，每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:74
msgid ""
"Tick what you heard. Then set the slider to a few coins and make your offer: he'll take almost anything. You get two tries."
msgstr "把聽到的勾選上。然後把滑塊撥到幾枚金幣，再出價：他幾乎什麼價都肯收。你有兩次機會。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:90
msgid ""
"Garrick shakes hard, so a clank drowns out anything delicate for him. He haggles: he always asks about double. Shake it yourself, gently too."
msgstr "加里克總是猛搖，所以在他聽來，哐啷聲會蓋過一切細微的聲響。他愛討價還價：開價總在兩倍左右。你自己搖一遍，輕搖也要試試。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:92
msgid ""
"Tick what you heard. Then use the slider to offer him about half his price. You get one offer: much lower and he storms off."
msgstr "把聽到的勾選上。然後用滑塊出他要價的一半左右。你只有一次出價機會：出得比這低太多，他就會氣沖沖地走掉。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:101
msgid ""
"A tinker paid his tab with it. One rattle, like a fish in a crate. A rattle's a rattle: {price}, love."
msgstr "一個修補匠拿它抵了酒賬。裡頭就一聲響，像魚在箱子裡撲騰。一響算一響：{price}，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:104
msgid ""
"Bettany counts the rattles and charges the same for each, whatever's rattling: a purse of coin costs what a goblin's cleaver does. Shake it: what's rattling?"
msgstr "貝塔妮數響聲，每響一聲收一樣的錢，不管響的是什麼：一袋錢幣跟一把哥布林砍刀一個價。搖一搖：裡面響的是什麼？"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:106
msgid ""
"A jingle: coin, worth more than any cleaver. At cleaver prices, that's a bargain."
msgstr "叮噹一聲：是錢幣，比哪把砍刀都值錢。照砍刀的價錢買，那可是撿了便宜。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:116
msgid ""
"The Barrow: Tobin always says where a chest came from, and the place tells you what it tends to hold. Barrow chests hold grave goods: coin, weapons, a shroud."
msgstr "古冢：託賓總會說箱子是從哪兒來的，而從出處就能看出裡面大多裝著什麼。古冢的箱子裝的是陪葬品：錢幣、兵器，還有壽衣。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:118
msgid ""
"His chests are rotten through: about two seconds of shaking and no more. One strength, then. Hard stirs everything, but a clank would drown the coin. Shake it hard."
msgstr "他的箱子都朽透了：頂多能搖兩秒左右。所以只能選一種力度。猛搖什麼都能搖響，可要是有哐啷聲，就會蓋過錢幣。猛搖一下。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:131
msgid ""
"A goblin burrow: shinies her clan dug up, mostly coin. Nettle shook it gently. Do the same: the first strength is free."
msgstr "哥布林地洞：她的部族挖出來的亮閃閃，大多是錢幣。蕁麻輕搖過了。你也輕搖：第一種力度不收錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:133
msgid ""
"Every strength after that puts her price up a tenth. A gentle shake can't stir anything heavy, so pay once more for a hard one. Gentle and hard between them hear everything firm would."
msgstr "之後每多試一種力度，她就漲價一成。輕搖搖不動沉的東西，所以再花一次錢猛搖。輕搖加猛搖，穩搖能聽到的就都聽到了。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:145
msgid ""
"Rook weighs every chest on her game scale and prices by the pound. Her mare spooks at a hard shake, so nothing gets shaken hard. Shake it gently, then firmly."
msgstr "魯克把每個箱子都放在她的獵物秤上稱，按磅數定價。她的母馬一遇猛搖就受驚，所以誰都不許猛搖。先輕搖，再穩搖。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:147
msgid ""
"A slosh: a potion, 3 lb. Her scale says 6 lb, so 3 lb never sounded. A cloak weighs 3, a spell 1, and wolf dens are full of cloaks. Tick a potion and a cloak."
msgstr "嘩啦一聲：一瓶藥水，3磅。她的秤顯示6磅，所以有3磅從沒出過聲。斗篷重3磅，法術1磅，而狼窩裡多的是斗篷。勾選一瓶藥水和一件斗篷。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:163
msgid ""
"Everyone you've traded with has a page in your notebook: how they judge a chest, and what they're like. Click Mother Sorrel to read hers."
msgstr "跟你做過買賣的人，在你的筆記本里都有一頁：他們怎麼判斷箱子，又是什麼樣的人。點選索蕾爾婆婆，看看她那一頁。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:165
msgid ""
"Mother Sorrel's price is a dream, but she always dreams true: of what the Wood warded in the chest, or else the dearest thing in it, as a sign. A river is a potion. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr ""
"索蕾爾婆婆的價錢是夢裡得來的，可她的夢從來都會應驗：她會以徵兆夢見古林在箱中用結界封住的東西，沒有的話，就夢見箱裡最貴重的東西。河代表藥水。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:167
msgid ""
"A flump and a rustle, and no slosh. The potion is warded: sealed in the ward itself, silent and weightless. Name it: tick Potions."
msgstr "噗的一聲，沙沙一聲，卻沒有嘩啦聲。藥水被結界封住了：它封在結界裡，無聲又無重。說出它：勾選藥水。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:169
msgid ""
"A ward gives up only to the truth. Name what's there and nothing that isn't, and the warded thing comes out when you open the chest. Nobody priced it."
msgstr "結界只向真相讓步。說中箱裡有的東西，一樣沒有的也別多說，開箱時被封住的東西就會現身。誰都沒給它定過價。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:180
msgid ""
"Brother Cadoc shook it firmly, and won't have it shaken hard: the saints are resting. Half again if you do. Shake it gently, then firmly."
msgstr "卡多克修士穩搖過了，也不許別人猛搖：聖徒們在安息。你若猛搖，價格漲一半。先輕搖，再穩搖。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:182
msgid ""
"Crypt chests are full of holy cloaks, and cloth only sounds at a hard shake, so he never prices it. Tick Cloaks on faith, or shake it hard and pay for certainty."
msgstr "墓穴裡的箱子裝滿了聖袍，而布料只有猛搖才會出聲，所以他從不給它定價。你可以憑信仰勾選斗篷，也可以猛搖一下，花錢買個踏實。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:194
msgid ""
"Corvin packs his chests in straw, so nothing clinked at the Wardens' toll. Straw muffles a strength: a gentle shake stirs nothing at all. Shake it firmly."
msgstr "科爾文用稻草把箱子塞得滿滿的，這樣過巡守的關卡時就一聲不響。稻草會悶掉一級力度：輕搖什麼都搖不響。穩搖一下。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:196
msgid ""
"A jingle: what a gentle shake would stir, a firm one stirs through straw. That's all he heard. Now hard: weapons stir through straw only then, and cloaks and spells never."
msgstr "叮噹一聲：輕搖本該搖響的東西，隔著稻草得穩搖才響。他聽到的也就這些。現在猛搖：隔著稻草，兵器要到猛搖才響，而斗篷和法術怎麼也搖不響。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:198
msgid ""
"A clank he never heard. Smugglers love a false bottom, too: lift the chest high and let go."
msgstr "這聲哐啷他可沒聽到。走私販子還最愛夾層：把箱子高高舉起，然後鬆手。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:199
msgid ""
"A hollow BOOM. Tick a weapon and False bottom: he priced neither. Then haggle."
msgstr "空洞的一聲「咚」！勾選一件兵器，再勾選夾層：這兩樣他都沒算錢。然後討價還價。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:211
msgid ""
"Hesper sells dowries from weddings that never were. A Thornwick dowry always holds coin for luck, a cloak for warmth and a potion for health. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr "赫斯珀賣的是沒辦成的婚事留下的嫁妝。荊棘鎮的嫁妝總裝著求好運的錢幣、保暖的斗篷和保健康的藥水。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:213
msgid ""
"A jingle and a flump: luck and warmth. No slosh: the bride warded her potion, silent and weightless. Name it: tick Potions."
msgstr "叮噹一聲，噗的一聲：好運和溫暖。沒有嘩啦聲：新娘用結界封住了她的藥水，無聲又無重。說出它：勾選藥水。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:223 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1006
msgid "a weaver in Thornwick"
msgstr "荊棘鎮的一位織工"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:228
msgid ""
"Flick runs chests for the Magpie: cheap, and in a hurry. Lay a hand on it: shake it, any strength."
msgstr "弗利克替喜鵲跑腿賣箱子：便宜，還急著脫手。把手放上去：搖一搖，什麼力度都行。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:230
msgid ""
"Your mark went cold: it isn't Flick's to sell, and if you buy it, it won't open. Send for the Wardens: Flick runs, the chest goes home, and they pay you a finder's share. Or just pass."
msgstr ""
"你的鑰紋發涼了：這箱子輪不到弗利克來賣，你買下了也打不開。報告巡守：弗利克會逃走，箱子會物歸原主，巡守還會付你一份發現者分成。要不就乾脆不買。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:244
msgid ""
"Ilse reads the Arcanum's packing tag: it lists each kind of thing packed, and the archmages warded the most dangerous. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr "伊爾絲會念秘法院的裝箱標籤：上面列著裝進去的每一類東西，而大法師們把最危險的那件用結界封住了。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:246
msgid ""
"A flump and a rustle: the cloak and the spell. The gem on the tag never tinkled: it's warded. Name it: tick Gems."
msgstr "噗的一聲，沙沙一聲：斗篷和法術。標籤上的寶石卻從沒叮鈴響過：它被結界封住了。說出它：勾選寶石。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:257
msgid ""
"Archmage Orme wagers on your craft: read her chest exactly (every kind, every count) and she gives back a third of the price when it's open. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr "大法師奧姆拿你的手藝打賭：把她的箱子判斷得分毫不差（每一類、每個數目都對），開箱後她就退還三分之一的價錢。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:259
msgid ""
"Tick exactly what you heard, no more and no less. A careful read takes a third off her price."
msgstr "聽到什麼就勾選什麼，不多也不少。判斷得仔細，就能從她的價錢裡省下三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:269
msgid ""
"Durgan's a dwarf: he knows weapons, prices the rest at half, and takes every tinkle for a diamond. Shake it gently yourself."
msgstr "杜爾甘是個矮人：他懂兵器，別的東西一律算半價，每聽到一聲叮鈴都當成鑽石。你自己輕搖一下。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:271
msgid ""
"A tinkle: a gem, and he's priced it like the crown jewels. Offer what it's really worth, or let him keep it."
msgstr "叮鈴一聲：一顆寶石，他卻開出了王室珠寶的價。按它真正的價值出價，要不就讓他自己留著。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:281
msgid ""
"Grandmother Vell left a riddle on each lid about one thing inside, and if she warded something, it's about that. Read it, then shake it at every strength."
msgstr "維爾祖母在每個箱蓋上都留了一道謎語，說的是箱裡的某一樣東西；要是她用結界封住了什麼，謎語說的就是那樣東西。先讀謎語，再每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:283
msgid ""
"A hilt and an edge, or forged and sheathed: a weapon. And nothing clanked: grandmother warded it. Name it: tick Weapons."
msgstr "有柄有鋒，或是火中鍛成、太平入鞘：是兵器。可什麼都沒哐啷響：祖母把它封住了。說出它：勾選兵器。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:297
msgid ""
"Brass sells pawn by the lot, two or three of a kind, and prices one of each kind he hears. Shake it at every strength and count: each thing sounds from its own spot."
msgstr "布拉斯成批賣當品，同一類東西常有兩三件，可他聽到的每一類只算一件的錢。每種力度都搖一遍，再數一數：每樣東西都會從各自的位置發出聲響。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:299
msgid ""
"Two jingles and a rustle: three things, and he priced one purse. But the ticket counts every article pledged, and it says four. He won't have pledges dropped: the fourth is under a false bottom. Tick two Coins and False bottom."
msgstr ""
"兩聲叮噹，一聲沙沙：三樣東西，他卻只算了一袋錢。可當票上把每件當品都記著，寫的是四件。他不許別人摔當品：第四件就在夾層底下。錢幣勾選兩份，再勾選夾層。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:311
msgid ""
"Quire sells the Archive's vault chests with their ward-rolls, faded by three hundred years. The roll names what was warded: 'B_o_d R_b_'."
msgstr "奎爾賣的是檔案館地庫裡的箱子，附帶各自的結界名錄，三百年下來字跡都褪了色。名錄上寫著被封住的東西：「血_寶_」。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:313
msgid ""
"The Blood Ruby: a gem. Name it, and the ward gives it up when you open the chest: tick Gems."
msgstr "血紅寶石：是寶石。說出它，開箱時結界就會交出它：勾選寶石。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:324
msgid ""
"Tilly shakes hard and prices every rustle as a drowned wizard's spellbook. Shake it gently."
msgstr "蒂莉總是猛搖，每聽到一聲沙沙，都按溺亡巫師的法術書定價。輕搖一下。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:325
msgid ""
"A rustle at a gentle shake? Parchment only rustles when it's shaken hard: that's river sand pouring, worth nothing. Tick only the slosh: Potions."
msgstr "輕搖就有沙沙聲？羊皮紙要猛搖才會沙沙響：這是河沙在流淌，一文不值。只勾選嘩啦聲：藥水。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:336
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan wants his grandfather's sword. If there are weapons inside, the best of them goes back to him, for the fee he named. Shake it: is there a clank?"
msgstr "羅文爵士想找回他祖父的劍。箱裡要是有兵器，最好的那件得歸還給他，他會付他說定的那筆錢。搖一搖：有哐啷聲嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:338
msgid ""
"A clank: that blade is his. Count it at his fee, not its worth, and see whether the rest pays for the chest."
msgstr "哐啷一聲：那把劍歸他。按他給的錢算，別按劍本身的價值算，再看看剩下的東西夠不夠抵箱子的價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:350
msgid ""
"An imp, with an hourglass: twelve seconds, from when you close this. Things from the Maw's hoard often beat their colour. Shake it gently, then hard. Quick!"
msgstr "一個拿著沙漏的小惡魔：從你關掉這條提示起，只有十二秒。巨口寶藏裡的東西，品質常常勝過箱子的顏色。先輕搖，再猛搖。快！"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:352
msgid "Gently, then hard!"
msgstr "先輕搖，再猛搖！"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:364
msgid ""
"A devil's bargain: Sallow's price is low, but the dearest thing inside is his. Shake it at every strength: what's in there?"
msgstr "魔鬼的交易：薩洛要價很低，但箱裡最貴重的東西歸他。每種力度都搖一遍：裡面有什麼？"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:366
msgid ""
"Four things: he takes the best, you keep three. With many middling things his bargain is a good one; with one grand thing and little else, it's his."
msgstr "四樣東西：他拿走最好的，你留下三樣。東西多而都不出挑時，他這筆交易對你划算；要是隻有一樣寶貝，別的寥寥無幾，那就是他佔便宜了。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:377
msgid ""
"Skrae clicks like a bat and listens to the echoes: round is coin, long a weapon, soft a cloak, hollow a potion, flat a spell, tiny a gem. Echoes come back off warded things too. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr ""
"斯克雷像蝙蝠那樣發出咔嗒聲，再聽回聲：圓的是錢幣，長的是兵器，軟的是斗篷，空心的是藥水，扁的是法術，小小的是寶石。被結界封住的東西也會彈回回聲。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:380
msgid ""
"A jingle and a clank: the round one and the long one. Nothing sloshed, so the hollow one is warded: tick Potions."
msgstr "叮噹一聲，哐啷一聲：圓的和長的。沒有嘩啦聲，所以空心的那個被結界封住了：勾選藥水。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:391
msgid ""
"Countess Vey prices only her gems, at what she paid for them. Whatever else the maid packed comes free. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr "維伯爵夫人只給她的寶石定價，按她當初買來的價錢。女僕另外裝進去的東西都白送。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:393
msgid ""
"Tick everything you heard: the rest is a gift. Some of her gems are paste, though, and she won't have a lodestone near them."
msgstr "把聽到的全都勾選上：寶石以外的都是白送的。不過她的寶石有些是仿造的，而且她不許磁石靠近它們。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:404
msgid ""
"Madame Zell draws three cards from the Locking's own deck: a suit drawn twice is what the ward holds; three different, nothing. Coins came up twice."
msgstr "澤爾夫人從大封鎖專屬的那副牌裡抽三張：同一花色出現兩次，就是結界裡封著的東西；三張各不相同，就什麼也沒封。錢幣出現了兩次。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:406
msgid "So there's warded coin. Name it: tick Coin."
msgstr "那就是有錢幣被結界封住了。說出它：勾選錢幣。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:416
msgid ""
"Gilt sells demon gold: gilded iron, and it jingles just like the real thing. Turn the lodestone on and shake it gently."
msgstr "吉爾特賣魔金：鍍了金的鐵，叮噹響起來跟真金一模一樣。開啟磁石，再輕搖。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:418
msgid ""
"The jingle went quiet: iron, gilded, worth nothing. The tinkle's real: tick Gems, and leave Coin unticked."
msgstr "叮噹聲沒了：是鍍金的鐵，一文不值。叮鈴聲是真的：勾選寶石，錢幣別勾。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:420
msgid ""
"Gilt sells demon gold, gilded iron, as gold and gems, and it sounds just like the real thing. Only a lodestone can tell. Too cheap to be true, usually."
msgstr "吉爾特把魔金，也就是鍍金的鐵，當作金子和寶石來賣，聽起來跟真貨一模一樣。只有磁石分辨得出。通常便宜得離譜的，就不會是真貨。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:431
msgid ""
"Old Aldo plays a game: his price is whatever your slip says. Read it exactly and he takes a quarter off; read it wrong and you pay what it truly holds, and a quarter more. Shake it at every strength."
msgstr ""
"老奧爾多愛玩個遊戲：你估價單上算出多少，他就要多少。判斷分毫不差，他減價四分之一；判斷錯了，你就得按箱裡的實值付錢，再多付四分之一。每種力度都搖一遍。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:434
msgid ""
"Tick exactly what you heard, then buy. Funny: that ring of his has the royal seal on it."
msgstr "聽到什麼就勾選什麼，然後買下。真怪：他那枚戒指上竟有王室的印記。"

#: scripts/Core/Lessons.cs:444
msgid ""
"That's no merchant, Kit. That's the Maw, in a borrowed body. One coin for the chest; but buy it, and everyone after him today asks twice as much. Count who's still waiting before you say yes."
msgstr ""
"那可不是什麼商人，基特。那是巨口，借了一副軀殼。箱子只要一枚金幣；可你一旦買下，今天在他之後來的人都會要價翻倍。答應之前，先數數還有幾個人在等。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:423
msgid "your slip's worth"
msgstr "你估價單上的總值"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:423
msgid "somewhere"
msgstr "某處"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:447
msgid "The pawn ticket says {0}."
msgstr "當票上寫著：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:449
msgid "The Guild clerk's tally: {0}."
msgstr "公會書記員的清點：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:453
msgid "{0}'s game scale says {1}."
msgstr "{0}的獵物秤顯示{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:459 scripts/Core/Market.cs:487 scripts/Core/Market.cs:535
msgid "nothing at all"
msgstr "一片虛無"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:460
msgid "{0} dreamt of {1}."
msgstr "{0}夢見了{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:465
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "空無一物"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:466
msgid "The Arcanum's tag: packed, {0}."
msgstr "秘法院的標籤上寫著裝有：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:472
msgid "A riddle with no answer: nothing at all."
msgstr "一個沒有謎底的謎語：什麼都沒有。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:472
msgid "Grandmother left no riddle: the box is empty."
msgstr "祖母沒有留下謎語：盒子是空的。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:474
msgid "{0}'s riddle: \"{1}\""
msgstr "{0}的謎語：「{1}」"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:474
msgid "Grandmother"
msgstr "祖母"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:477
msgid "coin for luck, a cloak for warmth and a potion for health"
msgstr "求好運的錢幣、保暖的斗篷和保健康的藥水"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:477
msgid "A Thornwick dowry always holds coin, a cloak and a potion."
msgstr "荊棘鎮的嫁妝總裝著錢幣、一件斗篷和一瓶藥水。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:481
msgid "nothing: it's blank"
msgstr "一片空白，什麼也沒有"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:481
msgid "The ward-roll is blank: nothing was warded."
msgstr "結界名錄是空白的：沒有封住任何東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:482
msgid "The ward-roll, faded: '{0}'."
msgstr "結界名錄，字跡褪色：「{0}」。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:489
msgid "Skrae's echoes: {0}."
msgstr "斯克雷的回聲：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:507
msgid "the {0}"
msgstr "{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:507
msgid "Madame Zell's cards: {0}."
msgstr "澤爾夫人的牌：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:517
msgid "I've a head and a tail, but no body at all."
msgstr "我有正面，也有反面，卻沒有一張臉。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:517
msgid ""
"Round and bright, I pass from hand to hand, and buy the bread and the land."
msgstr "我又圓又亮，在人們手中流傳；買得了麵包，也買得下良田。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:518
msgid "I've a hilt but no hill, and an edge but no cliff."
msgstr "我有柄，卻不是話柄；我有鋒，卻不是山峰。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:518
msgid "Forged in fire, drawn in anger, sheathed in peace."
msgstr "烈火中鍛成，憤怒時出鞘，太平時入鞘。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:519
msgid "I've a hood but no head, and I keep the rain off."
msgstr "我有兜帽，卻沒有頭；下雨天，我替你遮頭。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:519
msgid "I hang in the hall all day, and keep you warm on the road at night."
msgstr "白天我在廳堂裡掛著，夜裡在路上替你保暖。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:520
msgid ""
"I'm poured but I'm not rain, drunk but I'm not wine, and I live in glass."
msgstr "我能倒，卻不是雨；能喝，卻不是酒；我住在玻璃裡。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:520
msgid "Uncork me and I heal; drop me and I'm gone."
msgstr "拔開塞子，我能療傷；失手一摔，我就沒了。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:521
msgid "Read me once and I'm gone; my words do what they say."
msgstr "念我一遍，我就沒了；我寫下的話，說到做到。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:521
msgid "I'm rolled, but I'm not bread; I'm written, but I'm no letter."
msgstr "我能捲起，卻不是捲餅；我寫滿了字，卻不是書信。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:522
msgid ""
"Born in the dark, I shine in the light; the more I'm cut, the more I'm worth."
msgstr "生在黑暗裡，在光亮中閃耀；越是被切割，就越是值錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:522
msgid "Hard as ice, but I never melt; I sleep in a ring of gold."
msgstr "硬得像冰，卻從不融化；我睡在金戒指上。"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:532
msgid "one article"
msgstr "一件物品"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:532
msgid "{0} articles"
msgstr "{0}件物品"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:546
msgid "Heavy as a mule"
msgstr "沉得像頭騾子"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:546
msgid "Light, mind"
msgstr "輕得很，先說好"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:546
msgid "A fair weight"
msgstr "分量適中"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:549
msgid "there's magic in it"
msgstr "裡面有魔力"

#: scripts/Core/Market.cs:549
msgid "there's no magic in it"
msgstr "裡面沒有魔力"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:23
msgid "Kit"
msgstr "基特"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:23
msgid ""
"Bram's niece, who grew up behind his counter, with the Key-mark and his ear for a chest."
msgstr "布拉姆的侄女，在他的櫃檯後長大，生有鑰紋，也有他那副聽箱子的好耳朵。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:26
msgid ""
"Shakes at every strength and drops a chest to hear what's under the floor."
msgstr "每種力度都能搖，還能摔一下箱子，聽出箱底下藏著什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:27
msgid "With tips on, Uncle Bram teaches the trade as each new seller arrives."
msgstr "開啟提示後，每來一位新賣家，布拉姆叔叔都會傳授一招門道。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:29
msgid "Hesk"
msgstr "赫斯克"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:29
msgid ""
"Bram's nephew, a grocer from the river towns, with the Key-mark, a bad back and an honest scale."
msgstr "布拉姆的侄子，河邊小鎮來的雜貨商，生有鑰紋，腰不好，還有一杆公道秤。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:32
msgid "A bad back: he can't shake a chest hard, or lift it to drop it."
msgstr "腰不好：他不能猛搖箱子，也沒法把箱子舉起來摔。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:33
msgid ""
"Every chest sits on his scale: he knows what everything in it weighs, to the half pound."
msgstr "每個箱子都放在他的秤上：箱裡的東西一共多重，他都知道，精確到半磅。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:34
msgid ""
"Coin {0} lb, weapons {1}, cloaks {2}, potions {3}, spells {4}, gems {5}. Demon gold weighs half what gold does; sand is heavier than a scroll."
msgstr "錢幣{0}磅，兵器{1}磅，斗篷{2}磅，藥水{3}磅，法術{4}磅，寶石{5}磅。魔金只有真金一半重；沙子比卷軸重。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:35
msgid "Pay the Guild's third due to unlock."
msgstr "繳納公會第三筆貢金後解鎖。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:36
msgid "Rosa"
msgstr "羅莎"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:36
msgid ""
"Bram's niece from the Crownhold markets. She'd haggle with a statue, and win."
msgstr "布拉姆的侄女，來自王冠堡的集市。跟雕像討價還價，她都能贏。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:39
msgid ""
"Everybody haggles with Rosa: sellers who'd name a fixed price ask high and hear an offer instead."
msgstr "人人都跟羅莎討價還價：本該開一口價的賣家，會開出高價，再聽她還價。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:40
msgid ""
"They know her: they open a little higher and come down a little less. An offer too low gets a second try."
msgstr "他們都認得她：開價高一點，讓價少一點。出價太低的話，還能再試一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:41
msgid ""
"But word gets round: a seller who walks out on her won't come back that week."
msgstr "可訊息傳得快：跟她談崩走人的賣家，那一週都不會再來。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:42
msgid "Clear Bram's debt to unlock."
msgstr "還清布拉姆的債務後解鎖。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:43
msgid "Isolde"
msgstr "伊索爾德"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:43
msgid "Bram's niece by marriage, a lady who has never sold a thing she liked."
msgstr "布拉姆的侄媳，一位貴婦人，凡是她喜歡的東西，從來不肯賣。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:46
msgid "A shelf from the start: she can display {0} things at Bram's stall."
msgstr "開局就有展架：在布拉姆的攤位就能陳列{0}件物品。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:47
msgid ""
"Visitors pay to see her collection: every night, {0}g for every {1} points of exhibition."
msgstr "訪客付錢參觀她的收藏：每晚每{1}點展覽分付{0}金。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:48
msgid ""
"Her collection is not for pawning: on a short night, the Guild can only take her curios."
msgstr "她的收藏不能典當：繳不齊貢金的夜裡，公會只能拿走她的奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:49
msgid "Open the Crown Chest to unlock."
msgstr "開啟王冠寶箱後解鎖。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:72
msgid ""
"Coin {0} lb, weapons {1}, cloaks {2}, potions {3}, spells {4}, gems {5}, a Heartsong {6}."
msgstr "錢幣{0}磅，兵器{1}磅，斗篷{2}磅，藥水{3}磅，法術{4}磅，寶石{5}磅，心歌{6}磅。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:93
msgid "{0} lb"
msgstr "{0}磅"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:164
msgid "Thin crowds"
msgstr "門可羅雀"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:164
msgid "On the last two days of every week, one customer fewer."
msgstr "每週最後兩天，每天少一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:165
msgid ""
"The Guild's collectors ride in the day before the tithe, and nobody wants to be seen at your door while they're about."
msgstr "繳貢金的前一天，公會的收賬人就騎馬進城了，他們在的時候，誰也不想被人看見出現在你店門口。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:166
msgid "Sharp sellers"
msgstr "精明賣家"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:166
msgid ""
"Sellers who haggle hold out for more: the least they'll take is {0} higher."
msgstr "愛討價還價的賣家更不肯鬆口：他們能接受的最低價高出{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:167
msgid ""
"Word's out that the Guild has you by the purse, and sellers think you'll pay what they ask."
msgstr "風聲傳開了，說公會攥著你的錢袋子，賣家們都覺得他們要多少你就會給多少。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:168
msgid "Demon gold about"
msgstr "魔金橫行"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:168
msgid "One coin in ten is demon gold, whoever brings it."
msgstr "不管是誰帶來的錢幣，十枚裡就有一枚是魔金。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:169
msgid ""
"The Gate's cracking wider, and the Maw's gilded iron has spread all over the realm."
msgstr "鍍金之門的裂縫越來越寬，巨口的鍍金鐵已經流遍了整個王國。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:170
msgid "A hurried season"
msgstr "匆忙時節"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:170
msgid "Every seller gives you {0} seconds to decide."
msgstr "每位賣家只給你{0}秒做決定。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:171
msgid ""
"It's harvest time, and nobody can spare more than a moment at your counter."
msgstr "正值收穫時節，誰都沒空在你的櫃檯前多待一會兒。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:172
msgid "Fussy sellers"
msgstr "挑剔賣家"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:172
msgid "Every seller minds a drop: drop their chest and they ask half again."
msgstr "每位賣家都介意摔箱：摔了他們的箱子，價格就漲一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:173
msgid ""
"Old chests are the fashion this year, and everyone's precious about theirs."
msgstr "今年時興老箱子，人人都把自家的箱子當成寶貝。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:174
msgid "Bram's stretched thin"
msgstr "布拉姆捉襟見肘"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:174
msgid "Bram's stash has one dip fewer, and his word is good one time fewer."
msgstr "布拉姆的私房錢少動用一次，他的擔保也少用一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:175
msgid ""
"Bram spent his savings mending the roof, and the Guild has stopped taking his word."
msgstr "布拉姆把積蓄都花在修屋頂上了，公會也不再認他的擔保。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:176
msgid "A lean start"
msgstr "開局拮据"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:176
msgid "You start with half the gold."
msgstr "開局金幣減半。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:177
msgid "The stall's licence cost more than Bram thought."
msgstr "攤位執照比布拉姆想的還貴。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:178
msgid "Nim's raised his prices"
msgstr "尼姆漲價了"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:178
msgid "Nim asks a quarter more for every curio."
msgstr "尼姆的每件奇物都要貴四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:179
msgid "The Guild is hunting Nim this season, and he charges for the risk."
msgstr "這一季公會正在追捕尼姆，他把風險也算進了價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:180
msgid "The Guild's builders"
msgstr "公會的匠人"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:180
msgid "Every upgrade and move costs a quarter more."
msgstr "每項升級和遷店都要貴四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:181
msgid ""
"The Guild says only its own builders may work on a licensed shop, at its own rates."
msgstr "公會說，持照店鋪只許公會自己的匠人施工，價錢也按公會定的來。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:182
msgid "A wet year"
msgstr "多雨之年"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:182
msgid "Every lock has one more pin to pick."
msgstr "每把鎖都要多撬一個鎖銷。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:183
msgid "A wet winter has rusted every old lock in the realm stiff."
msgstr "一個溼冷的冬天，把全國的舊鎖都鏽得死死的。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:184
msgid "Wary regulars"
msgstr "常客生疑"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:184
msgid "The regulars post one commission fewer each week."
msgstr "常客每週少釋出一個委託。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:185
msgid "Folk aren't sure your stall will last, and won't set you errands."
msgstr "大家拿不準你的攤子能不能撐下去，不願託你辦事。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:186
msgid "Nim's lean month"
msgstr "尼姆的淡季"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:186
msgid ""
"Nim's lantern lays out no extra curio: he brings one fewer a night once he brings more than one."
msgstr "尼姆的燈籠不再讓他多擺奇物：一旦他每晚帶來的不止一件，就會少帶一件。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:187
msgid "Pickings have been slim among the Locking's oddments."
msgstr "近來，大封鎖留下的零碎玩意兒裡沒什麼好貨可淘。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:192
msgid "Welcome gifts"
msgstr "見面禮"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:192
msgid "Your first {0} customers hand you their chests for a coin each."
msgstr "你的頭{0}位顧客各以一枚金幣把箱子交給你。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:193
msgid ""
"The crossroads loved Bram, and on your first morning two of his old regulars give you their chests for a lucky penny."
msgstr "十字路口的鄉親們都愛戴布拉姆，你開張的頭一個早上，他的兩位老主顧只收一枚圖吉利的銅板，就把箱子給了你。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:194
msgid "Nim's soft spot"
msgstr "尼姆的偏愛"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:194
msgid "Nim lays out one more curio every night."
msgstr "尼姆每晚多擺出一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:195
msgid "Nim owes Bram a favour, and has decided you're it."
msgstr "尼姆欠布拉姆一個人情，他決定還在你身上。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:196
msgid "Bram's savings"
msgstr "布拉姆的積蓄"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:196
msgid "You start with half as much gold again."
msgstr "開局金幣多一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:197
msgid "Bram sold his old cart, and the money's yours."
msgstr "布拉姆賣掉了他的舊推車，這筆錢歸你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:198
msgid "Bram's old picks"
msgstr "布拉姆的舊撬鎖器"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:198
msgid "You start with the Fine Lockpicks: a wider sweet spot on every lock."
msgstr "開局即擁有精良撬鎖器：每把鎖的綠區都更寬。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:199
msgid "Bram found his old picks at the bottom of a drawer."
msgstr "布拉姆在抽屜底下翻出了他的舊撬鎖器。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:200
msgid "Thornwick wants you"
msgstr "荊棘鎮有請"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:200
msgid "The move to Thornwick Market costs half."
msgstr "遷往荊棘鎮集市只需半價。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:201
msgid ""
"Thornwick's council wants a Keywright in the market, and pays half the rent."
msgstr "荊棘鎮議會希望集市上有位鑰匠，願意替你付一半租金。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:202
msgid "A slow season"
msgstr "悠閒時節"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:202
msgid ""
"Sellers who won't wait give you twice as long, and a rotten chest stands twice the shaking."
msgstr "沒耐心的賣家給你的時間翻倍，朽爛的箱子也能多經得住一倍的搖晃。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:203
msgid "Nobody's in a hurry this year."
msgstr "今年誰都不著急。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:204
msgid "Bram's prepared"
msgstr "布拉姆早有準備"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:204
msgid "Bram's stash has one more dip in it, and his word is good once more."
msgstr "布拉姆的私房錢可以多動用一次，他的擔保也能多用一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:205
msgid ""
"Bram's been putting a little by, and the Guild still owes him a favour."
msgstr "布拉姆一直悄悄攢了點錢，公會也還欠他一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:206
msgid "An honest clerk"
msgstr "正直的書記員"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:206
msgid "On a short night, what you pawn fetches its full price."
msgstr "繳不齊貢金的夜裡，你典當的東西能換得全價。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:207
msgid "The Guild's pawn clerk was at school with your mother."
msgstr "公會管典當的書記員是你母親的老同學。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:208
msgid "A good name"
msgstr "好名聲"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:208
msgid ""
"Hagglers hear you out: an offer that's too low gets a second try, not a slammed door."
msgstr "愛講價的賣家會耐心聽你說完：出價太低還能再試一次，不會當場把門一甩走人。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:209
msgid "Bram's kin have a name for fair dealing."
msgstr "布拉姆的親族向來以買賣公道著稱。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:210
msgid "A lucky charm"
msgstr "幸運護身符"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:210
msgid "After a run of plain finds, your luck turns twice as soon."
msgstr "一連開出平平無奇的東西之後，你轉運會快一倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:211
msgid "Bram tied his mother's old lucky charm to your apron."
msgstr "布拉姆把他母親的舊護身符拴在了你的圍裙上。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:212
msgid "Fair days"
msgstr "太平日子"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:212
msgid "No days of mourning and no Guild assessors in town."
msgstr "沒有哀悼日，城裡也沒有公會估稅員。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:213
msgid ""
"The old Duke's in good health, and the Guild's assessors have their hands full in the capital."
msgstr "老公爵身體硬朗，公會的估稅員們在都城忙得脫不開身。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:214
msgid "Room for more"
msgstr "還有空位"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:214
msgid "Room for one more curio, from the start."
msgstr "開局就多一個奇物欄位。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:215
msgid "Bram cleared out a drawer for your curios."
msgstr "布拉姆為你的奇物騰出了一個抽屜。"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:272
msgid "Guild dues paid ({0} of {1})"
msgstr "已繳公會貢金（{0}/{1}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:276
msgid "Bram's debt cleared"
msgstr "還清布拉姆的債務"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:278
msgid "Days to spare ({0})"
msgstr "提前天數（{0}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:281
msgid "Key shards ({0})"
msgstr "鑰匙碎片（{0}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:282
msgid "The Locking, sung whole"
msgstr "大封鎖之歌，完整唱響"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:283
msgid "Heartsongs ({0})"
msgstr "心歌（{0}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:284
msgid "Moves ({0})"
msgstr "遷店次數（{0}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:285
msgid "Collection ({0} of {1})"
msgstr "收藏（{0}/{1}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:287
msgid "Weeks after the debt ({0})"
msgstr "還清後堅持的週數（{0}）"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:289 scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:90
msgid "The Guild on trial"
msgstr "公會受審"

#: scripts/Core/Meta.cs:291
msgid "Friends made ({0})"
msgstr "結交的朋友（{0}）"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:17
msgid ""
"Goblin picks! Nettle's clan makes them, best in the hills: any lock opens easy as cheese. {price}, and you never forget Nettle."
msgstr "哥布林撬鎖器！蕁麻的部族做的，山裡頭最好：什麼鎖都像切乳酪一樣容易開。{price}，你永遠忘不了蕁麻。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:18
msgid "Hehe! Shiny picks for shiny chests."
msgstr "嘿嘿！亮晶晶的撬鎖器，配亮晶晶的箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:18
msgid "Pah. Nettle comes back. Nettle always comes back."
msgstr "呸。蕁麻會回來的。蕁麻總會回來的。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:20
msgid ""
"The Wardens stamp honest weights on this market. Buyers pay more at a shop with Warden-stamped scales: {price}, stamp and all."
msgstr "巡守給這集市上的公道秤蓋戳。店裡擺著巡守蓋過戳的天平，買家就肯多出錢：{price}，連戳帶秤。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:21
msgid "Stamped and sealed. Keep them honest, Keywright."
msgstr "蓋了戳，封了印。秤可要用得公道，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:21
msgid "Suit yourself. The Wardens' stamp will keep."
msgstr "隨你。巡守的戳記又跑不了。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:23
msgid ""
"The abbey's restorers mend relics three hundred years old. We'd lend you a bench and teach you the craft, for {price}: for the poor, you understand."
msgstr "修道院的修復師能修補三百年的聖物。我們可以借你一張工作臺，再教你這門手藝，只要{price}：都是為了窮人，你明白的。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:24
msgid "Bless you. Brother Anselm will come by to show you."
msgstr "願你蒙福。安塞姆修士會過來教你。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:24
msgid "Another time, then. The bench will wait."
msgstr "那就下次吧。工作臺會等著你。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:26
msgid ""
"My mistress says the Arcanum has a witchlight going spare. Anything enchanted glows by it, and nobody else can see. {price}... she says."
msgstr "我師父說秘法院有一盞巫燈閒著。附魔的東西在它的光下都會發亮，別人誰也看不見。{price}……她是這麼說的。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:27
msgid "Oh good! Don't let it go out: it's older than the Guild."
msgstr "太好了！別讓它熄了：它比公會還老呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:27
msgid "That's all right. I'll ask again when she sends me."
msgstr "沒關係。等她再派我來，我再問你。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:29
msgid ""
"Lantern Lane's auctions would take a Keywright's goods. An auction block in your shop, and buyers bid against each other: {price}."
msgstr "燈籠巷的拍賣會願意收鑰匠的貨。在你店裡擺一座拍賣臺，買家們就會爭相出價：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:30
msgid "Done. My cut is my own business."
msgstr "成交。我抽幾成是我自己的事。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:30
msgid "As you like. Pledges keep, and so do offers."
msgstr "隨你。當品放得住，這提議也放得住。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:32
msgid ""
"My nephew's a journeyman restorer, and he's idle. A dwarf workshop at the back of your shop: {price}, and he works for his keep."
msgstr "我侄子剛出師，是個修復匠，眼下正閒著。在你店後頭開一間矮人工坊：{price}，他幹活只要管吃管住就行。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:33
msgid "Ha! He'll mend things you didn't know were broken."
msgstr "哈！連你不知道壞了的東西，他都能修好。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:33
msgid "Hmph. Ask me again in a few days."
msgstr "哼。過幾天再來問我。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:35
msgid ""
"A lodestone from Ironroot's deep seam. Iron can't stir near it, and the Maw's demon gold is iron under the gilt. {price}. A dwarf knows iron."
msgstr "這是鐵根深層礦脈裡的磁石。鐵在它旁邊動彈不得，而巨口的魔金，鍍金底下就是鐵。{price}。矮人最懂鐵。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:36
msgid "Keep it away from your purse. Ha!"
msgstr "別讓它靠近你的錢袋。哈！"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:36
msgid "It's been in the ground a thousand years. It'll wait."
msgstr "它在地底下待了一千年。再等等也無妨。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:38
msgid ""
"My customers come after dark, friend. Keep your door open at night and they'll come to you too: {price}, and I'll send them round."
msgstr "我的客人都是天黑以後才來，朋友。你晚上開著門，他們也會上你這兒來：{price}，我就把他們介紹過來。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:39
msgid "Wonderful. You'll never know they were mine."
msgstr "好極了。你永遠不會知道他們是我的客人。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:39
msgid "Your loss, friend. The night's long."
msgstr "是你吃虧，朋友。夜還長著呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:41
msgid ""
"A royal warrant. The King... owes me a favour. Hang it over your door and the court will buy from you: {price}, for the Crown's fee."
msgstr "一份皇家認證。國王嘛……欠我個人情。把它掛在你門上，宮裡的人就會來你這兒買東西：{price}，算是王室的規費。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:42
msgid "By appointment to the Crown. Don't let him down."
msgstr "王室御用。別讓他失望。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:42
msgid "Another day, then. The King's patient."
msgstr "那就改日吧。國王很有耐心。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:44
msgid ""
"My clients ask the cards what they want, dear, and then they want it. For {price} I'll send them to you, two more commissions a week."
msgstr "我的客人們會問牌自己想要什麼，親愛的，然後他們就真想要了。付我{price}，我就把他們介紹給你，每週多兩個委託。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:45
msgid "The cards said you would."
msgstr "牌早就說過你會答應。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:45
msgid "The cards said you might not. They'll say otherwise soon."
msgstr "牌說過你可能不會答應。它們很快就會改口的。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:47
msgid ""
"My own restorer, from the palace workshops: the finest hands in Aldmark. I'll lend him to you for {price}. Appearances, you understand."
msgstr "我自家的修復師，出自宮廷工坊：全奧德馬克最巧的一雙手。{price}，我就把他借給你。撐撐場面嘛，你懂的。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:48
msgid "Charming. Do look after him."
msgstr "真迷人。請好好待他。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:48
msgid "How disappointing. I may ask again."
msgstr "真令人失望。我或許會再來問。"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:69 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:532 scripts/Phases/DayEndPhase.cs:211
#: scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:407 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:544
msgid "{0}: {1}"
msgstr "{0}：{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:74
msgid "Buy it ({0}g)"
msgstr "買下（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:83 scripts/Phases/DayEndPhase.cs:453 scripts/Phases/PeddlerPhase.cs:271
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "暫時不要"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:20
msgid "the millpond"
msgstr "磨坊池塘"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:20
msgid "whatever fell in; often nothing at all"
msgstr "掉進去的什麼都有；常常什麼也沒有"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:21
msgid "a farmhouse attic"
msgstr "農舍閣樓"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:21
msgid "savings and Sunday clothes"
msgstr "積蓄和禮拜日的好衣裳"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:22
msgid "a soldier's kitbag"
msgstr "士兵的行囊"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:22 scripts/Core/Origins.cs:37
msgid "weapons and a cloak"
msgstr "兵器和一件斗篷"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:23
msgid "the old battlefield"
msgstr "古戰場"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:23
msgid "weapons, and the coin the dead carried"
msgstr "兵器，還有死者身上帶的錢幣"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:24
msgid "an unpaid tab"
msgstr "一筆賒欠的酒賬"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:24
msgid "a bit of everything"
msgstr "什麼都有一點"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:25
msgid "the Barrow"
msgstr "古冢"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:25
msgid "grave goods: coin, weapons and gems"
msgstr "陪葬品：錢幣、兵器和寶石"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:26
msgid "a goblin burrow"
msgstr "哥布林地洞"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:26
msgid "shinies a clan has dug up: coin, mostly"
msgstr "一個部族挖出來的亮閃閃：大多是錢幣"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:27
msgid "an outlaws' camp"
msgstr "亡命徒營地"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:27
msgid "weapons, purses and potions"
msgstr "兵器、錢袋和藥水"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:28
msgid "a wolf's den"
msgstr "狼窩"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:28
msgid "what the wolves' dinner wore"
msgstr "狼群的晚餐生前的穿戴"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:29
msgid "the Old Wood"
msgstr "古林"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:29
msgid "brews, elven cloaks and spells on birch bark"
msgstr "藥釀、精靈斗篷和寫在樺樹皮上的法術"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:30
msgid "the abbey crypt"
msgstr "修道院地下墓穴"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:30
msgid "holy cloaks, prayer-spells and holy water"
msgstr "聖袍、祈禱法術和聖水"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:31
msgid "the smugglers' road"
msgstr "走私小道"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:31
msgid "brandy and coin, and false bottoms"
msgstr "白蘭地和錢幣，還有夾層"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:32
msgid "the Arcanum stores"
msgstr "秘法院庫房"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:32
msgid "mantles, potions and spellbooks, often enchanted"
msgstr "披風、藥水和法術書，常常附魔"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:33
msgid "a dwarf-hold"
msgstr "矮人要塞"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:33
msgid "weapons and gems"
msgstr "兵器和寶石"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:34
msgid "a noble's strongroom"
msgstr "貴族的密庫"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:34
msgid "coin, gems and fine clothes"
msgstr "錢幣、寶石和華服"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:35
msgid "a forgotten pawn lot"
msgstr "一批被遺忘的當品"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:35
msgid "anything, in twos and threes"
msgstr "什麼都有，成雙成三"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:36
msgid "the Aldwater mud"
msgstr "奧德河的淤泥"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:36
msgid "drowned wizards' potions and spellbooks (and sand)"
msgstr "溺亡巫師的藥水和法術書（還有沙子）"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:37
msgid "a knight's war chest"
msgstr "騎士的戰備箱"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:38
msgid "the Maw's hoard"
msgstr "巨口的寶藏"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:38
msgid "gold and gems (some of it demon gold)"
msgstr "黃金和寶石（其中有些是魔金）"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:39
msgid "the Royal Treasury"
msgstr "皇家寶庫"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:39
msgid "the best of everything"
msgstr "樣樣都是最好的"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:40
msgid "a bride's dowry"
msgstr "新娘的嫁妝"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:40
msgid "coin for luck, a cloak for warmth, a potion for health"
msgstr "求好運的錢幣、保暖的斗篷、保健康的藥水"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:41
msgid "the Archive vaults"
msgstr "檔案館地庫"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:41
msgid "deeds, spellbooks, coin and seals"
msgstr "契據、法術書、錢幣和印章"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:42
msgid "a courtier's chest"
msgstr "朝臣的箱子"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:42
msgid "jewels, fine clothes and purses"
msgstr "珠寶、華服和錢袋"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:43
msgid "a stranger's pocket"
msgstr "陌生人的口袋"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:43
msgid "whatever someone was carrying: purses and trinkets"
msgstr "某人隨身帶的東西：錢袋和小玩意兒"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:45
msgid "a house taken for tithe"
msgstr "因貢金被查封的人家"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:45
msgid "a family's savings: coin, cloaks and the good silver"
msgstr "一戶人家的積蓄：錢幣、斗篷和壓箱底的銀器"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:46
msgid "the Wardens' store"
msgstr "巡守的庫房"

#: scripts/Core/Origins.cs:46
msgid "whatever thieves took and nobody came back for"
msgstr "賊偷走後、一直沒人回來認領的東西"

#: scripts/Core/Random.cs:35 scripts/Phases/DayEndPhase.cs:84 scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:187
#: scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:194
msgid "{0}g"
msgstr "{0}金"

#: scripts/Core/Random.cs:37
msgid "one coin"
msgstr "一枚金幣"

#: scripts/Core/Random.cs:37
msgid "{0} gold"
msgstr "{0}金幣"

#: scripts/Core/Run.cs:332
msgid "The Crown Chest."
msgstr "王冠寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Save.cs:247
msgid "Week {0}, day {1}, {2}, {3}g"
msgstr "第{0}周第{1}天，{2}，{3}金"

#: scripts/Core/Save.cs:457
msgid "Best: week {0}   Debts cleared: {1}{2}   Crown Chests opened: {3}{4}"
msgstr "最遠：第{0}周   還清債務：{1}次{2}   開啟王冠寶箱：{3}次{4}"

#: scripts/Core/Save.cs:457
msgid " (fastest: day {0})"
msgstr "（最快：第{0}天）"

#: scripts/Core/Save.cs:457
msgid "   Heartsongs: {0}/{1}"
msgstr "   心歌：{0}/{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:163
msgid "{price}, now."
msgstr "現在要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:195 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:472
msgid "Done."
msgstr "成交。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:195
msgid "Pleasure."
msgstr "合作愉快。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:196
msgid "{price}, and that's my last word."
msgstr "{price}，不能再少了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:197
msgid "More than that, surely."
msgstr "總得比這多吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:198
msgid "Forget it, then."
msgstr "那就算了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:201 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:204
msgid "Careful! That'll cost you extra."
msgstr "小心！這得加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:284
msgid "listens ({0})"
msgstr "{0}搖聽聲"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:285
msgid "listens gently, then hard"
msgstr "先輕搖再猛搖聽聲"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:286
msgid "counts the rattles"
msgstr "數響聲"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:287
msgid "goes by weight"
msgstr "看重量"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:288
msgid "goes by the chest's colour"
msgstr "看寶箱顏色"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:289
msgid "dreams up a price"
msgstr "夢裡定價"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:290
msgid "knows only weapons"
msgstr "只懂兵器"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:291
msgid "knows only her own gems"
msgstr "只認得自己的寶石"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:292
msgid "has no idea"
msgstr "一無所知"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:293
msgid "knows exactly"
msgstr "一清二楚"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:303
msgid "{0} priced what's heard at a {1} shake."
msgstr "{0}按{1}搖時聽到的東西定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:304
msgid "{0} priced what's heard gently and hard."
msgstr "{0}按輕搖和猛搖時聽到的東西定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:305
msgid "{0} priced each rattle at a {1} shake alike."
msgstr "{0}{1}搖後數響聲，每聲同價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:306
msgid "{0} priced it by the pound."
msgstr "{0}按磅數定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:307
msgid "{0} priced it by the chest's colour."
msgstr "{0}按寶箱顏色定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:308
msgid "{0}'s price came from a dream."
msgstr "{0}的價格來自一場夢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:309
msgid ""
"{0} priced a hard shake: weapons in full, gems as diamonds, the rest at half."
msgstr "{0}按猛搖定價：兵器算全價，寶石全當鑽石，其餘算半價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:310
msgid "{0} priced only her own gems."
msgstr "{0}只給她自己的寶石定了價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:311
msgid "{0} has no idea what's inside."
msgstr "{0}完全不知道里面有什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:312
msgid "{0} priced everything in it as real."
msgstr "{0}把裡面的東西全當真貨定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:335
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "隨你便。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:335 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:562
msgid "Your loss."
msgstr "是你吃虧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:335
msgid "Another time, then."
msgstr "那就下次吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:338
msgid "Careful with that!"
msgstr "小心點！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:338
msgid "Mind the floor!"
msgstr "當心地板！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:338
msgid "Easy!"
msgstr "輕點！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:352
msgid "Pip Hollow"
msgstr "皮普·霍洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:352
msgid "Pip"
msgstr "皮普"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:354
msgid ""
"A coin for his mother, and to be left alone. He has the Key-mark, and doesn't know what it means."
msgstr "給媽媽掙幾個錢，也希望沒人來煩他。他有鑰紋，卻不知道那意味著什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:356
msgid ""
"Fished it out of the millpond! Mum says never shake things, so I didn't. What'll you give me?"
msgstr "從磨坊池塘裡撈上來的！媽媽說千萬別亂搖東西，所以我沒搖。你給我多少？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:357
msgid ""
"It was stuck in the mill wheel. Mum does the mill's washing, and it came up in a sheet! How much will you give me?"
msgstr "它卡在磨坊的水車上。媽媽給磨坊洗衣服，它是裹在床單裡冒出來的！你給我多少錢？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:358
msgid ""
"It was under Gran's bed. She says I can sell it if it buys Mum's soap. What's it worth?"
msgstr "它在奶奶床底下。奶奶說，要是能換來媽媽的肥皂，我就可以賣掉它。它值多少錢？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:359
msgid ""
"Found it in the hayloft, behind the cat. The cat didn't want it. How much?"
msgstr "在乾草棚裡找到的，就在貓後頭。貓不要它。多少錢？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:360
msgid ""
"A washerwoman's boy of nine who fishes chests out of the millpond and never shakes them: he has no idea what's in one, and asks you to name a price. A few coins will do, but a millpond chest is sometimes empty."
msgstr ""
"洗衣婦家九歲的兒子，常從磨坊池塘裡撈箱子，卻從來不搖：他完全不知道里面有什麼，會請你出價。給幾枚金幣就夠了，不過池塘裡撈上來的箱子有時是空的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:362
msgid "Yes! Mum can have new soap!"
msgstr "太好了！媽媽能買新肥皂了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:362
msgid "Really? Thanks, mister!"
msgstr "真的嗎？謝謝老闆！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:363
msgid "Is that all? Um... a bit more?"
msgstr "就這麼點？嗯……再多一點？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:363
msgid "Mum says don't take the first offer."
msgstr "媽媽說，別接受第一個出價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:364
msgid "Aww. I'll ask at the Crossed Keys."
msgstr "唉。那我去交鑰酒館問問。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:364
msgid "Never mind. Gran will have it back."
msgstr "算了。奶奶會收回去的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:365
msgid "Aww. Okay."
msgstr "唉。好吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:365
msgid "I'll throw it back, then."
msgstr "那我把它扔回去好了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:366
msgid "Hey! That's MY chest!"
msgstr "喂！那可是我的箱子！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:366
msgid "Whoa! Do it again!"
msgstr "哇！再來一次！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:367
msgid "You dropped it! Now it costs more!"
msgstr "你把它摔了！現在要加錢！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:371
msgid "Ada Kettle"
msgstr "艾達·凱特爾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:371
msgid "Ada"
msgstr "艾達"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:373
msgid ""
"To buy her son Jory out of the Guild's debt-house, where he's working off his father's tithe."
msgstr "把兒子喬裡從公會的債務監獄贖出來，他正在那兒做苦工，抵他父親欠的貢金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:374 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:484 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:537
msgid "Right-handed."
msgstr "慣用右手。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:374
msgid "Hands red from the washtub, no ink."
msgstr "雙手被洗衣盆泡得通紅，沒有墨跡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:374
msgid "Wooden clogs."
msgstr "穿木鞋。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:376
msgid ""
"My Rafe's soldiering chest. Only a gentle shake: I couldn't bear to hear his things rattle. {price}, for Jory's debt?"
msgstr "這是我家雷夫當兵時的箱子。我只輕輕搖了搖：聽著他的東西在裡頭亂響，我受不了。{price}，給喬裡還債，行嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:377
msgid ""
"Rafe carried this through two wars. A gentle shake was all I could bear. {price} would help my Jory."
msgstr "雷夫帶著它打過兩場仗。我只忍心輕輕搖一下。{price}就能幫上我家喬裡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:378
msgid ""
"From the attic, dear. Just a gentle shake: my wrists aren't what they were. {price}? Every coin's for Jory."
msgstr "從閣樓上拿來的，孩子。只輕輕搖了搖：我這手腕不比從前了。{price}？每一枚都是給喬裡的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:379
msgid ""
"A soldier's widow selling her husband's things to free her son from the Guild's debt-house. She only ever shakes a chest gently, so what's heavy (a weapon) or soft (a cloak) never makes a sound for her, and she doesn't price it. A soldier's kitbag usually holds both."
msgstr ""
"一位士兵的遺孀，變賣亡夫的遺物，想把兒子從公會的債務監獄贖出來。她搖箱子向來只輕搖，所以沉的東西（兵器）和軟的東西（斗篷）在她手裡從不出聲，她也就不算錢。士兵的行囊裡通常兩樣都有。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:382
msgid "Thank you, dear. That's a week off Jory's debt."
msgstr "謝謝你，孩子。喬裡的債又能少一週了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:382
msgid "Bless you. Rafe would have liked you."
msgstr "老天保佑你。雷夫會喜歡你的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:383
msgid "I'm sorry, dear, I can't stand here all day."
msgstr "抱歉，孩子，我不能在這兒站一整天。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:383
msgid "I'll come back when you're less busy."
msgstr "等你不忙了我再來。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:384
msgid "That's all right, dear. I'll keep it a while longer."
msgstr "沒關係，孩子。我再留它一陣子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:384
msgid "Never mind. It was good of you to look."
msgstr "沒關係。謝謝你肯看一看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:385
msgid "Oh! Gently, dear, please."
msgstr "哎呀！輕點，孩子，求你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:385
msgid "Oh my. Those were Rafe's things."
msgstr "天哪。那可是雷夫的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:386
msgid "Those were Rafe's things! I'm sorry, but I'll want more now."
msgstr "那可是雷夫的東西！對不住，現在我得多要點錢了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:390
msgid "Garrick Thorne"
msgstr "加里克·索恩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:390
msgid "Garrick"
msgstr "加里克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:392
msgid ""
"His rent paid before the Guild's bailiffs come for Brindle Field, which his family's ploughed for two hundred years."
msgstr "趕在公會的法警來收布林德爾田之前交上租子，那塊地他家已經耕了兩百年。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:393
msgid ""
"Ploughed it up on Brindle Field, where the last battle was. Shook it hard, like the hay. {price}, and it's the rent!"
msgstr "在布林德爾田裡犁出來的，最後那場大仗就是在那兒打的。我像抖乾草一樣使勁搖過了。{price}，就夠交租了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:394
msgid ""
"Every spring that field coughs up another one. Shook it like a sack of turnips. {price}: the bailiffs won't wait."
msgstr "那塊地每年開春都要再吐出一隻來。我像搖一麻袋蘿蔔那樣搖過了。{price}：法警可不等人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:395
msgid ""
"A farmer who ploughs chests up out of Brindle Field, the old battlefield, and shakes them hard, so a clanking weapon drowns out any coin for him. He haggles, and starts at about twice what he'll take."
msgstr "一個農夫，常從布林德爾田那片古戰場裡犁出箱子。他總是猛搖，所以在他聽來，兵器的哐啷聲會蓋過所有錢幣聲。他愛討價還價，開價大約是他底價的兩倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:397
msgid "Deal! That's the rent, near enough."
msgstr "成交！租子差不多夠了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:397
msgid "Done! The bailiffs can whistle."
msgstr "成交！讓那幫法警喝西北風去吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:398
msgid "Hmm. {price}, and that's my last word."
msgstr "嗯。{price}，不能再少了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:398
msgid "The rent won't pay itself. {price}."
msgstr "租子可不會自己交上去。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:399
msgid "Daylight robbery! Forget it."
msgstr "這簡直是明搶！算了吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:399
msgid "I've cows to milk. Good day."
msgstr "我還得回去擠奶。告辭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:400
msgid "Your loss. Field's full of them."
msgstr "是你吃虧。地裡多的是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:400
msgid "Suit yourself. I'll be back after the next ploughing."
msgstr "隨你。等下回犁完地我再來。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:401
msgid "Steady on! It's not a sack of spuds."
msgstr "悠著點！這又不是一麻袋蘿蔔。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:401
msgid "Ha! Mind your toes."
msgstr "哈！當心你的腳趾頭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:402
msgid "Easy with my chest! That'll cost you extra."
msgstr "輕點對待我的箱子！這得加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:406
msgid "Bettany Crane"
msgstr "貝塔妮·克雷恩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:406
msgid "Bettany"
msgstr "貝塔妮"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:408
msgid ""
"To keep the Crossed Keys, and her secrets. Everyone's news passes through her taproom first."
msgstr "守住交鑰酒館，也守住她的秘密。人人的訊息都先從她的酒館經過。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:409
msgid "Pulls pints left-handed."
msgstr "用左手打酒。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:409
msgid "Ink on her fingers from the tally."
msgstr "手指上沾著記賬的墨跡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:409
msgid "Wears house slippers; never rides."
msgstr "穿家居拖鞋；從不騎馬。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:410
msgid ""
"Some adventurer left this for his tab at the Crossed Keys. Firm shake, and I counted the rattles. So much a rattle: {price}."
msgstr "有個冒險家把它留在交鑰酒館抵酒賬。我穩搖了一下，數了數響聲。一響一個價：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:411
msgid ""
"Three nights' ale and a broken bench, paid in chest. I charge by the rattle, love: {price}. And I've news, if you're buying."
msgstr "三晚的麥酒錢，外加一條坐壞的長凳，拿箱子抵的賬。我按響聲收錢，親愛的：{price}。我這兒還有訊息，要買儘管開口。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:412
msgid ""
"Keeps the Crossed Keys at the crossroads, takes chests for unpaid tabs, and hears everything first. She gives one a firm shake, counts the rattles, and charges the same for each, whatever's rattling: a goblin cleaver costs what a purse of coin does."
msgstr ""
"在十字路口開交鑰酒館，收箱子抵賒欠的酒賬，什麼訊息都最先聽到。她把箱子穩搖一下，數數有幾聲響，每聲收一樣的錢，不管響的是什麼：一把哥布林砍刀和一袋錢幣一個價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:414
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "跟你做生意真痛快！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:414
msgid "Done, love. Come by for a pint, and the news."
msgstr "成交，親愛的。有空來喝一杯，順便聽聽訊息。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:415
msgid "I've a taproom to run, love. Another time."
msgstr "我還得照看酒館呢，親愛的。改天吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:416
msgid "Suit yourself, love. Someone'll have it."
msgstr "隨你，親愛的。總有人會要的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:416
msgid "Fair enough. I'll stick it behind the bar."
msgstr "行吧。我把它塞到吧檯後面去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:417
msgid "Oi! I'll want that back in one piece."
msgstr "喂！還我的時候可得完好無損。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:417
msgid "Mind my floor, love."
msgstr "當心我的地板，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:418
msgid "Oi! You break it, you pay for it, love. Half again."
msgstr "喂！弄壞了就得賠，親愛的。價錢漲一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:422
msgid "Tobin Reed"
msgstr "託賓·裡德"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:422
msgid "Tobin"
msgstr "託賓"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:424
msgid ""
"One big find, to clear the Guild's claim on his father's tithe and never go down the Barrow again."
msgstr "挖到一件大寶貝，還清公會向他父親追討的貢金，從此再也不下古冢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:425
msgid ""
"Dragged it up from the Barrow's second vault. The damp's got into the wood: go easy, it won't stand much. {price}."
msgstr "從古冢第二層墓室拖上來的。木頭已經受潮了：輕點，它經不起折騰。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:426
msgid ""
"From the Barrow. Lost my torch and my nerve down there, but I kept the chest. It's half rotten. {price}, for the Guild."
msgstr "古冢裡來的。我在下面丟了火把，也丟了膽子，可箱子沒丟。它已經朽了一半。{price}，是要交給公會的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:427
msgid ""
"I ran from a barrow-wight for this, so it's yours for {price}. Careful: it's falling apart."
msgstr "為了它，我被古冢屍妖追著跑，所以只要{price}，它就歸你。小心：它快散架了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:428
msgid ""
"A young delver who goes down the Barrow to pay what the Guild says his father owed. Prices a chest by its colour and never shakes it: Barrow chests are so rotten they stand about two seconds of shaking before they start to come apart. Grave goods: coin, weapons, gems."
msgstr ""
"一個年輕的探墓人，下古冢挖寶，好還上公會說他父親欠下的債。他按箱子的顏色定價，從來不搖：古冢的箱子朽得厲害，搖上大約兩秒就會開始散架。陪葬品：錢幣、兵器、寶石。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:431
msgid "That's another week the Guild leaves me be."
msgstr "公會又能放過我一週了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:431
msgid "Right. Back to the Barrow."
msgstr "好了。回古冢去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:432
msgid "Sorry, I've a barrow to get back to."
msgstr "抱歉，我得回古冢了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:433
msgid "Fair enough. Someone at the Crossed Keys will want it."
msgstr "也行。交鑰酒館總會有人要的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:433
msgid "Oh well. More where that came from."
msgstr "算了。那兒還多的是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:434
msgid "Careful, it's rotten!"
msgstr "小心，它都朽了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:434
msgid "Whoa! It'll fall apart!"
msgstr "哇！它會散架的！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:435
msgid "It's held together with damp and hope! You'll pay more for that."
msgstr "它全靠潮氣和指望撐著呢！你得為這個多付錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:441 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:441
msgid "Nettle"
msgstr "蕁麻"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:443
msgid ""
"Her clan cleared of every theft in Thornwick, and a burrow with a door: a goblin's worth is the chests she keeps."
msgstr "為她的部族洗清荊棘鎮每一樁偷竊的嫌疑，再換個帶門的地洞：哥布林的身價，就看她守著多少箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:444
msgid ""
"From our burrow. Not stolen! Goblins get the blame for everything. Gentle shake, only gentle. {price}. Looking is free. Looking more, not free!"
msgstr "我們地洞裡來的。不是偷的！什麼壞事都賴哥布林。輕搖，只能輕搖。{price}。看看，免費。多看，不免費！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:445
msgid ""
"Nettle's clan dug it up fair and square. Gentle shake only. {price}. You want to shake more? You pay more!"
msgstr "蕁麻的部族挖出來的，光明正大。只許輕搖。{price}。你想多搖？你多付錢！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:446
msgid ""
"Burrow chest. Smells of goblin. Is fine. {price}, and more every time you shake it different."
msgstr "地洞箱子。有哥布林味。沒事。{price}，你每換一種搖法，就多加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:447
msgid "Ooh, you like! Price go up: {price}."
msgstr "哦哦，你喜歡！價錢漲：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:447
msgid "More shaking, more gold! {price}."
msgstr "多搖，多給金子！{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:447
msgid "Hehe. {price} now."
msgstr "嘿嘿。現在{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:448
msgid ""
"A goblin of the hills, trading chests out of her clan's burrow (fairly: she'll tell you so). She only shakes gently, so she never prices what a gentle shake can't stir, and goblins charge for everything, looking included: each strength you try after your first puts her price up a tenth."
msgstr ""
"山裡的哥布林，拿她部族地洞裡的箱子做買賣（來路正當：她會這麼告訴你）。她只輕搖，所以輕搖搖不響的東西她從不算錢；而哥布林什麼都收錢，連看都要錢：你試過第一種力度後，每多試一種，她就漲價一成。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:451
msgid "Shiny! Shiny!"
msgstr "亮晶晶！亮晶晶！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:451
msgid "Hehehe. Nettle's burrow gets a door!"
msgstr "嘿嘿嘿。蕁麻的地洞要裝門啦！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:452
msgid "Pah! Nettle has other customers."
msgstr "呸！蕁麻還有別的客人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:453
msgid "Pah! Nettle sell it to someone with eyes."
msgstr "呸！蕁麻賣給長眼睛的人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:453
msgid "Your loss. Nettle's gain. Nettle always gains."
msgstr "你虧。蕁麻賺。蕁麻總是賺。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:454
msgid "Eek! Nettle's chest!"
msgstr "咿！蕁麻的箱子！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:454
msgid "Hehe, again! Again!"
msgstr "嘿嘿，再來！再來！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:455
msgid "You drop Nettle's chest? Price go up!"
msgstr "你摔蕁麻的箱子？價錢漲！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:459
msgid "Rook Varga"
msgstr "魯克·瓦爾加"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:459
msgid "Rook"
msgstr "魯克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:462
msgid "The Magpie's bounty, the biggest the Wardens have ever posted."
msgstr "拿下喜鵲的懸賞，那是巡守開出過的最大一筆賞金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:463
msgid "Draws her bow left-handed."
msgstr "用左手拉弓。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:463
msgid "A hunter's clean hands: no ink."
msgstr "獵人的手很乾淨：沒有墨跡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:463
msgid "Rides in boots."
msgstr "穿靴子騎馬。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:465
msgid ""
"Took it off an outlaws' camp on the forest road, for the Wardens' bounty. My scale says {pounds}. {price}. Gently: the mare spooks."
msgstr "從林間大道上的亡命徒營地繳來的，為了領巡守的賞金。我的秤上是{pounds}。{price}。輕點：母馬容易受驚。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:466
msgid ""
"The outlaws won't be needing it. {pounds} on my scale, and I price by the pound: {price}."
msgstr "那幫亡命徒用不著它了。秤上是{pounds}，我按磅定價：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:467
msgid ""
"Found it in a wolf den. The wolves had eaten whoever was carrying it. {pounds} on my scale. {price}."
msgstr "在狼窩裡找到的。帶著它的人被狼吃了。秤上是{pounds}。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:468
msgid ""
"Wolves don't hoard, but their dinners did. {pounds}, to the half pound. {price}. Easy with it: the mare."
msgstr "狼不囤東西，可它們的晚餐生前會囤。{pounds}，精確到半磅。{price}。輕著點：當心母馬。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:469
msgid ""
"A huntress who takes the Wardens' bounties, and sells what the outlaws had. She weighs every chest on her game scale and prices it by the pound, so light things (spells, gems) come cheap. Her chests hang on a mare who bolts at a hard shake: take the weight of what you heard from the scale's, and what's left is what never stirred."
msgstr ""
"領巡守懸賞的女獵人，把亡命徒的東西拿來賣。她把每個箱子放在獵物秤上稱，按磅數定價，所以輕的東西（法術、寶石）就很便宜。她的箱子馱在一匹母馬身上，馬一遇猛搖就會驚跑：從秤上的重量裡減去你聽到的東西的重量，剩下的就是從沒被搖響的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:472
msgid "Good hunting."
msgstr "祝你狩獵順利。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:473
msgid "The mare's restless. I'm off."
msgstr "母馬不安分了。我走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:474
msgid "No matter. It'll sell at the next market."
msgstr "無所謂。下個集市就能賣掉。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:474 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:594
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "也行。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:475
msgid "Easy! You'll have the mare bolting."
msgstr "輕點！你會把母馬嚇跑的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:475 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:595
msgid "Steady."
msgstr "穩著點。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:476
msgid "Easy! You've upset the mare, and me. Half again."
msgstr "輕點！你驚著了我的馬，也惹惱了我。加價一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:480
msgid "Mother Sorrel"
msgstr "索蕾爾婆婆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:480
msgid "Sorrel"
msgstr "索蕾爾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:483
msgid "To keep the Guild's axes out of the Old Wood."
msgstr "不讓公會的斧頭砍進古林。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:484
msgid "Fingers green from her herbs."
msgstr "手指被草藥染得發綠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:484
msgid "Goes barefoot, always."
msgstr "總是赤著腳。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:485
msgid ""
"The Old Wood let this one go. I slept beside it and dreamt of {dream}. The oaks whispered its price: {price}."
msgstr "古林放走了這一隻。我在它旁邊睡了一覺，夢見了{dream}。橡樹低聲說出了它的價錢：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:486
msgid ""
"Moss grew on it for a hundred years. Last night I dreamt of {dream}, and of a price: {price}."
msgstr "它身上長了一百年的青苔。昨夜我夢見了{dream}，也夢見了一個價錢：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:487
msgid ""
"The Old Wood's druid at Thornwick. Her price comes to her in a dream, and she always dreams true, in signs: of what the Wood warded in the chest, or else of the dearest thing in it. A magpie is coin, a thorn a weapon, a raven's wing a cloak, a river a potion, an owl a spell, a star a gem. If you can't hear what she dreamt of, it's warded: name it."
msgstr ""
"古林在荊棘鎮的德魯伊。她的價錢來自夢中，而她的夢總會應驗，以徵兆的形式出現：夢見的是古林在箱中用結界封住的東西，沒有的話，就是箱裡最貴重的東西。喜鵲是錢幣，尖刺是兵器，渡鴉羽翼是斗篷，河是藥水，貓頭鷹是法術，星星是寶石。要是你聽不到她夢見的東西，它就被結界封住了：說出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:490
msgid "As the Wood wills."
msgstr "一切順從古林之意。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:490
msgid "The oaks approve."
msgstr "橡樹們點頭了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:491
msgid "The Wood is calling me home."
msgstr "古林在喚我回去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:492
msgid "The Wood is patient. So am I."
msgstr "古林很有耐心。我也是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:492
msgid "Then it wasn't meant for you. Not yet."
msgstr "那它本就不屬於你。至少現在還不是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:493
msgid "Mind the moss, child."
msgstr "當心青苔，孩子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:493
msgid "The Wood felt that."
msgstr "古林感覺到了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:494
msgid "The Wood felt that, child. So will your purse."
msgstr "古林感覺到了，孩子。你的錢袋也會感覺到的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:498
msgid "Brother Cadoc"
msgstr "卡多克修士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:498
msgid "Cadoc"
msgstr "卡多克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:500
msgid ""
"Bread for the poor at the abbey gate, and the Unopened kept off its steps."
msgstr "讓修道院門口的窮人有麵包吃，也別讓未啟派踏上修道院的臺階。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:501
msgid ""
"From the crypt of Saint Ide, by the Abbot's leave. A firm shake, but not hard, please: the saints are resting. {price}, for the poor."
msgstr "出自聖伊德的墓穴，已得院長許可。穩搖即可，請別猛搖：聖徒們正在安息。{price}，為了窮人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:502
msgid ""
"A brother's reliquary, three hundred years asleep. I gave it a firm shake, as is seemly. {price} feeds the gate for a week."
msgstr "一位修士的聖物箱，沉睡了三百年。我按禮數穩搖了一下。{price}，夠修道院門前的窮人吃上一週。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:503
msgid ""
"The almoner of the abbey of Saint Ide, selling the crypt's chests to feed the poor at its gate. He shakes a chest firmly and won't have it shaken hard (half again if you do), so the holy cloaks a crypt chest is full of never make a sound for him, and go unpriced."
msgstr ""
"聖伊德修道院的施賑修士，變賣墓穴裡的箱子，好讓修道院門前的窮人吃飽。他搖箱子用穩搖，也不許別人猛搖（你若猛搖，價格漲一半），所以墓穴箱子裡滿滿的聖袍在他手裡從不出聲，也就沒算進價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:506
msgid "Bless you. The gate eats tonight."
msgstr "願你蒙福。今晚門前的窮人有飯吃了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:506
msgid "Saint Ide thanks you."
msgstr "聖伊德感謝你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:507 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:511
msgid "Brother! The saints! Half again, for the sacrilege."
msgstr "弟兄！聖徒們啊！褻瀆聖物，價格漲一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:508
msgid "Forgive me, I'm due at vespers."
msgstr "請原諒，我得去做晚禱了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:509
msgid "Another day, perhaps. The poor are patient. They have to be."
msgstr "或許改日吧。窮人很有耐心。他們也只能耐心。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:509
msgid "Peace be with you."
msgstr "願你平安。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:510
msgid "Brother! Gently!"
msgstr "弟兄！輕一點！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:510
msgid "Oh! Saint Ide preserve us."
msgstr "哦！聖伊德保佑。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:515
msgid "Corvin Tallow"
msgstr "科爾文·塔洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:515
msgid "Corvin"
msgstr "科爾文"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:518
msgid ""
"One more good season on the smugglers' road, and then a boat, and the sea."
msgstr "在走私小道上再幹一個好季節，然後買條船，出海去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:519
msgid ""
"Packed in straw, so nothing clinked at the Wardens' toll. I gave it a firm shake. {price}, and no questions."
msgstr "塞滿了稻草，過巡守關卡時一聲都沒響。我穩搖過了。{price}，什麼都別問。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:520
msgid ""
"Came up the smugglers' road. Don't ask whose. The straw muffles everything, but I gave it a firm shake. {price}."
msgstr "從走私小道上來的。別問是誰的。稻草把聲音全悶住了，不過我穩搖過。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:521
msgid ""
"Runs brandy and chests past the Wardens' toll on the forest road, every chest packed in straw so nothing clinks: everything in it needs a strength harder to stir, and cloaks and spells won't stir at all. A firm shake, never a drop, and smugglers love a false bottom. Haggles. Now and then a chest he carries isn't his to sell."
msgstr ""
"在林間大道上把白蘭地和箱子偷運過巡守的關卡，每個箱子都塞滿稻草，免得叮噹作響：裡面的東西都要多用一級力度才搖得響，斗篷和法術則怎麼也搖不響。他只穩搖，從不摔箱子，而走私販子最愛夾層。愛討價還價。他帶來的箱子，偶爾不歸他賣。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:524
msgid "Pleasure. We never met."
msgstr "合作愉快。咱們從沒見過。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:524
msgid "Done. Mind the Wardens."
msgstr "成交。當心巡守。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:525
msgid "{price}, and you're robbing me."
msgstr "{price}，你這是在搶我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:525
msgid "Tch. {price}, final."
msgstr "嘖。{price}，最後的價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:526
msgid "Hmph. Plenty of other buyers."
msgstr "哼。買家多得是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:526
msgid "I've a wagon to catch."
msgstr "我還得趕馬車。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:527
msgid "Your loss. I was never here."
msgstr "是你吃虧。我從沒來過。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:527
msgid "Suit yourself. Forget my face."
msgstr "隨你。忘了我這張臉。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:528
msgid "Quiet! Do you want the Wardens round?"
msgstr "小聲點！你想把巡守招來嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:528
msgid "Easy. That's straw, not stone."
msgstr "輕點。裡面是稻草，不是石頭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:529
msgid "Quiet, you fool! That noise will cost you."
msgstr "小聲點，蠢貨！這動靜可得加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:533
msgid "Aunt Hesper"
msgstr "赫斯珀姑媽"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:533
msgid "Hesper"
msgstr "赫斯珀"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:536
msgid ""
"To marry off the whole county, and to know whose chests are whose: a matchmaker keeps every family's accounts."
msgstr "把全郡的人都撮合成親，還要弄清哪個箱子是誰家的：媒婆可是每戶人家的賬都記著。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:537
msgid "Ink on her fingers from the marriage contracts."
msgstr "手指上沾著婚約的墨跡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:537
msgid "Rides her pony in boots, village to village."
msgstr "穿著靴子騎小馬，走村串鄉。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:538
msgid ""
"A dowry, love, from a wedding that never was: {clue}, as ever. Shaken hard: {price}."
msgstr "一份嫁妝，親愛的，那場婚事沒辦成：照例裝著{clue}。猛搖過了：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:539
msgid ""
"The groom ran off to the Barrow. Her dowry: {clue}. Shaken hard: {price}. I've another match for her already."
msgstr "新郎跑去古冢了。她的嫁妝：{clue}。猛搖過了：{price}。我已經給她另說了一門親。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:540
msgid ""
"Thornwick's matchmaker, selling dowries from weddings that never happened. A Thornwick dowry always holds coin for luck, a cloak for warmth and a potion for health, and a bride often wards one of the three: whichever you can't hear is the warded one. Hesper shakes hard and prices what she hears, never what's warded."
msgstr ""
"荊棘鎮的媒婆，賣的是沒辦成的婚事留下的嫁妝。荊棘鎮的嫁妝總裝著求好運的錢幣、保暖的斗篷和保健康的藥水，新娘常會用結界封住其中一樣：哪樣你聽不到，哪樣就是被封住的。赫斯珀猛搖箱子，按聽到的定價，從不算被封住的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:543
msgid "May it bring you luck."
msgstr "願它給你帶來好運。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:543
msgid "Mind you use it well, love."
msgstr "可要好好用它，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:544
msgid "I've a match to make, love. Toodle-oo."
msgstr "我還要去說媒呢，親愛的。回見啦。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:545
msgid "Ah well. There's always another wedding."
msgstr "唉，算了。總會有下一場婚禮的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:545
msgid "Not to your taste? Nor was the groom to hers."
msgstr "不合你的口味？那新郎也不合她的口味。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:546
msgid "Mind the bride's things, love!"
msgstr "當心新娘的東西，親愛的！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:546
msgid "Ooh! Careful."
msgstr "哎喲！小心。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:547
msgid "That's a bride's dowry, love! It'll cost you more now."
msgstr "那是新娘的嫁妝，親愛的！現在得多付錢了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:551 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:551
msgid "Flick"
msgstr "弗利克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:554
msgid ""
"To be paid, to be fed, and never to be caught. Runs chests for the Magpie."
msgstr "拿到錢，吃飽飯，永遠不被抓。替喜鵲跑腿賣箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:555
msgid ""
"It came my way, didn't it. {price}, quick. I can't stand about, mister."
msgstr "它自己落到我手裡的，懂吧。{price}，快點。我可不能在這兒傻站著，老闆。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:556
msgid ""
"Don't ask where it's from and I won't ask what you'll do with it. {price}. Twenty seconds."
msgstr "你別問它打哪兒來，我也不問你拿它幹什麼。{price}。二十秒。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:557
msgid "A {colour} chest for {price}. Cheap, 'cause I'm in a hurry. Yes or no?"
msgstr "一隻{colour}寶箱，只要{price}。便宜賣，因為我趕時間。要不要？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:558
msgid ""
"A pickpocket of twelve who runs chests for the Magpie: cheap, priced by colour, and in a hurry (twenty seconds). Most of what Flick sells isn't Flick's to sell: lay a hand on it, and your mark goes cold. From Thornwick in, you can send for the Wardens."
msgstr ""
"十二歲的扒手，替喜鵲跑腿賣箱子：便宜，按顏色定價，還很趕時間（二十秒）。弗利克賣的東西大多不歸弗利克賣：手一碰，你的鑰紋就會發涼。從荊棘鎮起，你就可以報告巡守。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:560
msgid "Ta. Never saw you."
msgstr "謝啦。我可沒見過你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:560
msgid "Done. I'm off."
msgstr "成交。我閃了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:561
msgid "Too slow, mister. I'm gone."
msgstr "太慢啦，老闆。我走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:562
msgid "Someone'll have it."
msgstr "總有人要。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:563
msgid "Oi! Quiet!"
msgstr "喂！小聲點！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:563
msgid "Careful! People are looking."
msgstr "小心！有人在看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:564
msgid "Drop it again and the price goes up. And the Wardens come running."
msgstr "再摔一次，價錢就漲。巡守也會跑過來。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:570
msgid "Bailiff Marrow"
msgstr "馬羅法警"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:570
msgid "Marrow"
msgstr "馬羅"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:572
msgid "The Guild's books balanced, and its friends served first."
msgstr "讓公會的賬目收支平衡，讓公會的朋友優先受惠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:573
msgid ""
"From a house the Guild sealed for tithe. A {colour} chest at the Guild's book price: {price}. The Guild doesn't haggle."
msgstr "出自一戶因貢金被公會查封的人家。{colour}寶箱，按公會的賬面價：{price}。公會不講價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:574
msgid ""
"Taken for tithe, and sold to the Guild's friends first. The book says a {colour} chest is {price}, whatever's in it."
msgstr "以貢金名義收來的，先賣給公會的朋友。賬上寫著，{colour}寶箱一律{price}，不管裡面裝著什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:575
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild's bailiff, who sells what it took for tithe to the Guild's friends first, at its book price: the chest's colour, nothing more. A third of it was seized, not sold, and won't open for anyone: lay a hand on it. He comes while the Guild counts you a friend."
msgstr ""
"鍍金公會的法警，把以貢金名義收走的東西優先賣給公會的朋友，按公會的賬面價：只看寶箱顏色，別的一概不論。其中三分之一是查封來的，不是買來的，誰也打不開：伸手摸一摸。只要公會把你當朋友，他就會來。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:577
msgid "Entered in the book. Good day."
msgstr "已記入賬冊。日安。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:577
msgid "The Guild thanks its friends."
msgstr "公會感謝它的朋友。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:578
msgid "I've three more houses to see to today."
msgstr "我今天還有三戶人家要去處理。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:579
msgid "As you like. Someone else is a friend of the Guild."
msgstr "隨你。公會的朋友又不止你一個。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:579 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:696
msgid "Noted."
msgstr "記下了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:580
msgid "That's Guild property until it's paid for."
msgstr "付錢之前，那可是公會的財產。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:581
msgid "Damage to Guild property is added to the price."
msgstr "損壞公會財產，賠償計入價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:585
msgid "Quartermaster Brandt"
msgstr "布蘭特軍需官"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:585
msgid "Brandt"
msgstr "布蘭特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:587
msgid "The Wardens' store emptied, and the money in the widows' fund."
msgstr "把巡守的庫房清空，把錢存進遺孀撫卹金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:588
msgid ""
"Taken off a thief a year and a day ago, and nobody's claimed it. The Wardens' tariff is by the pound: {pounds}, so {price}."
msgstr "一年零一天前從賊手裡繳來的，一直沒人認領。巡守的價目按磅算：{pounds}，所以是{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:589
msgid ""
"Unclaimed, a year and a day: it's the Crown's to sell now. {pounds} on the toll scale, at the tariff: {price}."
msgstr "一年零一天沒人認領：現在該由王室來賣了。關卡的秤上是{pounds}，按價目算：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:590
msgid ""
"The Wardens' quartermaster at the Thornwick toll, selling what they took off thieves and nobody claimed in a year and a day. The Wardens' tariff is so much a pound, so heavy things come dear and light ones cheap. He comes while the Wardens count you a friend."
msgstr ""
"荊棘鎮關卡的巡守軍需官，賣的是從賊手裡繳來、一年零一天都沒人認領的東西。巡守的價目按磅計價，所以重的東西貴，輕的東西便宜。只要巡守把你當朋友，他就會來。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:592
msgid "For the widows' fund. Much obliged."
msgstr "這錢歸遺孀撫卹金。多謝了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:592
msgid "Sold, by the tariff."
msgstr "按價目，成交。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:593
msgid "The toll won't keep itself."
msgstr "關卡總不能自己看著自己。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:594
msgid "It'll keep. It's kept a year already."
msgstr "放著也壞不了。它都放了一年了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:595
msgid "Easy with the Crown's property."
msgstr "王室的財產，輕拿輕放。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:596
msgid "That's breakage. Breakage goes on the price."
msgstr "這算損壞。損壞要算進價錢裡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:602
msgid "Ilse Varrow"
msgstr "伊爾絲·瓦羅"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:602
msgid "Ilse"
msgstr "伊爾絲"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:605
msgid ""
"To be an archmage one day. Lately, to know what her mistress is building in the cellar."
msgstr "有朝一日當上大法師。最近還想知道，她師父在地窖裡造的是什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:606
msgid ""
"Archmage Orme's clearing out the Arcanum stores. The tag says: packed, {clue}. She says {price}."
msgstr "大法師奧姆在清理秘法院的庫房。標籤上寫著內裝：{clue}。她說要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:607
msgid ""
"This one's from the third cellar. I can read the tag, at least: {clue}. {price}, my mistress says."
msgstr "這只是第三號地窖裡的。標籤我好歹認得：{clue}。{price}，是我師父說的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:608
msgid ""
"The Arcanum's apprentice, clearing its stores for her mistress. Every chest still has its packing tag, listing each kind of thing packed in it, and the archmages warded the most dangerous: a kind on the tag that you can't hear is warded. Prices by the chest's colour, as she's told."
msgstr ""
"秘法院的學徒，替她師父清理庫房。每個箱子都還留著裝箱標籤，列出裝進去的每一類東西，而大法師們把最危險的那件用結界封住了：標籤上有、你卻聽不到的那一類，就是被封住的。她按吩咐，照箱子的顏色定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:611
msgid "Oh good! Don't tell my mistress I was nervous."
msgstr "太好了！別告訴我師父我剛才很緊張。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:611
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "謝謝！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:612
msgid "I'm late! She'll turn me into something."
msgstr "我要遲到了！她會把我變成什麼東西的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:613
msgid "Oh. She won't be pleased."
msgstr "哦。她不會高興的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:613
msgid "That's all right. There's a whole cellar of them."
msgstr "沒關係。地窖裡還有一整窖呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:614
msgid "Careful! Some of those are cursed!"
msgstr "小心！裡面有些東西被詛咒了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:614
msgid "Eep!"
msgstr "呀！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:615
msgid "She said to keep them in one piece! I'll have to ask more."
msgstr "她說過要保證它們完好無損！我只好多要些錢了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:619
msgid "Archmage Thessaly Orme"
msgstr "大法師特薩莉·奧姆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:619
msgid "Orme"
msgstr "奧姆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:621
msgid "To understand the Locking well enough to undo it."
msgstr "把大封鎖研究透，透到能解開它。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:622
msgid ""
"From the Arcanum's oldest stores. {price}. Tell me exactly what's in it, and a third comes back to you."
msgstr "出自秘法院最古老的庫房。{price}。把裡面的東西說得分毫不差，我就退你三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:623
msgid ""
"A {colour} chest: {price}. Read it true, Keywright, and I'll return a third. I study how your kind hears."
msgstr "一隻{colour}寶箱：{price}。判斷準確，鑰匠，我就退還三分之一。我在研究你們這類人是怎麼聽的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:624
msgid ""
"An archmage of the Arcanum who studies the Locking, and Keywrights. She prices by the chest's colour, and likes a wager: read her chest exactly right, every kind and every count, and she gives back a third of what you paid."
msgstr ""
"秘法院的大法師，研究大封鎖，也研究鑰匠。她按箱子的顏色定價，還喜歡打賭：把她的箱子判斷得分毫不差，每一類、每個數目都對，她就退還你所付的三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:626
msgid "Let us see."
msgstr "且讓我們看看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:626
msgid "We shall see what you heard."
msgstr "看看你都聽出了什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:627
msgid "My engine won't build itself. Good day."
msgstr "我的機器可不會自己造好。告辭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:628
msgid "Prudent. Or timid. We shall never know."
msgstr "謹慎。或者說膽怯。我們永遠無從知曉。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:628
msgid "Another time, Keywright."
msgstr "改日吧，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:629
msgid "Hm. Bold."
msgstr "嗯。真大膽。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:629
msgid "Fascinating. Do that again."
msgstr "有意思。再來一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:630
msgid ""
"That chest is older than your great-grandmother. A third more, I think."
msgstr "那個箱子比你曾祖母年紀還大。我看，得加三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:634
msgid "Durgan Ironhand"
msgstr "杜爾甘·鐵手"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:634
msgid "Durgan"
msgstr "杜爾甘"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:636
msgid ""
"Ironroot's crown, locked in the Royal Treasury since the Locking; and a buyer for dwarf-gold the Guild won't let him sell."
msgstr "鐵根之冠，自大封鎖起就鎖在皇家寶庫裡；還有一個買家，肯收公會不許他賣的矮人金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:637
msgid ""
"From the deep seam under Ironroot. Hard shake, with dwarf's hands. {price}. Not a coin of it to the Guild, mind."
msgstr "從鐵根底下的深礦脈裡挖出來的。用矮人的手勁猛搖過了。{price}。這錢一文也不歸公會，聽好了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:638
msgid ""
"From Ironroot hold, sealed since my great-great-grandmother's day. I gave it a proper shake. {price}."
msgstr "出自鐵根要塞，從我曾曾祖母那輩起就封著。我結結實實地搖過了。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:639
msgid ""
"A dwarf trader of Ironroot Street, who knows a weapon when he hears one. He prices weapons in full, everything else at half, and takes every tinkle for a diamond. He shakes hard, and haggles."
msgstr "鐵根街的矮人商人，兵器一聽便知。他給兵器算全價，別的東西一律半價，還把每一聲叮鈴都當成鑽石。他會猛搖，也會討價還價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:641
msgid "Done. Back to the deep."
msgstr "成交。回地底去了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:641
msgid "Ha! Done."
msgstr "哈！成交。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:642
msgid "{price}. Any lower and I'll eat my helmet."
msgstr "{price}。再低我就把頭盔吃了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:642
msgid "{price}, and that's stone-solid."
msgstr "{price}，這價錢硬如磐石。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:643
msgid "You take me for a fool? Good day."
msgstr "你當我是傻子？告辭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:644
msgid "Hmph. Your loss, surface-dweller."
msgstr "哼。是你吃虧，地表人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:644
msgid "Back down the mine with it, then."
msgstr "那就把它帶回礦裡去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:645
msgid "Ha! Dwarf-made. It'll take worse than that."
msgstr "哈！矮人造的。比這更狠的都經得住。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:645
msgid "Watch it."
msgstr "當心點。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:646
msgid "Mind my stone-work! That'll cost you."
msgstr "當心我的石工活兒！這得加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:650 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1177
msgid "Lady Isaura Vell"
msgstr "伊索拉·維爾小姐"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:650
msgid "Isaura"
msgstr "伊索拉"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:653
msgid "To keep the Vell house standing, despite her brother's debts."
msgstr "撐住維爾家的門楣，哪怕弟弟欠下一身債。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:654
msgid "Grandmother's trick box. Her riddle's on the lid: \"{clue}\" {price}."
msgstr "祖母的機關盒。她的謎語就寫在盒蓋上：「{clue}」要價{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:655
msgid ""
"From the Vell strongroom, before my brother finds it: {price}. Grandmother's riddle: \"{clue}\""
msgstr "趁我弟弟還沒發現，從維爾家密庫裡取出來的：{price}。祖母的謎語：「{clue}」"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:656
msgid ""
"A noblewoman of an old house gone poor, selling her grandmother's trick boxes before her brother can. Each lid has grandmother's riddle about one thing inside, and if she warded something, the riddle is about that. Solve it: if you can't hear the answer, it's warded. Prices by colour."
msgstr ""
"一位家道中落的世家小姐，趕在弟弟下手之前變賣祖母的機關盒。每個盒蓋上都寫著祖母的一則謎語，說的是盒裡的某樣東西；若祖母用結界封住了什麼，謎語說的就是它。解開謎語：如果謎底的聲音你聽不到，它就被結界封住了。她看寶箱顏色定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:659
msgid "How delightful."
msgstr "真令人愉快。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:659
msgid "Grandmother would approve."
msgstr "祖母會讚許的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:660
msgid "I have creditors at four. Do excuse me."
msgstr "四點鐘我還要應付債主。失陪了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:661
msgid "Pity. Grandmother so loved a puzzle."
msgstr "可惜。祖母最愛謎題了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:661
msgid "Another time, perhaps."
msgstr "也許下次吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:662
msgid "Goodness!"
msgstr "天哪！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:662
msgid "Do be careful, that's a Vell."
msgstr "務必小心，那可是維爾家的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:663
msgid "That is a Vell heirloom! The price has just gone up."
msgstr "那可是維爾家的傳家寶！價錢剛剛漲了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:667
msgid "Silas Brass"
msgstr "賽拉斯·布拉斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:667
msgid "Brass"
msgstr "布拉斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:670
msgid "His money; and, though he'll never say it, to be thought kind."
msgstr "錢；還有——雖然他嘴上絕不會承認——被人當作好心人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:671
msgid ""
"Pledged twenty years ago on Lantern Lane and never redeemed. The ticket says {articles}. A firm shake. {price}."
msgstr "二十年前在燈籠巷典當的，一直沒人來贖。當票上寫著{articles}。穩搖過了。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:672
msgid ""
"Ticket four thousand and twelve: {articles}, it says. I price a lot kind by kind, at a firm shake. {price}."
msgstr "第四千零一十二號當票，上面寫著：{articles}。這批貨我按種類計價，穩搖聽的。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:673
msgid ""
"The pawnbroker of Lantern Lane, selling pledges nobody redeemed, often two or three of a kind. He prices one of each kind he hears and never counts how many. The pawn ticket counts every article pledged, false bottom and all, and he won't have pledges dropped: count what you hear against the ticket."
msgstr ""
"燈籠巷的當鋪老闆，變賣沒人贖回的當品，同一種東西常有兩三件。他聽到每種東西只算一件，從不數有幾件。當票上記著典當的每一件物品，連夾層裡的也算在內；他不許別人摔當品：拿你聽到的和當票上的數目對一對。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:676
msgid "Done. No refunds."
msgstr "成交。概不退款。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:676
msgid "Sold, as heard."
msgstr "成交，聽到什麼就是什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:677 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:681
msgid "Not on my pledges! Half again, for the damage."
msgstr "別這樣對我的當品！加價一半，算是賠償。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:678
msgid "Time is money, and you're spending mine."
msgstr "時間就是金錢，你在花我的錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:679
msgid "Back on the shelf it goes."
msgstr "那就放回架子上。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:679
msgid "As you like. Pledges keep."
msgstr "隨你。當品放得住。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:680
msgid "Mind the pledges!"
msgstr "當心那些當品！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:685
msgid "Master Quire"
msgstr "奎爾大師"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:685
msgid "Quire"
msgstr "奎爾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:688
msgid ""
"The Chest Roll kept true. Lately, to know why it says the Guild's chests aren't the Guild's."
msgstr "讓寶箱名冊記載無誤。最近，還想弄清名冊上為何說公會的寶箱不歸公會。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:689
msgid ""
"From the Royal Archive's vaults, with its ward-roll: {clue}. Unclaimed since the Locking. So much a rattle: {price}."
msgstr "出自皇家檔案館的地庫，附有結界名錄：{clue}。自大封鎖以來無人認領。按響聲計價，共{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:690
msgid ""
"The Chest Roll lists no owner for this one. The ward-roll reads {clue}, as far as I can make it out. I counted the rattles: {price}."
msgstr "寶箱名冊上沒有登記這個箱子的主人。就我辨認得出的，結界名錄上寫著：{clue}。我數過響聲了：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:691
msgid ""
"The Royal Archivist, keeper of the Chest Roll, selling unclaimed vault chests with their ward-rolls. A roll names what was warded in its chest, its letters faded by three hundred years: read the name, and name its kind on your slip. A blank roll means nothing was warded. He counts the rattles at a firm shake and charges the same for each."
msgstr ""
"皇家檔案官，寶箱名冊的保管人，變賣地庫裡無人認領的寶箱，附帶各自的結界名錄。名錄寫著箱中被結界封住的東西，字跡經三百年已殘缺不全：讀出名字，在估價單上勾選它的種類。名錄空白，就是沒有東西被封住。他穩搖後數響聲，每一聲收一樣的價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:694
msgid "Duly recorded."
msgstr "已如實登記。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:694
msgid "I'll enter it in the Roll."
msgstr "我會把它記入名冊。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:695
msgid "The Archive closes at six. Good day."
msgstr "檔案館六點關門。告辭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:696
msgid "Very well. I'll file it under 'unsold'."
msgstr "好吧。我會把它歸入「未售出」一類。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:697
msgid "Careful! That's Crown property."
msgstr "小心！那是王室財產。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:697
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:698
msgid "That is Crown property! I'll have to add a fee for that."
msgstr "那是王室財產！我得為此加收一筆費用。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:702
msgid "Tilly Mudge"
msgstr "蒂莉·馬奇"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:702
msgid "Tilly"
msgstr "蒂莉"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:705
msgid "To find the bell she hears tolling under the Aldwater on still nights."
msgstr "找到那口鐘——每逢寂靜的夜晚，她總聽見它在奧德河底下鳴響。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:706
msgid ""
"Out of the Aldwater mud at low tide! I shook it hard, and I'd bet my boots on what rustles. {price}."
msgstr "退潮時從奧德河的淤泥裡挖出來的！我猛搖過了，裡頭沙沙響的是什麼，我敢拿靴子打賭。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:707
msgid ""
"The river gives and the river takes. Shook it hard: spellbooks, potions, who knows! {price}. Heard the bell again last night."
msgstr "河水有給就有拿。猛搖過了：法術書、藥水，誰知道呢！{price}。昨晚又聽見那口鐘響了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:708
msgid ""
"A mudlark who combs the Aldwater at low tide, shakes hard, and prices every rustle as a drowned wizard's spellbook. Her scroll cases are often full of river sand, which pours at the gentlest shake. Real parchment only rustles at a hard one."
msgstr ""
"奧德河的河灘拾荒人，退潮時在泥裡翻找。她會猛搖，把每一聲沙沙都當作溺死的巫師留下的法術書來定價。她的卷軸筒裡常常裝滿河沙，河沙輕搖就會流動作響。真正的羊皮紙只在猛搖時才會沙沙響。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:710
msgid "Mud's been good to me!"
msgstr "泥巴待我不薄！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:710
msgid "The river provides."
msgstr "河水自有饋贈。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:711
msgid "Tide's turning. I'm off."
msgstr "要漲潮了。我走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:712
msgid "Back in the barrow, then."
msgstr "那就放回推車裡吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:712
msgid "No skin off my nose."
msgstr "反正我又不吃虧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:713
msgid "Ha! It's been through worse in the river."
msgstr "哈！它在河裡經歷過更糟的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:713
msgid "Oop!"
msgstr "哎喲！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:714
msgid "Oi! Mud or no mud, that's mine. It'll cost more now."
msgstr "喂！管它有泥沒泥，那都是我的。現在得加錢了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:718
msgid "Sir Rowan Gale"
msgstr "羅文·蓋爾爵士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:718
msgid "Rowan"
msgstr "羅文"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:720
msgid ""
"His grandfather's sword, and his family's hall back from the Guild, which foreclosed on it."
msgstr "找回祖父的劍，並從公會手裡奪回被查封的家族宅邸。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:721
msgid ""
"A Gale war chest. If my grandfather's sword's in it, it's mine, and I'll pay you {fee} for it. The rest is yours for {price}."
msgstr "蓋爾家的戰備箱。若我祖父的劍在裡面，它歸我，我付你{fee}。其餘的，{price}就歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:722
msgid ""
"From the siege of Harrowgate. Any blade in it is my family's: {fee} for the best. {price} for the chest."
msgstr "哈羅蓋特圍城戰留下的。裡面的刀劍都屬於我的家族：最好的那把，我出{fee}。整箱{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:723
msgid ""
"A knight without a war, whose family's hall the Guild foreclosed on. He's looking for his grandfather's sword. Prices by colour. If there are weapons in his chest, the best of them goes back to him for the price he names: value what's left."
msgstr ""
"一位無仗可打的騎士，家族宅邸被公會查封了。他在尋找祖父的劍。他看寶箱顏色定價。他的箱子裡若有兵器，最好的那件要按他開的價歸還給他：估一估剩下的東西值多少。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:725
msgid "Honour is satisfied."
msgstr "榮譽得以保全。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:725
msgid "For the Gales!"
msgstr "為了蓋爾家族！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:726
msgid "I'm expected at the lists. Good day."
msgstr "比武場還等著我。告辭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:727
msgid "Then I shall keep looking."
msgstr "那我就繼續找下去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:727
msgid "Another chest, another day."
msgstr "改日再看別的箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:728
msgid "Have a care, sir!"
msgstr "當心點，閣下！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:728
msgid "Steady!"
msgstr "穩住！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:729
msgid "Have a care with my grandfather's things! It'll cost you."
msgstr "當心我祖父的遺物！這可要讓你多破費了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:737 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:737
msgid "Tick"
msgstr "嘀嗒"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:740
msgid ""
"Errands run, gold gone down the Gate, and one day off in three hundred years."
msgstr "跑完差事，把金子送下大門，再休三百年來的頭一天假。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:741
msgid ""
"Fresh through the Gate, from the Maw's own hoard. {price}. And the sand's already running, mortal."
msgstr "剛穿過大門送來的，出自巨口自己的寶藏。{price}。沙漏裡的沙已經在往下流了，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:742
msgid "Errand for the Maw. A {colour} chest: {price}. Tick, tock."
msgstr "替巨口跑腿。{colour}寶箱一隻：{price}。嘀嗒，嘀嗒。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:743
msgid ""
"An imp courier with an hourglass, selling from the Maw's hoard. Prices by colour and never looks inside, and gives you twelve seconds to decide. Things from the Maw's hoard are often better than their chest's colour."
msgstr "帶著沙漏的小惡魔信使，販賣巨口寶藏裡的東西。看寶箱顏色定價，從不往裡看，只給你十二秒做決定。巨口寶藏裡的東西常常比寶箱顏色所示的更好。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:745
msgid "Delicious."
msgstr "美味。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:745
msgid "A pleasure, mortal."
msgstr "榮幸之至，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:746
msgid "Too slow! Back through the Gate I go."
msgstr "太慢了！我這就穿過大門回去啦。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:747
msgid "Pfft. Your loss, mortal."
msgstr "噗。是你吃虧，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:747
msgid "Fine. Someone in the Emporium has more sense."
msgstr "好吧。商行裡總有更識貨的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:748
msgid "Hee! Again!"
msgstr "嘻！再來！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:748
msgid "Clumsy mortal."
msgstr "笨手笨腳的凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:749
msgid "Careful, mortal! Breakages cost extra."
msgstr "小心點，凡人！摔壞了要加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:753
msgid "Lord Sallow"
msgstr "薩洛勳爵"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:753
msgid "Sallow"
msgstr "薩洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:755
msgid "To win every bargain he makes. He always has."
msgstr "贏下他做的每一筆交易。他向來如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:756
msgid ""
"From the Maw's hoard. {price}, a pittance. My only condition: the dearest thing inside is mine."
msgstr "出自巨口的寶藏。{price}，區區小數。我只有一個條件：裡面最貴重的東西歸我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:757
msgid ""
"A bargain, mortal: {price}. When it opens, I take the best of it. Everything else is yours."
msgstr "做筆交易吧，凡人：{price}。箱子開啟時，最好的那件歸我。其餘的全歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:758
msgid ""
"A devil of the old law, who deals in bargains. His price is low, but the dearest thing inside is his. A chest of many middling things suits his deal; one grand thing and little else doesn't."
msgstr ""
"一個遵循古老律法的魔鬼，專做交易。他要價很低，但箱裡最貴重的東西歸他。箱裡若是許多中等貨色，這筆交易就划算；若只有一件珍品、別的寥寥無幾，就不划算了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:760
msgid "Signed and sealed."
msgstr "簽字蓋印，契約已成。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:760
msgid "A pleasure doing business. It always is."
msgstr "合作愉快。向來如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:761
msgid "My time is worth more than yours, mortal."
msgstr "我的時間比你的值錢，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:762
msgid "Another time. There is always another time."
msgstr "下次吧。總會有下次的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:762
msgid "How very wise of you. Or was it?"
msgstr "你真是明智。還是說，並不明智？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:763
msgid "Mind my bones."
msgstr "當心我的骨頭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:763
msgid "Tsk."
msgstr "嘖。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:764
msgid "Damaged goods cost more, mortal. Read the small print."
msgstr "貨物受損，價錢更高，凡人。看看契約上的小字吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:768 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:768
msgid "Skrae"
msgstr "斯克雷"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:771
msgid "Out: away from the Gate, and the Maw, for good. It has heard enough."
msgstr "離開——永遠遠離大門，遠離巨口。它已經聽夠了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:772
msgid ""
"Shaken gently, then hard: {price}. Then I clicked, like a bat. The echoes: {clue}."
msgstr "先輕搖，再猛搖：{price}。然後我像蝙蝠那樣咔嗒了幾聲。回聲：{clue}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:773
msgid ""
"I hear every coin in the realm, and every word the Maw says. {price}. My echoes: {clue}. Wards can't stop an echo."
msgstr "這國度裡的每一枚錢幣、巨口說的每一個字，我都聽得見。{price}。我的回聲：{clue}。結界擋不住回聲。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:774
msgid ""
"A demon with ears like a bat, who has heard enough of the Maw. It shakes a chest gently, then hard, and prices what it hears, fairly. Then it clicks and listens to the echoes, which come back off everything inside, warded or not: round is coin, long a weapon, soft a cloak, hollow a potion, flat a spell, tiny a gem. An echo you can't hear is warded."
msgstr ""
"一個長著蝙蝠耳朵的惡魔，受夠了巨口。它先輕搖再猛搖寶箱，按聽到的東西公道定價。然後它發出咔嗒聲，聆聽回聲；回聲會從箱內的每樣東西上彈回，無論是否被結界封住：圓的是錢幣，長的是兵器，軟的是斗篷，空心的是藥水，扁的是法術，小小的是寶石。回聲裡有、搖起來卻聽不到的東西，就是被結界封住的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:777
msgid "Fair."
msgstr "公道。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:777
msgid "You won't regret it. Probably."
msgstr "你不會後悔的。大概吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:778
msgid "I hear someone counting gold elsewhere."
msgstr "我聽見別處有人在數金子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:779
msgid "I heard that coming."
msgstr "我早就聽出來了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:779
msgid "Hm. Fair enough."
msgstr "嗯。也行。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:780
msgid "Ow! My ears!"
msgstr "哎喲！我的耳朵！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:780
msgid "Loud. Very loud."
msgstr "吵。太吵了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:781
msgid "My ears! That will cost you."
msgstr "我的耳朵！這可要加錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:785
msgid "Countess Vey"
msgstr "維伯爵夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:785
msgid "the Countess"
msgstr "伯爵夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:788
msgid ""
"To keep up appearances at court, a jewel at a time. Some of her gems are paste, and she knows which."
msgstr "在宮中維持體面，一次賣一件珠寶。她的寶石有些是仿造的，她心裡清楚是哪些。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:789
msgid "From my strongroom. My gems, and whatever my maid packed. {price}."
msgstr "出自我的密庫。我的寶石，還有女僕隨手裝進去的東西。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:790
msgid ""
"The gems alone are worth {price}, I'm told. The rest I couldn't say. My maid packs."
msgstr "聽說，光這些寶石就值{price}。其餘的我可說不上來。箱子是女僕收拾的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:791
msgid ""
"A countess of the court who knows her own jewels and nothing else: she prices her gems at what she paid for them, and whatever else her maid packed comes free. Some of her gems are paste, and she won't have a lodestone near them (half again if you try)."
msgstr ""
"宮中的一位伯爵夫人，只認得自己的珠寶，別的一概不知：她按當初的買價給寶石定價，女僕裝進去的其他東西都白送。她的寶石有些是仿造的，而且她不許磁石靠近它們（你若這麼做，價格漲一半）。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:793
msgid "Charming."
msgstr "真迷人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:793
msgid "Do look after them."
msgstr "請好好照料它們。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:794
msgid "A lodestone? On MY gems? Half again, for the insult."
msgstr "磁石？竟敢用在我的寶石上？加價一半，權當賠罪。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:795
msgid "I'm expected at court. Good day."
msgstr "宮中還等著我。告辭。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:796
msgid "How very disappointing."
msgstr "真是令人失望。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:796
msgid "Well. Someone at court will have it."
msgstr "好吧。宮裡總有人要。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:797
msgid "My gems!"
msgstr "我的寶石！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:797
msgid "Must you?"
msgstr "非得這樣嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:798
msgid "My gems! Half again, for the fright."
msgstr "我的寶石！加價一半，算是壓驚。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:802
msgid "Madame Zell"
msgstr "澤爾夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:802
msgid "Zell"
msgstr "澤爾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:805
msgid ""
"To be right, and to be paid for it. The cards don't lie; Madame Zell doesn't either."
msgstr "說得準，還要為此拿錢。牌不會說謊，澤爾夫人也不會。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:806
msgid ""
"A courtier's chest, sold for his gambling debts. Three from the Locking's deck: {clue}. {price}."
msgstr "一位朝臣的箱子，為了還賭債賣掉的。從大封鎖的牌裡抽出三張：{clue}。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:807
msgid ""
"The cards chose this one for you, dear. {clue}. A {colour} chest: {price}."
msgstr "牌為你選中了這一隻，親愛的。牌面：{clue}。{colour}寶箱一隻：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:808
msgid ""
"The court's cartomancer. She draws three cards from the Locking's own deck for each chest: a suit drawn twice is what the ward holds (Coins, Swords for weapons, Mantles for cloaks, Cups for potions, Wands for spells, Stars for gems); three different suits, and nothing's warded. Prices by colour."
msgstr ""
"宮廷的紙牌占卜師。每個寶箱，她都從大封鎖的那副牌裡抽三張：某個花色出現兩次，就是結界封住的東西（錢幣即錢幣，寶劍即兵器，斗篷即斗篷，聖盃即藥水，權杖即法術，星辰即寶石）；三張花色各不相同，就沒有東西被封住。她看寶箱顏色定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:811
msgid "The cards are never wrong."
msgstr "牌從不出錯。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:811
msgid "As it was foretold."
msgstr "一如預言。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:812
msgid "The cards say I'm wanted elsewhere."
msgstr "牌說別處需要我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:813
msgid "The cards did say you might."
msgstr "牌確實說過你可能會這樣。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:813
msgid "As you wish, dear."
msgstr "如你所願，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:814
msgid "I didn't see that coming. How rare."
msgstr "這我可沒預見到。真難得。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:814
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr "哦！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:815
msgid "The cards warned me about you. Half again."
msgstr "牌早就提醒過我要提防你。加價一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:819 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:819
msgid "Gilt"
msgstr "吉爾特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:822
msgid ""
"The Maw's gilded iron sold as gold, so the Gate's gold buys more of the realm."
msgstr "把巨口的鍍金鐵器當黃金賣出去，好讓大門那邊的金子買下這國度更多的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:823
msgid ""
"Out of the Maw's hoard, friend, through a crack in the Gate. I'm leaving town tonight, so {price}."
msgstr "從巨口的寶藏裡弄出來的，朋友，走的是大門的裂縫。我今晚就要出城，所以只要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:824
msgid ""
"Hoard goods, very rare. Gold and gems, every one of them. For you, just {price}."
msgstr "寶藏裡的貨，稀罕得很。全是黃金和寶石。給你，只要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:825
msgid ""
"The Maw's fence. He knows exactly what's in his chests, because he packed the demon gold himself: gilded iron sold as gold and gems, cheap. What's real comes cheap; the fakes are worth nothing."
msgstr "巨口的銷贓人。他對自己箱子裡裝著什麼一清二楚，因為魔金就是他親手裝的：鍍金的鐵，冒充黃金和寶石廉價出售。真貨賣得便宜；假貨一文不值。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:827
msgid "Wonderful! No refunds."
msgstr "太好了！概不退款。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:827
msgid "A pleasure. I really must be going."
msgstr "榮幸之至。我真得走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:828
msgid "Can't stay. People to avoid."
msgstr "不能久留。有些人我得躲著。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:829
msgid "Your loss, friend. Your very great loss."
msgstr "是你吃虧，朋友。吃了大虧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:829
msgid "Suit yourself. I was never here."
msgstr "隨你。我從沒來過。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:830
msgid "Easy, friend! Easy."
msgstr "輕點，朋友！輕點。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:830
msgid "Whoa there."
msgstr "悠著點。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:831
msgid "Easy, friend! That'll cost a little extra."
msgstr "輕點，朋友！這得多收一點。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:835
msgid "Old Aldo"
msgstr "老奧爾多"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:835
msgid "Aldo"
msgstr "奧爾多"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:838
msgid "A Keywright he can trust with the one chest that matters."
msgstr "找到一位能託付那隻至關重要的寶箱的鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:839
msgid ""
"From an old house with a great many cellars. I've no idea what's in it. You tell me, and whatever you say it holds is my price."
msgstr "出自一座有許多地窖的老宅。我不知道里面有什麼。你來告訴我：你說它裝著什麼，我就按什麼要價。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:840
msgid ""
"Old things from an old house. Name what's inside: that's the price. Name it truly and I'll take a quarter off."
msgstr "老宅裡的老物件。說出裡面有什麼：那就是價錢。說得分毫不差，我就減去四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:841
msgid ""
"A tired old man in a plain cloak, with a very fine ring. He doesn't know what's in his chests: his price is whatever your slip says. Read it exactly and he takes a quarter off; read it wrong and you pay what it really holds, and a quarter more."
msgstr ""
"一位披著樸素斗篷的疲憊老人，戴著一枚極為精美的戒指。他不知道自己的箱子裡有什麼：你的估價單寫多少，他就要多少。判斷分毫不差，他減去四分之一；判斷錯了，你就得按箱裡實際的價值付錢，外加四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:843
msgid "Well. We shall see."
msgstr "好吧。拭目以待。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:843
msgid "Hm. Let's see what you heard."
msgstr "嗯。看看你聽出了什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:844
msgid "I'm needed elsewhere. Another day."
msgstr "別處還需要我。改日吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:845
msgid "Another day, then. I'll be back."
msgstr "那就改日吧。我還會再來的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:845
msgid "Hm. A careful one. Good."
msgstr "嗯。是個謹慎的人。很好。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:846
msgid "Steady. It's older than both of us."
msgstr "穩著點。它比我們倆都老。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:846
msgid "Oh my."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:847
msgid "Steady! That was my grandfather's. I'll want a little more."
msgstr "穩著點！那是我祖父的東西。我得多要一點。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:851
msgid "Avarax, the Gilded Maw"
msgstr "鍍金巨口阿瓦拉克斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:851
msgid "the Maw"
msgstr "巨口"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:854
msgid "Out."
msgstr "出來。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:855
msgid ""
"A trifle from my hoard. One coin. All I ask is that you open it here, where I can see."
msgstr "我寶藏裡的一件小玩意兒。一枚金幣。我只要你在這裡開啟它，讓我看著。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:856
msgid ""
"One coin, little Keywright. And then everyone in this city will want twice as much today. Isn't that fun?"
msgstr "一枚金幣，小鑰匠。然後，今天這城裡人人都會要雙倍的價錢。是不是很好玩？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:857
msgid ""
"The demon of greed himself, in a borrowed body dripping with rings. He sells a chest for one coin, but greed is catching: buy it, and everyone who comes to your counter after him that day asks twice as much."
msgstr "貪婪之魔本尊，借來的軀殼上戴滿了戒指。他只要一枚金幣就賣一個寶箱，但貪婪會傳染：買下它，當天在他之後來到你櫃檯前的每個人都會要價翻倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:859
msgid "Yesss."
msgstr "好——"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:859
msgid "Open it. Let me see."
msgstr "開啟它。讓我看看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:860
msgid "I have all the time in the world. You don't."
msgstr "我有的是時間。你可沒有。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:861
msgid "Clever little thing."
msgstr "聰明的小東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:861
msgid "Mm. Another day, then. There are so many days."
msgstr "嗯。那就改日吧。日子還多著呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:862
msgid "Careful. I break things too."
msgstr "小心。我也會弄壞東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:862
msgid "Ha."
msgstr "哈。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:863
msgid "Careful. Greed always wants more."
msgstr "小心。貪婪永遠想要更多。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:875
msgid "Sergeant Hollis"
msgstr "霍利斯中士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:875
msgid "Hollis"
msgstr "霍利斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:876
msgid ""
"Thieves caught and chests home; and to know why the Guild's foreclosed chests won't open for anyone."
msgstr "抓住竊賊，讓寶箱物歸原主；還想弄清為什麼公會查封的寶箱誰也打不開。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:877
msgid ""
"The Wardens' sergeant at the Thornwick toll: posts the wanted notices, searches the market, pays a finder's share for a stolen chest sent home."
msgstr "荊棘鎮關卡的巡守中士：張貼懸賞告示，搜查集市，贓物寶箱物歸原主時支付發現者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:881
msgid "Tobias Fenn"
msgstr "託拜厄斯·芬恩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:881
msgid "Tobias"
msgstr "託拜厄斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:882
msgid "To know where the tithe goes, and not to vanish for asking."
msgstr "弄清貢金的去向，而且不會因為多問而人間蒸發。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:883
msgid ""
"A clerk in the Gilded Guild's counting-house, with ink to the elbows and doubts he shouldn't have."
msgstr "鍍金公會賬房裡的書記員，墨水一直沾到手肘，心裡還有些不該有的疑慮。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:887
msgid "Mistress Aubel"
msgstr "奧貝爾女士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:887
msgid "Aubel"
msgstr "奧貝爾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:888
msgid "Every marked child in the county, for the Guild's counting-houses."
msgstr "把郡裡每一個帶鑰紋的孩子，都送進公會的賬房。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:889
msgid ""
"A Guild Mark-Finder, who tests children's hands at every fair and takes the marked ones \"into the Guild's care\"."
msgstr "公會的尋紋人，在每一場集市上檢查孩子們的手，把帶鑰紋的孩子帶走，「交由公會照管」。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:893
msgid "Wynn Hollow"
msgstr "溫·霍洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:893
msgid "Wynn"
msgstr "溫"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:894
msgid "Her son kept out of the Guild's counting-houses."
msgstr "讓兒子遠離公會的賬房。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:895
msgid "Pip's mother, the mill's washerwoman."
msgstr "皮普的母親，磨坊的洗衣婦。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:899
msgid "Harl Caskett"
msgstr "哈爾·卡斯克特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:899
msgid "Caskett"
msgstr "卡斯克特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:900
msgid "The Old Wood's oak, felled and sold, on the Guild's account."
msgstr "把古林的橡樹砍倒賣掉，賬記在公會名下。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:901
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild's timber factor, with a deed for the Old Wood and a pen for whoever will witness it."
msgstr "鍍金公會的木材代理商，揣著一份古林的契據，還備好一支筆，等著誰來作見證。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:905
msgid "The Hawthorn Lady"
msgstr "山楂夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:905
msgid "the Hawthorn Lady"
msgstr "山楂夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:906
msgid "The Wood's oaks left standing; and a promise, kept."
msgstr "古林的橡樹屹立不倒；還有，一個信守的承諾。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:907
msgid ""
"One of the fair folk of the Old Wood. She never used gold, and trades in promises."
msgstr "古林的仙靈之一。她從不使用金子，只用承諾做交易。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:911
msgid "Lord Cassian Vell"
msgstr "卡西安·維爾勳爵"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:911
msgid "Cassian"
msgstr "卡西安"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:913
msgid "Tonight's stake at cards. Tomorrow's, too."
msgstr "今晚牌桌上的賭本。明晚的也要。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:914
msgid ""
"Lady Isaura's brother, a gambler, selling his sister's chests cheap. They aren't his to sell."
msgstr "伊索拉小姐的弟弟，一個賭徒，正低價變賣姐姐的寶箱。那些箱子不歸他賣。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:915
msgid "Splendid. The tables await."
msgstr "妙極了。牌桌在等著我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:915
msgid "Done. Not a word to my sister."
msgstr "成交。別跟我姐姐提一個字。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:916
msgid "Your loss. Someone will want it before the cards start."
msgstr "是你吃虧。牌局開始之前，總會有人要的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:916
msgid "Pity."
msgstr "可惜。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:921
msgid "Jasper Wick"
msgstr "賈斯珀·威克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:921
msgid "Jasper"
msgstr "賈斯珀"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:922
msgid ""
"A good ear, a low price, and no licence: and never to see the inside of a Guild counting-house."
msgstr "一雙好耳朵，低廉的價錢，不要執照；還有，永遠別踏進公會的賬房。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:923
msgid ""
"A hedge-wright: a Keywright without the Guild's licence, as Bram was for twenty years, trading from a cart."
msgstr "黑鑰匠：沒有公會執照的鑰匠，布拉姆當年就這樣幹了二十年。他守著一輛貨車做買賣。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:927
msgid "Sir Aldwin Gale"
msgstr "奧爾德溫·蓋爾爵士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:927
msgid "Sir Aldwin"
msgstr "奧爾德溫爵士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:928
msgid "His blade in his family's hands, and then to rest."
msgstr "讓他的劍回到家人手中，然後安息。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:929
msgid ""
"A knight who fell on Brindle Field the year before the Locking, and has walked it since."
msgstr "大封鎖前一年戰死在布林德爾田的騎士，此後一直在那片田野上游蕩。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:933
msgid "Martha Dunning"
msgstr "瑪莎·鄧寧"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:933
msgid "Martha"
msgstr "瑪莎"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:934
msgid ""
"Thornwick's roads free and its market open, and the Old Wood left standing."
msgstr "讓荊棘鎮道路免費通行、集市敞開，讓古林安然無恙。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:935
msgid ""
"A Thornwick weaver, standing for reeve against the Guild's money with nothing but a loom and a loud voice."
msgstr "荊棘鎮的織工，只憑一臺織布機和一副大嗓門，就跟公會的錢袋子競選鎮長。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:939
msgid "Sister Agathe"
msgstr "阿加特修女"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:939
msgid "Agathe"
msgstr "阿加特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:940
msgid ""
"Every chest left shut, as Saint Ide meant them; and to know who pays for the Unopened's bread."
msgstr "讓每個寶箱都保持緊閉，一如聖伊德的本意；還想弄清楚，是誰在為未啟派的麵包掏錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:941
msgid ""
"A preacher of the Unopened, the abbey's zealots, who say every chest opened feeds the Maw."
msgstr "未啟派的佈道者。未啟派是修道院裡的狂熱信徒，聲稱每開啟一個寶箱，都是在餵養巨口。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:945
msgid "Mother Tansy"
msgstr "坦西婆婆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:945
msgid "Tansy"
msgstr "坦西"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:946
msgid "Her money back, with a third on top, on the morning she said."
msgstr "在她說好的那天早上收回本錢，外加三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:947
msgid ""
"A moneylender of Lantern Lane, who lends to anyone short for the Guild and collects from everyone."
msgstr "燈籠巷的放貸人。誰交不起公會的錢，她都肯借；誰欠了她的錢，她都要收。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:951
msgid "Mistress Ashby"
msgstr "阿什比女士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:951
msgid "Ashby"
msgstr "阿什比"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:953
msgid "Her daughter's dowry, which the Corlews say is theirs."
msgstr "她女兒的嫁妝，科爾盧家卻說那是他們的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:954
msgid ""
"A Thornwick widow whose daughter was to marry a Corlew, until the wedding wasn't."
msgstr "荊棘鎮的寡婦，女兒本要嫁給科爾盧家的人，可婚事告吹了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:955
msgid "There. The ward agrees with me."
msgstr "瞧。結界也站在我這邊。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:956 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:965
msgid "Then the court will hear it again."
msgstr "那就讓法庭再審一回。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:960
msgid "Hal Corlew"
msgstr "哈爾·科爾盧"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:960
msgid "Corlew"
msgstr "科爾盧"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:962
msgid "His sister's dowry, which the Ashbys say is theirs."
msgstr "他妹妹的嫁妝，阿什比家卻說那是他們的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:963
msgid ""
"A Thornwick carter whose sister was to marry into the Ashbys, until the wedding wasn't."
msgstr "荊棘鎮的車伕，妹妹本要嫁進阿什比家，可婚事告吹了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:964
msgid "Knew it. Told them."
msgstr "我就知道。早跟他們說過了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:969
msgid "Jory Kettle"
msgstr "喬裡·凱特爾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:969
msgid "Jory"
msgstr "喬裡"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:970
msgid ""
"To pay you back for his freedom, and to see the Guild's debt-houses emptied."
msgstr "報答你還他自由，還想看到公會的債務監獄人去樓空。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:971
msgid "Ada's son, two years in the Guild's debt-house for his father's tithe."
msgstr "艾達的兒子，為了父親欠的貢金，在公會的債務監獄裡關了兩年。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1005
msgid "a farmer at Brindle"
msgstr "布林德爾的一位農夫"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1005
msgid "the Crossed Keys"
msgstr "交鑰酒館"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1005
msgid "the miller's wife"
msgstr "磨坊主的妻子"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1006
msgid "a carter on the forest road"
msgstr "林間大道上的一位車伕"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1006
msgid "a Thornwick family"
msgstr "荊棘鎮的一戶人家"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1006
msgid "the abbey's gatehouse"
msgstr "修道院的門房"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1007
msgid "a Crownhold merchant"
msgstr "王冠堡的一位商人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1007
msgid "Lord Harrow's household"
msgstr "哈羅勳爵府上"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1007
msgid "a family on Lantern Lane"
msgstr "燈籠巷的一戶人家"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1007
msgid "a chapel by the Aldwater"
msgstr "奧德河畔的一座小教堂"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1008
msgid "a lady of the court"
msgstr "宮中的一位貴婦"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1008
msgid "a palace steward"
msgstr "一位王宮管事"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1008
msgid "a banker of the Emporium"
msgstr "皇家商行的一位銀行家"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1008
msgid "a courtier's widow"
msgstr "一位朝臣的遺孀"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1022
msgid ""
"Gods! It just... burst open! Keep the singing thing, then. The rest is going home with me."
msgstr "天哪！它居然……自己迸開了！那會唱歌的玩意兒你留著吧。剩下的我帶回家了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1026
msgid "one"
msgstr "一"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1026
msgid "two"
msgstr "兩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1026
msgid "three"
msgstr "三"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1026
msgid "four"
msgstr "四"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1026
msgid "five"
msgstr "五"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1026
msgid "six"
msgstr "六"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1027
msgid "seven"
msgstr "七"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1027
msgid "eight"
msgstr "八"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:1031
msgid "{0} and {1}"
msgstr "{0}和{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Shop.cs:14
msgid "Bram's Stall"
msgstr "布拉姆的攤位"

#: scripts/Core/Shop.cs:17 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:62
msgid "The Royal Emporium"
msgstr "皇家商行"

#: scripts/Core/Shop.cs:766
msgid ""
"Fished it out of the millpond this morning. I didn't shake it, it might break! Is {price} okay?"
msgstr "今天早上從磨坊池塘裡撈上來的。我沒搖它，怕搖壞了！{price}行嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:54
msgid ""
"Mara, the last archmage of the Keyhold, and Bram's old partner. She's hunted the Aldric Key for twenty years."
msgstr "瑪拉，鑰堡最後的大法師，布拉姆的老搭檔。她追尋奧德里克之鑰已有二十年。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:55
msgid ""
"The Crown Chest. The King gives it to you: it's yours by right. Open it, Keywright."
msgstr "王冠寶箱。國王把它賜給了你：它理所當然歸你。開啟它吧，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:63 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:299
msgid "Mara"
msgstr "瑪拉"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:64
msgid "King Aldric"
msgstr "奧德里克國王"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:67
msgid "The Magpie"
msgstr "喜鵲"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:74
msgid ""
"Good evening. {0}, Collector for the Gilded Guild. Every Keywright in Aldmark pays the Guild a tithe, to keep the Gate. Your uncle never paid a penny."
msgstr "晚上好。我是{0}，鍍金公會的收賬人。奧德馬克的每一位鑰匠都要向公會繳納貢金，用以看守大門。令叔卻從沒付過一文錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:75
msgid ""
"Twenty years I opened chests for folk who couldn't afford a Guild Keywright! For pennies!"
msgstr "二十年來，我替請不起公會鑰匠的鄉親們開箱子！只收幾個銅板！"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:76
msgid ""
"Twenty years of tithe, Bram: {0}. The Guild will be reasonable. {1} payments, one a week, starting small: {2}, {3} nights from now."
msgstr "二十年的貢金，布拉姆：{0}。公會是講道理的。分{1}次付清，每週一次，先從小數目開始：{3}晚之後，付{2}。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:77
msgid "Miss one, and the Guild seals the stall. Good evening, Keywright."
msgstr "漏繳一次，公會便會查封攤位。祝你晚安，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:78
msgid ""
"Every fifth night, then. Don't look like that: a good ear pays any debt. We'll talk in the morning."
msgstr "那就是每五晚一回了。別這副表情：耳朵靈，什麼債都還得上。咱們明早再說。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:94
msgid ""
"Another season at the crossroads, {0}. The Guild hasn't come sniffing yet. Let's make the most of it."
msgstr "又在十字路口過一季了，{0}。公會還沒嗅到風聲找上門來。咱們抓緊時間好好幹。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:95
msgid ""
"There you are, {0}! My mark's faded, but look at your hand: it's yours now. And so is the stall."
msgstr "你可來了，{0}！我的鑰紋已經褪了，可你看看你的手：現在它歸你了。這攤位也歸你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:96
msgid ""
"Folk bring us chests nobody else can open. You buy one, it opens for you, and you sell what's inside. So listen before you buy: that's the whole trade."
msgstr "鄉親們把別人打不開的寶箱拿來找咱們。你買下一隻，它就會為你開啟，然後你把裡面的東西賣掉。所以買之前先聽：這行的門道全在這兒了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:100
msgid ""
"You've a right to know what these chests are. Three hundred years ago the Maw, Avarax, ruled this realm through its gold. Every coin was his eye."
msgstr "這些寶箱是怎麼回事，你有權知道。三百年前，巨口阿瓦拉克斯借這國度的金子統治著它。每一枚錢幣都是他的眼睛。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:102
msgid ""
"King Aldric and the archmages locked every treasure away and chained the Maw behind the Gilded Gate. The Locking, they called it. The chests are what's left."
msgstr "奧德里克國王和大法師們把所有財寶都鎖了起來，又用鎖鏈把巨口困在鍍金之門後面。他們管這叫「大封鎖」。這些寶箱就是留下來的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:104
msgid ""
"And this is my one secret: a shard of the Aldric Key, broken in four when the Locking was made. It's yours now. Don't let the Guild see it."
msgstr "還有，這是我唯一的秘密：奧德里克之鑰的一塊碎片。大封鎖鑄成之時，鑰匙碎成了四塊。現在它歸你了。別讓公會看見。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:106
msgid ""
"So you're Bram's kin. You have the mark, and his ear for a chest, they say. I have something your uncle has wanted for twenty years. Find me what I ask for, and it's yours."
msgstr "原來你就是布拉姆的親族。聽說你有鑰紋，聽寶箱的耳力也跟他一樣好。我手上有樣東西，你叔叔想要了二十年。替我找來我要的東西，它就歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:111
msgid ""
"That's... a second shard. Where did she get it? Never mind. Never mind!"
msgstr "這是……第二塊碎片。她從哪兒弄來的？算了。算了！"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:112
msgid "That woman in the hood. I know that voice. Hear her out."
msgstr "那個戴兜帽的女人。這聲音我認得。聽她把話說完。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:114
msgid ""
"My name is Mara. I was the last archmage of the Keyhold. Your uncle and I found the first shard together, a long time ago."
msgstr "我叫瑪拉，是鑰堡最後的大法師。很久以前，我和你叔叔一起找到了第一塊碎片。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:116
msgid ""
"The whole Key opens the Crown Chest: King Aldric's own, with the heart of the Locking inside. The Guild doesn't want your gold. It wants that chest."
msgstr "完整的鑰匙能開啟王冠寶箱：那是奧德里克國王自己的寶箱，裡面封著大封鎖的核心。公會要的不是你的金子。它要的是那個寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:118
msgid ""
"Every tithe the Guild takes goes down through the Gilded Gate. The Maw is buying his way out, a coin at a time. And every chest you open loosens the Locking."
msgstr "公會收的每一筆貢金，都穿過鍍金之門流了下去。巨口正一枚錢幣一枚錢幣地給自己贖身。而你每開啟一個寶箱，大封鎖就鬆動一分。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:121
msgid ""
"And that old fellow at the Emporium, the one with the ring? Look at the seal on it, {0}. That's the King. He's been testing you."
msgstr "還有商行裡那個老頭，戴戒指的那個？看看戒指上的印記，{0}。那就是國王。他一直在考驗你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:122
msgid ""
"The King knows. He's looking for a Keywright he can trust with the Crown Chest. Be that Keywright."
msgstr "國王心裡清楚。他在尋找一位能託付王冠寶箱的鑰匠。去成為那位鑰匠吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:124
msgid ""
"Vane's been asking about the shards. Whatever he offers you tonight, think hard."
msgstr "韋恩一直在打聽碎片的事。今晚不管他給你開什麼條件，都要好好想想。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:130
msgid ""
"The tithe is paid. But the Gate is hungry, and the Guild has decided you owe it something for its patience."
msgstr "貢金已經付清。但大門飢餓難耐，而公會認定：它這麼有耐心，你總該有所表示。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:131
msgid ""
"They'll keep coming, and every week they'll want half as much again. Let's see how long we can make them wait."
msgstr "他們還會再來，而且每週要的都比上週多一半。咱們看看能讓他們等多久。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:142
msgid "Bram's welcome"
msgstr "布拉姆的歡迎"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:143
msgid "Bram's secret"
msgstr "布拉姆的秘密"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:145
msgid "Who stands with you"
msgstr "誰與你並肩"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:146
msgid "The Guild's terms"
msgstr "公會的條件"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:151
msgid "{0} Bring me {1} {2}, and the next shard is yours."
msgstr "{0}{2}給我帶來{1}，下一塊碎片就歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:151 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:383
msgid "this week"
msgstr "本週內"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:151
msgid "before the Guild comes again"
msgstr "在公會再次上門之前"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:161
msgid "A note from the Hooded Woman: \"{0}\""
msgstr "兜帽女子留下的字條：「{0}」"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:163
msgid ""
"A note from the Hooded Woman: \"You gave them the shards. Now the Guild will have the Crown Chest. Pay your debt: it's all you have left.\""
msgstr "兜帽女子留下的字條：「你把碎片給了他們。現在公會要拿到王冠寶箱了。還清你的債吧：你只剩這件事可做了。」"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:165
msgid ""
"The last week of the tithe, and it's already paid: nobody's coming for anything this week."
msgstr "貢金的最後一週，而且已經付清了：這周不會有人來討任何東西。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:166
msgid "The debt's last week. Pay this, and the stall is yours. Truly yours."
msgstr "還債的最後一週。付清這一筆，攤位就歸你了。真真正正歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:172
msgid ""
"Something enchanted. The last shard was hidden with magic, and only magic will find it."
msgstr "一件附魔物品。最後一塊碎片是用魔法藏起來的，只有魔法才能找到它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:175
msgid ""
"A spellbook. The Keyhold wrote down where it hid every shard, in spells only a Keyhold book can hold."
msgstr "一本法術書。鑰堡把每一塊碎片的藏處都記了下來，用的是隻有鑰堡之書才承載得了的法術。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:176
msgid ""
"A gem. The Key was set with them, and they remember where the rest of it went."
msgstr "一顆寶石。鑰匙上曾鑲著寶石，它們記得鑰匙其餘部分的去向。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:177
msgid ""
"Old coin. The Key-smiths were paid in it, and every coin was stamped with where they worked."
msgstr "古錢幣。當年鑄鑰匠的工錢就是用它付的，每一枚上都印著他們幹活的地方。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:178
msgid ""
"A blade. The Wardens who carried the shards away were buried with their swords."
msgstr "一把劍。當年護送碎片離開的巡守，下葬時都佩著自己的劍。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:183
msgid "Good. Here: the second shard. Don't let the Guild see it."
msgstr "很好。給你：第二塊碎片。別讓公會看見。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:184
msgid "The third shard. One more, and the Key is whole."
msgstr "第三塊碎片。再有一塊，鑰匙就完整了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:185
msgid "The last shard. Bram will know what to do with it. So will I."
msgstr "最後一塊碎片。布拉姆會知道該拿它怎麼辦。我也知道。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:191
msgid "Before you pay. The Guild knows about the Key. {0}, I hear."
msgstr "付錢之前，容我一言。公會知道鑰匙的事。聽說，你手上有{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:192
msgid ""
"Give them to me, and the Guild will forget half of tonight's tithe. Generous, no?"
msgstr "把它們交給我，公會就免掉今晚一半的貢金。很慷慨吧？"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:195
msgid " shard"
msgstr "塊碎片"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:195
msgid " shards"
msgstr "塊碎片"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:199
msgid ""
"A sensible choice. The Guild remembers its friends. So does its master."
msgstr "明智的選擇。公會不會忘記它的朋友。它的主人也不會。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:200
msgid "Pity. The Guild remembers that too."
msgstr "真遺憾。這一點，公會也會記住的。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:208
msgid ""
"The Guild's tithe is paid, Keywright. Every coin. By a friend of the Guild. You know which one."
msgstr "公會的貢金付清了，鑰匠。一文不少。是公會的一位朋友付的。你知道是哪一位。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:209
msgid "What did you do? The Key... where's the Key? What did you DO?"
msgstr "你幹了什麼？鑰匙……鑰匙呢？你到底幹了些什麼？！"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:210
msgid ""
"The Gate's open, Bram. I can feel it from here. The Maw has the Key, and the Locking won't hold the year."
msgstr "大門開了，布拉姆。我在這兒都能感覺到。鑰匙在巨口手裡，大封鎖撐不過今年了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:214
msgid "{0} week early"
msgid_plural "{0} weeks early"
msgstr[0] "提前了{0}周"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:215
msgid "Before I've even come for it"
msgstr "我都還沒上門來收呢"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:219
msgid ""
"All of it? Now? {0}. Then the Guild... has no further claim on Bram's stall."
msgstr "全部？現在？{0}。那麼公會……對布拉姆的攤位，再無任何索求。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:220
msgid ""
"Free and clear, and ahead of time! Twenty years, and the stall is ours."
msgstr "無債一身輕，還提前了！二十年了，這攤位總算是咱們的了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:225
msgid "Free and clear! Twenty years, and the stall is ours."
msgstr "無債一身輕！二十年了，這攤位總算是咱們的了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:229
msgid ""
"And the Guild has the shards. Somewhere under the palace, they're looking for the Crown Chest. Let them look."
msgstr "只是碎片在公會手裡。他們正在王宮底下的什麼地方找王冠寶箱。由他們找去吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:231
msgid ""
"And we've {0} of the Key's {1} shards. Mara will keep asking: keep trading, and we may find the Crown Chest yet."
msgstr "鑰匙的{1}塊碎片，咱們已經有了{0}塊。瑪拉還會再來要東西的：接著做買賣，說不定咱們終究能找到王冠寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:233
msgid ""
"The Crown Chest can wait. The Key's not going anywhere, and neither are we."
msgstr "王冠寶箱可以等。鑰匙跑不了，咱們也跑不了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:245
msgid "Bram. It's been a long time."
msgstr "布拉姆。好久不見。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:246
msgid "Mara. The Key. You found all of it."
msgstr "瑪拉。鑰匙……你全找齊了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:247
msgid ""
"Your kin did the finding. And the King has come himself, with the Crown Chest. Quickly: the Guild is a day behind us."
msgstr "是你的親人找齊的。國王親自來了，帶著王冠寶箱。快：公會只比我們晚一天。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:250
msgid "There's nobody to hold them back. We'll have to be quick."
msgstr "沒有人能替我們攔住他們。我們得抓緊。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:252
msgid ""
"Three hundred years it's waited in my family, and not one of us could open it. It's yours by right now, Keywright. It opens for nobody else."
msgstr "它在我的家族中等了三百年，我們沒有一個人能開啟它。現在，它理所當然地歸你了，鑰匠。除了你，它不會為任何人開啟。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:265
msgid ""
"Vane was at the Crossed Keys last night, asking about the Key. Asking who your friends are."
msgstr "昨晚韋恩去了交鑰酒館，打聽鑰匙的事。還打聽你的朋友都有誰。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:267
msgid ""
"The Guild has the shards, and it's digging under the palace for the Crown Chest. When it finds it, we'll need every friend we've got."
msgstr "碎片在公會手裡，他們正在王宮底下挖，找王冠寶箱。等他們找到了，咱們就得把所有朋友都叫上。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:268
msgid ""
"When the Key is whole, the Guild will come for it with everything it has. Who'll stand with you when it does?"
msgstr "等鑰匙拼完整，公會就會傾盡全力來搶。到那時，誰會站在你這邊？"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:273
msgid ""
"Nobody, it seems. Well. We've the stall, and each other. That's more than I had at your age."
msgstr "看來，一個也沒有。唉，好吧。咱們還有攤位，還有彼此。比我在你這個年紀時強多了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:274
msgid "That's a crowd, that is. Twenty years I traded alone, and look at you."
msgstr "這可是一大幫人哪。我一個人做了二十年買賣，再瞧瞧你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:275
msgid "It's a start. Make a few more friends before the end, if you can."
msgstr "算是開了個頭。要是可以，在最後關頭之前再多交幾個朋友。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:287
msgid ""
"The Wardens have the palace road. No Guild carriage gets past my toll tonight."
msgstr "巡守把住了通往王宮的路。今晚公會的馬車，一輛也別想過我的關卡。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:288
msgid ""
"The Wardens will hold the palace road, when it comes to it. You've sent enough chests home."
msgstr "真到了那一步，巡守會守住通往王宮的路。你已經送回了夠多的寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:290
msgid ""
"Half of Brindle walked to the palace to see it opened. The Guild's men can't get through the crowd."
msgstr "半個布林德爾的人都走到王宮來看開箱了。公會的人根本擠不過人群。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:291
msgid ""
"Brindle's with you: half the crossroads would walk to the palace if you asked them."
msgstr "布林德爾站在你這邊：只要你開口，十字路口一半的人都會走到王宮去。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:293
msgid ""
"A black feather on the counter: the Guild's carriages have lost their wheels in Lantern Lane. All of them."
msgstr "櫃檯上有一根黑羽毛：公會的馬車在燈籠巷全丟了輪子。一輛不剩。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:294
msgid ""
"A black feather on the counter, and a note: \"When the Guild comes for you, the Lockless will be in its way.\""
msgstr "櫃檯上有一根黑羽毛，還有一張字條：「公會來找你的時候，無鎖黨會擋在它前面。」"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:296
msgid ""
"The palace guard is at the Emporium's door. My Guild has no business here tonight."
msgstr "王宮衛隊就守在商行門口。今晚，我的公會休想在這裡插手。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:297
msgid ""
"The Crown's with you, Keywright. I've a palace guard with very little to do."
msgstr "王室站在你這邊，鑰匠。我手下有一隊王宮衛兵正閒得發慌。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:299
msgid ""
"Hawthorn has grown across the Guild's road. They'll be all night cutting through it."
msgstr "山楂樹長滿了公會要走的那條路。他們得砍上一整夜才開得出路來。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:300
msgid "The Wood keeps its own. When they come for you, they'll find thorns."
msgstr "古林不會虧待自己人。他們來找你時，等著他們的只有荊棘。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:302
msgid ""
"Ironroot's smiths have barred the Gate road with iron. Let the Guild try lifting it."
msgstr "鐵根的工匠用鐵把通往大門的路封死了。讓公會試試搬不搬得動。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:303
msgid ""
"Ironroot owes you a crown. Ask, and you'll have a hundred dwarves at your door."
msgstr "鐵根欠你一頂王冠的人情。開口吧，一百個矮人就會站到你門口。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:308
msgid "I'll hold the lamp, master! I'm not scared. Much."
msgstr "我來舉燈，師父！我不怕。就怕一點點。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:308
msgid "I'll stand with you, master. I'm small, but I'm quick."
msgstr "我會站在你這邊，師父。我個子小，可我手腳快。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:315
msgid "The whole mill's here, and every one of us has a washing paddle."
msgstr "整個磨坊的人都來了，每人手裡都拿著一根搗衣棒。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:315
msgid "Send for me, and the whole mill comes."
msgstr "叫我一聲，整個磨坊的人都會來。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:316
msgid "Rafe's sword's at the door, dear, and Jory's holding it."
msgstr "雷夫的劍守在門口，孩子，握著它的是喬裡。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:316
msgid "Rafe would have stood with you. So will we, dear."
msgstr "雷夫要是還在，也會站在你這邊。我們也一樣，孩子。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:317
msgid ""
"I've brought two delvers and a lot of rope. Nobody's getting through that door."
msgstr "我帶了兩個探墓的夥計，還有一大堆繩子。誰也別想闖過那扇門。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:317
msgid "You dug me out of the Barrow. I'll dig you out of anything."
msgstr "你把我從古冢裡挖了出來。不管你陷進什麼麻煩，我都會把你挖出來。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:318
msgid "The Crossed Keys is closed tonight. Everyone's here instead."
msgstr "交鑰酒館今晚關門了。大夥兒全都來了這兒。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:318
msgid "The Crossed Keys stands with you, love. Every last drunk in it."
msgstr "交鑰酒館站在你這邊，親愛的。連店裡最後一個醉鬼都算上。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:319
msgid "A Gale at the door, with a Gale's blade. Let them come."
msgstr "蓋爾家的人守在門口，手握蓋爾家的劍。讓他們來吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:319
msgid "The Gales pay their debts. Call, and I'll be there."
msgstr "蓋爾家有債必還。你一召喚，我就到。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:320
msgid "Goblins in the Guild's cellar. Lots of goblins. Very busy."
msgstr "哥布林在公會地窖裡。好多哥布林。很忙。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:320
msgid "The clan comes when you call. All of it. Even the uncles."
msgstr "你一叫，部族就來。全部來。連叔叔們也來。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:321
msgid "House Vell is at the palace, and so, for once, is my brother."
msgstr "維爾家族都到王宮來了，難得一回，連我弟弟也在。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:321
msgid "House Vell owes you. We pay our debts, Keywright."
msgstr "維爾家族欠你的情。我們有債必還，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:322
msgid "Ironroot's here, Keywright, with hammers."
msgstr "鐵根的人來了，鑰匠，帶著錘子。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:322
msgid "A hundred dwarves, when you need them."
msgstr "你需要時，就有一百個矮人。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:323
msgid ""
"A hedge-wright at your back. Two Keywrights are harder to stop than one."
msgstr "有個黑鑰匠在背後給你撐腰。兩個鑰匠可比一個難攔。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:323
msgid "When the Guild comes, send for the hedge-wright."
msgstr "公會找上門時，就去叫那個黑鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:324
msgid "I have the Roll, and the Roll says whose the Crown Chest is. Yours."
msgstr "名冊在我手上，名冊寫明瞭王冠寶箱歸誰。歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:324
msgid "The Roll will say whose the Key is, when it matters."
msgstr "到了要緊關頭，名冊會寫明鑰匙歸誰。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:325
msgid ""
"Every lamp in the Arcanum is lit tonight. The Guild won't find a shadow to hide in."
msgstr "今晚秘法院的每一盞燈都點亮了。公會找不到一處陰影可以藏身。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:325
msgid ""
"The Arcanum's apprentices will stand with you. Some of the archmages, too."
msgstr "秘法院的學徒們會站在你這邊。有些大法師也會。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:326
msgid ""
"Two whole families are here, dear: the ones you married off. They'd like a word with the Guild."
msgstr "整整兩家人都來了，親愛的：就是你幫著辦成婚事的那兩家。他們想跟公會好好談談。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:326
msgid "Two families owe you their wedding, dear. They'll come."
msgstr "兩家人的婚事都多虧了你，親愛的。他們會來的。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:327
msgid "Brought the plough horses. The Guild's carriages can go round."
msgstr "犁地的馬我都牽來了。公會的馬車只好繞道。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:327
msgid "Call, and the whole fair comes, horses and all."
msgstr "你一招呼，整個集市都會來，連人帶馬。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:328
msgid ""
"I carried chests for you. Tonight I'll carry anything that tries to get past this door."
msgstr "我替你搬過箱子。今晚，誰想闖過這扇門，我就把誰搬走。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:328
msgid "I owe you my freedom. Call, and I'll come."
msgstr "我的自由是你給的。你一叫，我就來。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:329
msgid ""
"The Wet Hen's at the river stairs, if anyone needs to leave in a hurry."
msgstr "「溼母雞號」就停在河邊石階下，誰要是得趕緊走，儘管上船。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:329
msgid ""
"Need anything carried away from the Guild quietly? Ask for the Wet Hen."
msgstr "有什麼東西要悄悄運離公會的眼皮底下？找「溼母雞號」。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:339
msgid "So. Let me tell you what became of everyone, this season."
msgstr "好了。讓我跟你說說，這一季大夥兒後來都怎麼樣了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:343
msgid ""
"And you. Bram's kin, with the mark on your hand. What becomes of you is up to you."
msgstr "還有你。布拉姆的親族，手上帶著鑰紋。你將來會怎樣，就看你自己了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:358
msgid ""
"The tune's in here. And your family knows every verse: all nine Heartsongs. Then we don't renew the Locking. We finish it."
msgstr "曲調就在這裡面。而你們家知道每一段：全部九首心歌。那我們就不必重續大封鎖了。我們要了結它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:359
msgid ""
"Listen. That's the Maw. Starving, with nothing left to want. The Gate's just a gate now."
msgstr "聽。那是巨口。它在捱餓，再也沒有什麼可貪求的了。大門如今只是一道門而已。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:360
msgid ""
"And the chests, Mara. Every chest in Aldmark. They're opening. All of them, all at once."
msgstr "還有那些寶箱，瑪拉。奧德馬克的每一個寶箱。它們都在開啟。全部，一齊開啟。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:361
msgid ""
"The Guild has nothing to sell, and nothing to keep. Go home, Mister Vane."
msgstr "公會已經無物可賣，也無物可守。回家去吧，韋恩先生。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:362
msgid ""
"Three hundred years of treasure, back in the light. We're going to need a bigger stall."
msgstr "三百年的財寶，重見天日。咱們得換個更大的攤位了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:366
msgid ""
"Listen. The Gate's gone quiet. The Locking holds: another three hundred years, if we're lucky."
msgstr "聽。大門安靜下來了。大封鎖依然穩固：運氣好的話，還能再撐三百年。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:367
msgid ""
"King Aldric's own hoard, on our counter. The old man said it's ours to keep."
msgstr "奧德里克國王自己的寶藏，就擺在咱們櫃檯上。那老人家說，這些都歸咱們了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:370
msgid ""
"The Locking was a song, in nine verses: nine Heartsongs, hidden in chests. If you ever hear one sing, keep it."
msgstr "大封鎖本是一首歌，共有九段：九首心歌，藏在寶箱裡。哪天你聽到其中一首在唱，就收下它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:371
msgid ""
"Your family knows {0} of the nine Heartsongs. Find every verse, and the next Keywright won't renew the Locking. They'll finish it."
msgstr "九首心歌，你們家已經知道了{0}首。找齊每一段，下一位鑰匠就不必重續大封鎖，而能了結它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:372
msgid ""
"The Guild will keep coming, you know. Debts are funny things. But now we can afford to make them wait."
msgstr "公會還會再來的，你知道。債這東西，就是這麼古怪。不過現在，咱們有本錢讓他們等著了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:379
msgid ""
"{0} weeks, and every coin of the tithe paid. Let them have the building: they can't have the mark."
msgstr "{0}周，貢金一文不少，全都付清了。房子讓他們拿去吧：鑰紋他們可拿不走。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:380
msgid ""
"So soon? Well. We'll start again somewhere. A good ear is never broke for long."
msgstr "這麼快？唉，好吧。咱們找個地方從頭再來。耳朵好使的人，窮不了多久。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:381
msgid ""
"{0} weeks. You did better than I ever did. We'll start again somewhere."
msgstr "{0}周。你比我當年強多了。咱們找個地方從頭再來。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:62
msgid ", {0} or better"
msgstr "，{0}及以上"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:81
msgid "Goldsmith"
msgstr "金匠"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:81
msgid "Coin and gems"
msgstr "錢幣與寶石"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:82
msgid ""
"Moneychangers and jewellers come your way: coin and gems turn up {0} more often, and they sell for {1} more."
msgstr "錢商和珠寶商紛紛上門：錢幣與寶石出現的頻率提高{0}，售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:86
msgid "Armourer"
msgstr "軍械匠"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:87
msgid ""
"Soldiers, knights and dwarves come {0} more often, and weapons sell for {1} more."
msgstr "士兵、騎士和矮人上門的頻率提高{0}，兵器售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:91
msgid "Apothecary"
msgstr "藥劑師"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:92
msgid "{0}, and potions sell for {1} more."
msgstr "{0}，藥水售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:92
msgid "Glass never breaks, dropped or forced"
msgstr "無論摔箱還是強行開鎖，玻璃都不會碎"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:92
msgid "Glass is {0} less likely to break"
msgstr "玻璃破碎的機率降低{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:96
msgid "Spellkeeper"
msgstr "守咒人"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:97
msgid ""
"People trust you with secrets: chests are {0} likelier to have a false bottom, and spells sell for {1} more."
msgstr "人們放心把秘密託付給你：寶箱有夾層的機率提高{0}，法術售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:101
msgid "Cloakmaker"
msgstr "斗篷匠"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:102
msgid ""
"Fine drapery: your exhibition counts +{0}, and cloaks sell for {1} more."
msgstr "布料精美：你的展覽值+{0}，斗篷售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:106
msgid "Keen Eye"
msgstr "慧眼"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:106
msgid "Perfect reads in a row"
msgstr "連續完美判斷"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:106
msgid "perfect reads in a row"
msgstr "連續完美判斷"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:108
msgid "A perfect read earns you a valuer's fee: {0} of what the chest held."
msgstr "完美判斷能為你賺得鑑定費：寶箱所值的{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:112
msgid "Lucky Shop"
msgstr "幸運小店"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:112
msgid "Surprises"
msgstr "驚喜"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:112
msgid "things better than their chest"
msgstr "優於寶箱品質的物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:114
msgid ""
"Luck follows a lucky shop: everything you open is {0} likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "好運眷顧幸運小店：你開啟的每件物品品質提升一級的機率提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:118
msgid "Finder"
msgstr "尋寶人"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:118
msgid "False bottoms and wards"
msgstr "夾層與結界"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:118
msgid "hidden or warded things found"
msgstr "找到的夾層或結界物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:120
msgid ""
"Chests are {0} likelier to have a false bottom, and what you find under one or name in a ward sells for {1} more."
msgstr "寶箱有夾層的機率提高{0}；夾層裡找到的、或在結界中說中的物品，售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:124
msgid "Haggler"
msgstr "議價高手"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:124
msgid "Chests talked down"
msgstr "砍價成功的寶箱"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:124
msgid "chests talked down or named a price for"
msgstr "砍價成功或自己定價的寶箱"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:126
msgid ""
"Word of a hard bargainer: hagglers and sellers who wait for an offer settle for {0} less."
msgstr "砍價高手的名聲傳開了：會討價還價的賣家和等你出價的賣家，成交價降低{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:130
msgid "Arcanist"
msgstr "秘法師"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:130
msgid "Enchanted things found"
msgstr "找到附魔物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:130
msgid "enchanted things"
msgstr "附魔物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:132
msgid ""
"Mages seek you out: each thing is {0} likelier to be enchanted, and enchanted things sell for {1} more."
msgstr "法師們慕名而來：每件物品附魔的機率提高{0}，附魔物品售價提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:19
msgid "The Hedge-wright"
msgstr "黑鑰匠"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:20
msgid ""
"Jasper Wick has the mark and no licence, and he's set up his cart across the road from the stall."
msgstr "賈斯珀·威克有鑰紋，卻沒有執照。他把貨車停在了攤位對面的路邊。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:28
msgid ""
"Jasper Wick, hedge-wright, at your service and everyone else's. That's my cart across the road. No licence, no tithe, no Guild: just a good ear and a low price."
msgstr "賈斯珀·威克，黑鑰匠，願為你效勞，也為所有人效勞。路對面那輛就是我的貨車。沒執照，不交貢金，不歸公會管：只有一雙好耳朵，外加便宜的價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:30
msgid ""
"There's room at the Crossroads for two of us, isn't there? I'll take the folk you're too slow for."
msgstr "十字路口容得下咱們兩個，不是嗎？你手腳慢、招呼不過來的客人，我來接。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:34
msgid ""
"Jasper Wick, a hedge-wright, set up his cart across the road. He takes one of your customers a day."
msgstr "黑鑰匠賈斯珀·威克在路對面擺起了貨車。他每天會搶走你一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:41
msgid ""
"Mistress Aubel, for the Gilded Guild. A hedge-wright is trading at this crossroads without the Guild's licence. You'll have seen him."
msgstr "我是奧貝爾女士，代表鍍金公會而來。有個黑鑰匠沒有公會執照，就在這個十字路口做買賣。你想必見過他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:43
msgid ""
"The Guild takes hedge-wrights into its counting-houses, as it takes marked children. A name is worth {0}."
msgstr "公會會把黑鑰匠帶進賬房，就像它帶走帶鑰紋的孩子一樣。一個名字值{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:46
msgid "Jasper Wick, across the road"
msgstr "賈斯珀·威克，就在路對面"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:54
msgid ""
"You gave the Mark-Finder Jasper Wick's name. The Guild took him, cart and all."
msgstr "你向尋紋人說出了賈斯珀·威克的名字。公會把他連人帶車都帶走了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:55
msgid "The Guild thanks you, Keywright. A licensed trade is a safe trade."
msgstr "公會感謝你，鑰匠。持證經營，才是安穩經營。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:58
msgid "I've seen no hedge-wright"
msgstr "我沒見過什麼黑鑰匠"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:61
msgid ""
"You told the Mark-Finder you'd seen no hedge-wright. Bram was one for twenty years."
msgstr "你告訴尋紋人，你沒見過什麼黑鑰匠。布拉姆就當了二十年黑鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:62
msgid "No? Then he's a quick one. The Guild will find him."
msgstr "沒見過？那他溜得可真快。公會會找到他的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:70
msgid ""
"Let's settle it like Keywrights: one chest, read in front of the Crossed Keys. Read it right and I'll take my cart to Thornwick. Wrong, and I stay. One coin, and it's yours either way."
msgstr ""
"咱們按鑰匠的規矩來了斷：一個寶箱，當著交鑰酒館所有人的面判斷。你判斷對了，我就把貨車拉去荊棘鎮。判斷錯了，我就留下。一枚金幣，不管輸贏，箱子都歸你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:81
msgid ""
"You read Jasper's chest exactly right in front of the whole Crossed Keys. He took his cart to Thornwick, and his customers came to you."
msgstr "你當著交鑰酒館滿堂客人的面，把賈斯珀的寶箱判斷得分毫不差。他把貨車拉去了荊棘鎮，他的顧客都轉到了你這兒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:87
msgid ""
"You read Jasper's chest wrong in front of the whole Crossed Keys. His cart stays across the road."
msgstr "你當著交鑰酒館滿堂客人的面，把賈斯珀的寶箱判斷錯了。他的貨車還留在路對面。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:93
msgid "You wouldn't read against Jasper. His cart stays across the road."
msgstr "你不肯跟賈斯珀比試判斷。他的貨車還留在路對面。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:99
msgid ""
"Jasper at the back door, his cart packed. \"You've a better ear than me, and you kept the Guild off me besides. If you ever need a hedge-wright's help, send to the Lockless in Thornwick. They'll find me.\""
msgstr "賈斯珀站在後門，貨車已經收拾好了。「你的耳朵比我靈，還替我擋住了公會。哪天要是需要黑鑰匠幫忙，就捎信給荊棘鎮的無鎖黨。他們會找到我。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:104
msgid "Jasper Wick owes you a favour: you kept the Guild off him."
msgstr "賈斯珀·威克欠你一個人情：你替他擋住了公會。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:113
msgid "The Field's Dead"
msgstr "田野亡魂"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:114
msgid ""
"Garrick's plough turned up a knight's chest on Brindle Field, and the knight wants his blade back."
msgstr "加里克在布林德爾田犁出了一位騎士的寶箱，而那位騎士想要回他的劍。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:125
msgid ""
"My plough turned this up on the Field, deep, under a knight's shield. Finder's right: it's mine to sell, and I'd sooner not keep it in the house. {price}."
msgstr "我的犁在地裡翻出了這個，埋得很深，壓在一面騎士盾牌底下。按拾得者之權，它歸我賣，再說我也不想把它留在家裡。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:132
msgid ""
"You bought the knight's chest Garrick ploughed up. Bram set the knight's blade aside: it has a name on it."
msgstr "你買下了加里克犁出來的騎士寶箱。布拉姆把騎士的劍單獨收了起來：劍上刻著名字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:134
msgid "You passed on the knight's chest Garrick ploughed up."
msgstr "你沒有買加里克犁出來的騎士寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:140
msgid ""
"A cold knock, and an old knight in rusted mail at the back door, with the moon through him. \"That blade is mine. Aldwin Gale. I fell on that field before the Locking.\""
msgstr "一陣冰冷的敲門聲。後門口站著一位身披鏽甲的老騎士，月光穿透了他的身體。「那把劍是我的。我是奧爾德溫·蓋爾。大封鎖之前，我戰死在那片田野上。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:142
msgid ""
"\"Give it to my blood. There were Gales in Crownhold, once. I have waited three hundred years: I can wait a little more.\""
msgstr "「把它交給我的血脈。王冠堡從前有過姓蓋爾的人家。我已經等了三百年：再多等些時候也無妨。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:145
msgid "I'll find your family"
msgstr "我會找到你的家人"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:148
msgid ""
"Sir Aldwin Gale's ghost asked you to send his blade to his blood, the Gales of Crownhold. You promised."
msgstr "奧爾德溫·蓋爾爵士的亡魂請你把他的劍送回他的血脈，也就是王冠堡的蓋爾家。你答應了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:149
msgid "\"Then I can rest a while.\" And he's gone, and the night's warm again."
msgstr "「那我可以歇一陣了。」話音剛落，他便消失了，夜晚又暖和了起來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:151
msgid "Finder's right: it's mine to sell ({0}g)"
msgstr "拾得者之權：它歸我賣（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:156
msgid ""
"You sold Sir Aldwin's blade. His ghost walks the Crossroads at dusk now, and folk stay home."
msgstr "你賣掉了奧爾德溫爵士的劍。如今每到黃昏，他的亡魂就在十字路口遊蕩，鄉親們都不敢出門了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:157
msgid ""
"\"Then I'll walk.\" The lamps gutter. Out on the Field, something starts to march."
msgstr "「那我就繼續遊蕩。」燈火搖搖欲滅。田野上，有什麼東西開始列隊行進。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:165
msgid ""
"Bram says you've a blade for me? \"Aldwin Gale\" on the tang... my great-great-grandfather's. The Guild sold our hall, but it never had this. Where did you find it?"
msgstr "布拉姆說你有一把劍要給我？劍莖上刻著「奧爾德溫·蓋爾」……是我高祖父的。公會賣掉了我們的宅邸，可這把劍它從來沒得到過。你是在哪兒找到的？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:167
msgid ""
"I can't pay what it's worth. But my house has a claim on the best blade in any chest I sell, and from today it's yours, not mine. And the Gales owe you."
msgstr "它值多少，我付不起。不過我家族對我所賣箱子裡最好的那把劍享有索回之權，從今天起，這份權利歸你，不歸我。蓋爾家欠你一份情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:175
msgid ""
"You gave Sir Rowan his ancestor's blade. The best weapon in his chests is yours now, and the Gales owe you a favour."
msgstr "你把羅文爵士祖先的劍交給了他。如今他箱子裡最好的兵器歸你了，蓋爾家也欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:181
msgid ""
"One last cold knock. \"My blood has my blade. I can lie down now. Take this: it was in my purse when I fell, and I've no use for it.\" A coin, three hundred years old, warm as a hand."
msgstr ""
"最後一次冰冷的敲門聲。「我的血脈拿到了我的劍。我可以安息了。收下這個：我倒下時它就在我的錢袋裡，我已經用不著了。」那是一枚三百年前的錢幣，溫暖得像一隻手。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:186
msgid "Sir Aldwin Gale lay down at last, and left you {0}."
msgstr "奧爾德溫·蓋爾爵士終於安息了，給你留下了{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:195
msgid "The Crossed Keys"
msgstr "交鑰酒館"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:196
msgid ""
"The Guild has doubled the Crossed Keys' tithe, and Bettany Crane is a purse short."
msgstr "公會把交鑰酒館的貢金翻了一倍，貝塔妮·克雷恩還差一筆錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:204
msgid ""
"The Guild's doubled the inn's tithe, love. \"The Crossed Keys does a good trade\", Vane says. It did, till he came."
msgstr "公會把酒館的貢金翻了一倍，親愛的。韋恩說：「交鑰酒館生意興隆。」在他來之前，是挺興隆的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:205
msgid ""
"I'm {0} short, and they'll seal the doors if I can't pay. Lend it me, and you'll have it back and half again by the next Guild night. On my mother's grave."
msgstr "我還差{0}，要是交不上，他們就要封門了。借給我吧，下一個公會之夜之前，我如數奉還，再多給你一半。我拿我孃的墳起誓。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:209
msgid "Lend her the money ({0}g)"
msgstr "借錢給她（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:212
msgid "Bettany, to repay you"
msgstr "貝塔妮，來還錢"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:213
msgid ""
"You lent Bettany what she was short for the Guild. She'll pay you back, and half again."
msgstr "你把貝塔妮交公會差的錢借給了她。她會還你，還會多給你一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:214
msgid ""
"You're a love. Half again, by the next Guild night. On my mother's grave."
msgstr "你真是個好人。下一個公會之夜之前，多給你一半。我拿我孃的墳起誓。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:216
msgid "I can't spare it"
msgstr "我拿不出這筆錢"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:219
msgid "You couldn't lend Bettany what she was short for the Guild."
msgstr "貝塔妮交公會還差一筆錢，你沒能借給她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:220
msgid "No. No, of course. Who has, these days?"
msgstr "不行啊。不行，當然了。這年頭誰拿得出來呢？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:227
msgid ""
"{0}, love: what I owed and half again. The Crossed Keys is still mine. If you ever need a room, a meal or a word in the right ear, it's yours."
msgstr "{0}，親愛的：欠你的，再加一半。交鑰酒館還是我的。哪天你需要一間房、一頓飯，或者需要有人在要緊的人耳邊替你說句話，儘管開口。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:235
msgid ""
"Bettany paid you back, and half again. The Crossed Keys stays open, and she owes you a favour."
msgstr "貝塔妮把錢還給了你，還多給了一半。交鑰酒館保住了，她也欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:241
msgid ""
"A Guild notice, nailed to the Crossed Keys' door and copied to every shop at the crossroads: \"SEALED for tithe unpaid, by order of the Gilded Guild. Marrow, Bailiff.\" Bettany's gone north to her sister's."
msgstr ""
"一張公會告示釘在交鑰酒館門上，十字路口的每家店鋪都收到了抄件：「本店因拖欠貢金，奉鍍金公會之令查封。法警馬羅。」貝塔妮已經北上投奔她姐姐去了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:247
msgid ""
"The Guild sealed the Crossed Keys for its tithe. Bettany has gone north, and won't be back this season."
msgstr "公會因貢金查封了交鑰酒館。貝塔妮北上去了，這一季都不會回來了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:256
msgid "The Harvest Fair"
msgstr "豐收集市"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:257
msgid ""
"The harvest fair comes to Brindle, and Garrick wants the new Keywright to put up the reading contest's prize."
msgstr "豐收集市來到布林德爾，加里克想請新來的鑰匠出鑑箱比賽的獎金。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:265
msgid ""
"Harvest fair's the day after tomorrow, and the whole county comes. There's a reading contest: a chest nobody's opened, and a prize for whoever reads it right."
msgstr "後天就是豐收集市，全郡的人都會來。集市上有個鑑箱比賽：一隻沒人開過的寶箱，誰判斷對了，獎金就歸誰。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:267
msgid ""
"Bram always put up the prize. Will you? {0}, and your name on the banner."
msgstr "獎金一向是布拉姆出的。你來出嗎？{0}，橫幅上就寫你的名字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:270
msgid "Put up the prize ({0}g)"
msgstr "出獎金（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:274
msgid ""
"You put up the harvest fair's prize. Your name's on the banner, and the county will come past the stall."
msgstr "你出了豐收集市的獎金。橫幅上寫著你的名字，全郡的人都會從攤位前經過。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:275
msgid ""
"Bram's kin, on the banner! Half the county'll come past your stall on the day."
msgstr "布拉姆的親族上橫幅啦！到那天，半個郡的人都會從你攤位前經過。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:277
msgid "Not this year"
msgstr "今年就算了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:279
msgid "You didn't put up the harvest fair's prize. The miller did."
msgstr "你沒出豐收集市的獎金。磨坊主出了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:280
msgid "The miller, then. He'll want his name bigger than Bram's ever was."
msgstr "那就磨坊主出吧。他準要把自己的名字寫得比布拉姆當年的還大。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:289
msgid ""
"The fair's chest! Read it right in front of the whole county, and the prize is yours: your own money back, and the miller's on top. One coin to enter."
msgstr "集市的寶箱來啦！當著全郡人的面判斷對了，獎金就歸你：你自己出的錢拿回去，再加上磨坊主那份。報名只要一枚金幣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:291
msgid ""
"The fair's chest, and the miller's prize. Read it right in front of the whole county and it's yours. One coin to enter."
msgstr "集市的寶箱，獎金是磨坊主出的。當著全郡人的面判斷對了，獎金就歸你。報名只要一枚金幣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:300
msgid ""
"You read the fair's chest exactly right, and won the prize. The county cheered; Garrick says he owes you a pint and a favour."
msgstr "你把集市的寶箱判斷得分毫不差，贏得了獎金。全郡的人都在歡呼；加里克說他欠你一杯酒，外加一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:305
msgid ""
"You read the fair's chest wrong, in front of the whole county. The miller's boy won."
msgstr "你當著全郡人的面，把集市的寶箱判斷錯了。磨坊主的兒子贏了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:308
msgid "You didn't enter the fair's reading contest."
msgstr "你沒有參加集市的鑑箱比賽。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:317
msgid ""
"The Guild took Jasper Wick to a counting-house, and sold his cart. He was a hedge-wright, like I was. I keep thinking that."
msgstr "公會把賈斯珀·威克帶進了一間賬房，還賣掉了他的貨車。他是個黑鑰匠，跟我當年一樣。我老是想著這件事。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:319
msgid ""
"I've a cellar in Crownhold now, and the Lockless bring me every chest their grandmothers ever locked. Best ear at the Crossroads? Yours, Keywright."
msgstr "我現在在王冠堡有個地窖，無鎖黨把他們祖母那輩鎖上的箱子全都送來給我。十字路口誰的耳朵最靈？是你，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:321
msgid ""
"Still across the road, still cheaper than you, and still no licence. Come and have a drink with the competition some time."
msgstr "還在路對面，還比你便宜，也還是沒有執照。哪天過來，跟你的對手喝一杯吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:322
msgid ""
"Jasper Wick traded across the road all season. The Guild never caught him. I hope it never does."
msgstr "賈斯珀·威克在路對面做了一整季買賣。公會始終沒抓到他。但願永遠也抓不到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:328
msgid ""
"Great-great-grandfather's blade hangs in the Gales' hall again, and he walks no more. The Gales don't forget a debt, Keywright."
msgstr "高祖父的劍又掛回了蓋爾家的大廳，他也不再遊蕩了。蓋爾家不會忘記欠下的情，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:330
msgid ""
"Sir Aldwin still walks Brindle Field at dusk, looking for his blade. Garrick won't plough the north end. Can't blame him."
msgstr "每到黃昏，奧爾德溫爵士還在布林德爾田上游蕩，尋找他的劍。加里克再也不肯去犁北頭那塊地了。也怪不得他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:332
msgid ""
"Sir Aldwin's blade is still in our back room, waiting for a Gale. He's patient. He's had the practice."
msgstr "奧爾德溫爵士的劍還在咱們後屋裡，等著蓋爾家的人。他有的是耐心。這本事他早練出來了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:333
msgid ""
"Sold the knight's chest to a tinker in the end. He came back the next week, white as milk, and gave it back."
msgstr "騎士的那個箱子，最後我賣給了一個補鍋匠。第二週他就回來了，臉白得像牛奶，把箱子退給了我。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:339
msgid ""
"The Crossed Keys is still mine, love, and there's always a pint behind the bar with your name on it. Bram's too, the old soak."
msgstr "交鑰酒館還是我的，親愛的，吧檯後頭永遠有一杯寫著你名字的酒。布拉姆也有一杯，那個老酒鬼。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:341
msgid ""
"The Guild sealed the Crossed Keys. Bettany's up north with her sister. The crossroads is quieter than I've ever known it."
msgstr "公會查封了交鑰酒館。貝塔妮去北邊投奔她姐姐了。十字路口從沒像現在這樣冷清過。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:342
msgid "I found the money in the end. Don't ask where, love."
msgstr "最後我還是湊到了錢。別問是從哪兒來的，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:349
msgid ""
"Put up the prize and won it back! Folk are still talking about it. Best harvest fair since Bram's day."
msgstr "自己出獎金，又自己贏回去！鄉親們到現在還津津樂道。這是布拉姆那會兒以來最棒的一屆豐收集市。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:350
msgid ""
"The miller's still sore you won his prize. Best harvest fair since Bram's day, and that's saying something."
msgstr "你贏走了磨坊主出的獎金，他到現在還耿耿於懷。這是布拉姆那會兒以來最棒的一屆豐收集市，這話可不是隨便說說的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:352
msgid ""
"The miller's boy read the fair's chest better than Bram's kin. He'll never let you forget it, and neither will I."
msgstr "磨坊主的兒子判斷集市寶箱，比布拉姆的親族還準。他永遠不會讓你忘了這件事，我也不會。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Brindle.cs:353
msgid ""
"Your name was on the banner, and the county came. Next year, enter the contest too."
msgstr "橫幅上寫著你的名字，全郡的人都來了。明年，你也去參加比賽吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:19
msgid ""
"Tilly Mudge hears a bell ringing under the Aldwater at night, and nobody believes her."
msgstr "蒂莉·馬奇夜裡聽見奧德河底下有鐘聲，可誰也不信她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:27
msgid ""
"There's a bell under the Aldwater. I hear it nights, off the old stairs below the palace, ringing when there's no wind and no current. Nobody believes me."
msgstr "奧德河底下有一口鐘。夜裡我總聽見它在響，就在王宮下面那段老石階附近，沒風也沒水流的時候它也響。可誰都不信我。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:29
msgid ""
"A mudlark hears what's in the mud. Same as you hear what's in a chest. You believe me, don't you?"
msgstr "河灘拾荒人聽得出泥裡有什麼。就像你聽得出箱子裡有什麼。你信我的，對吧？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:32
msgid "I believe you"
msgstr "我相信你"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:35
msgid "Tilly Mudge hears a bell under the Aldwater. You believe her."
msgstr "蒂莉·馬奇聽見奧德河底下有鐘聲。你相信了她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:36
msgid "You do? Then I'll find exactly where. Give me two days."
msgstr "你信？那我去找準它到底在哪兒。給我兩天時間。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:38
msgid "The river's full of noises"
msgstr "河裡什麼聲音都有"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:40
msgid "Tilly Mudge hears a bell under the Aldwater. You didn't believe her."
msgstr "蒂莉·馬奇聽見奧德河底下有鐘聲。你不信她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:41
msgid "It is. And one of them's a bell."
msgstr "是啊。其中一種就是鐘聲。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:49
msgid ""
"Found it. Under the Keyhold stairs, where the archmages used to come down to the water. It's big, and there's something chained to it."
msgstr "找到了。就在鑰堡的石階底下，從前大法師們都從那兒下到水邊。它很大，上面還用鐵鏈拴著什麼東西。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:51
msgid ""
"A barge and a dredge for a day is {0}. Finder's right: whatever comes up, half's yours."
msgstr "租一條駁船和一臺挖泥機，一天要{0}。按拾得者之權：不管撈上來什麼，都有你一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:54
msgid "Hire the barge ({0}g)"
msgstr "租下駁船（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:57
msgid "Tilly, with the bell"
msgstr "蒂莉，帶著鐘來"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:58
msgid "You hired a barge to dredge Tilly's bell out of the Aldwater."
msgstr "你租了一條駁船，要把蒂莉的鐘從奧德河裡撈上來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:59
msgid "Two days, and we'll have it up. Bring a towel."
msgstr "兩天，咱們就能把它撈上來。帶條毛巾來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:61
msgid "Too dear"
msgstr "太貴了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:63
msgid "You wouldn't pay to dredge Tilly's bell."
msgstr "你不肯出錢打撈蒂莉的鐘。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:64
msgid "Then it'll ring down there a while longer."
msgstr "那它就在下面再多響一陣吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:75
msgid ""
"Up it came, a bell as big as a cart, and this chained to the clapper. Finder's right: half each, and this half's yours. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "撈上來了，一口跟馬車一樣大的鐘，鐘錘上拴著這個。按拾得者之權，一人一半，這一半歸你。一枚金幣，圖個吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:81
msgid ""
"Tilly's bell came up out of the Aldwater, with a chest chained to its clapper: your half, freely given."
msgstr "蒂莉的鐘從奧德河裡撈上來了，鐘錘上拴著一個寶箱：這是你的那一半，誠心相贈。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:86
msgid ""
"Tilly's bell came up out of the Aldwater. You let her keep the chest that was chained to it."
msgstr "蒂莉的鐘從奧德河裡撈上來了。你讓她留下了拴在上面的那個寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:94
msgid ""
"Mara at the back door, soaked to the knees. \"That's the Keyhold's bell. We rang it from the river stairs, and when the Locking was made we hid something in its clapper.\""
msgstr "瑪拉站在後門，膝蓋以下全溼透了。「那是鑰堡的鐘。我們從前在河邊石階上敲它。大封鎖鑄成之時，我們在它的鐘錘裡藏了一樣東西。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:96
msgid ""
"The hooded woman at the back door, soaked to the knees. \"That's the Keyhold's bell. We rang it from the river stairs, and when the Locking was made we hid something in its clapper.\""
msgstr "兜帽女子站在後門，膝蓋以下全溼透了。「那是鑰堡的鐘。我們從前在河邊石階上敲它。大封鎖鑄成之時，我們在它的鐘錘裡藏了一樣東西。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:99
msgid ""
"\"It's empty. Someone was there before us, long ago. Take this for the trouble: Keyhold silver, from the bell's crown.\""
msgstr "「它是空的。很久以前，就有人搶在我們前頭去過了。收下這個，算是辛苦費：鑰堡的銀子，從鐘頂上取下來的。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:100
msgid ""
"\"A shard of the Aldric Key. I've been looking for it for twenty years, and a mudlark heard it ring. It's yours, Keywright.\""
msgstr "「奧德里克之鑰的一塊碎片。我找了它二十年，結果是一個河灘拾荒人聽見了它的響聲。它歸你了，鑰匠。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:106
msgid ""
"A shard of the Aldric Key was hidden in the Keyhold's bell. The Hooded Woman gave it to you."
msgstr "奧德里克之鑰的一塊碎片藏在鑰堡的鐘裡。兜帽女子把它交給了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:111
msgid ""
"The Keyhold's bell was empty. The Hooded Woman paid you in Keyhold silver for the trouble."
msgstr "鑰堡的鐘是空的。兜帽女子用鑰堡的銀子付了你辛苦費。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:121
msgid "The Moneylender"
msgstr "放貸人"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:122
msgid ""
"Mother Tansy of Lantern Lane lends to anyone short for the Guild, against next week's first morning."
msgstr "燈籠巷的坦西婆婆借錢給交不起公會貢金的人，下週第一個早上還錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:130
msgid ""
"Mother Tansy, of Lantern Lane. Short for the Guild? Everyone in Crownhold is, dear. That's my living."
msgstr "燈籠巷的坦西婆婆。交公會的錢不夠？親愛的，王冠堡人人都不夠。我就靠這個過活。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:131
msgid ""
"{0} now, and {1} on the first morning of next week. If it's not there, I take something nice off your shelf. Fair's fair."
msgstr "現在借你{0}，下週第一個早上還我{1}。到時候錢要是不在，我就從你的展架上拿件好東西走。公平合理嘛。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:135 scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:156
msgid "Borrow it (+{0}g)"
msgstr "借下這筆錢（+{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:138
msgid ""
"You borrowed from Mother Tansy, to pay back with a third on top on the first morning of next week."
msgstr "你向坦西婆婆借了錢，下週第一個早上要還，外加三分之一的利息。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:139
msgid "Lovely. My man will call. He's very punctual."
msgstr "好極了。到時我的人會上門。他非常守時。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:141
msgid "No, thank you"
msgstr "不了，謝謝"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:143
msgid "You wouldn't borrow from Mother Tansy."
msgstr "你不肯向坦西婆婆借錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:144
msgid "You know where I am, dear. Everyone does, sooner or later."
msgstr "你知道上哪兒找我，親愛的。人人遲早都會知道的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:152
msgid ""
"You paid on the nail, dear. I like that in a Keywright. So: better terms."
msgstr "你還錢一天都沒拖，親愛的。我就喜歡這樣的鑰匠。所以嘛：給你更好的條件。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:153
msgid ""
"{0} now, and only a quarter on top, on the first morning of next week. For a grander shop, perhaps?"
msgstr "現在借你{0}，下週第一個早上還，利息只要四分之一。拿去換個更氣派的鋪面，怎麼樣？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:159
msgid ""
"You borrowed from Mother Tansy again, on better terms: a quarter on top."
msgstr "你又向坦西婆婆借了錢，條件更優惠：利息四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:160
msgid "Lovely. Same as before, then."
msgstr "好極了。那就跟上回一樣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:162
msgid "I'm square, and I'll stay square"
msgstr "賬已兩清，我不再借了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:164
msgid "You didn't borrow from Mother Tansy again."
msgstr "你沒有再向坦西婆婆借錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:165
msgid "Sensible. Dull, but sensible."
msgstr "明智。無趣，但明智。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:175
msgid "The Duel"
msgstr "決鬥"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:176
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan and Lord Cassian will fight on the Aldwater steps, and someone has to hold the stakes."
msgstr "羅文爵士和卡西安勳爵要在奧德河石階上決鬥，得有人替他們保管賭注。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:184
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian Vell called the Gales a family of debtors across a card table. We meet on the Aldwater steps at dawn, the day after tomorrow."
msgstr "卡西安·維爾勳爵隔著牌桌，罵蓋爾家是一窩欠債鬼。後天黎明，我們在奧德河石階上一決高下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:186
msgid ""
"We each stake a chest, and the winner takes both. Someone honest must hold them. A Keywright's back room, I thought."
msgstr "我們各押一個寶箱，贏的人兩箱都拿走。得找個正直的人保管。我想，鑰匠的後屋正合適。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:189
msgid "I'll hold the stakes"
msgstr "我來保管賭注"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:193
msgid ""
"You're holding the stakes for Sir Rowan's duel with Lord Cassian, in your back room."
msgstr "你在後屋替羅文爵士和卡西安勳爵的決鬥保管賭注。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:194
msgid ""
"Thank you. Dawn, the day after tomorrow. Come and watch, if you've the stomach."
msgstr "多謝。後天黎明。你要是有膽量，就來觀戰吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:196
msgid "It's not my quarrel"
msgstr "這不關我的事"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:198
msgid "You wouldn't hold the stakes for Sir Rowan's duel."
msgstr "你不肯替羅文爵士的決鬥保管賭注。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:199
msgid "No. I suppose it isn't."
msgstr "是啊。我想也是。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:207
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian at the back door, smelling of brandy, with a purse. \"Hand me both stakes tonight, and this is yours. Rowan need never know where they went.\""
msgstr "卡西安勳爵站在後門，一身白蘭地酒氣，手裡拿著一袋錢。「今晚把兩份賭注都交給我，這袋錢就歸你。羅文永遠不必知道它們去了哪兒。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:211
msgid "Take his purse ({0}g)"
msgstr "收下他的錢（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:218
msgid ""
"You sold the duel's stakes to Lord Cassian. Sir Rowan left Crownhold in disgrace, and won't trade with you again."
msgstr "你把決鬥的賭注賣給了卡西安勳爵。羅文爵士顏面掃地，離開了王冠堡，再也不會跟你做買賣了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:219
msgid "\"Splendid. Not a word to anyone, Keywright. Least of all my sister.\""
msgstr "「妙極了。對誰都別提一個字，鑰匠。尤其是我姐姐。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:221
msgid "The stakes stay where they are"
msgstr "賭注哪兒也不去"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:224
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian tried to buy the duel's stakes off you. You sent him away."
msgstr "卡西安勳爵想從你手裡買走決鬥的賭注。你把他打發走了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:225
msgid "\"Honest. How very tiresome.\""
msgstr "「正直。真是無趣透頂。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:234
msgid ""
"I fought with great-great-grandfather's blade, and Cassian's sword broke on it at the third pass. The stakes are mine. A tenth is yours for holding them."
msgstr "我用高祖父的劍應戰，第三回合，卡西安的劍就在它上面斷了。賭注歸我。十分之一歸你，算是保管的酬勞。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:236
msgid ""
"Cassian slipped on the wet steps at the third pass, and yielded. The stakes are mine. A tenth is yours for holding them."
msgstr "第三回合，卡西安在溼滑的石階上滑了一跤，認輸了。賭注歸我。十分之一歸你，算是保管的酬勞。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:237
msgid ""
"Cassian fights better drunk than I do sober. He has the stakes, and I've a cut to remember him by. He left a tenth for you, for holding them."
msgstr "卡西安喝醉了打得都比我清醒時好。賭注歸了他，我身上多了一道傷口，好讓我記住他。他給你留了十分之一，算是保管的酬勞。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:246
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan won his duel with Lord Cassian. You were paid for holding the stakes, and the Gales owe you a favour."
msgstr "羅文爵士在與卡西安勳爵的決鬥中獲勝。你拿到了保管賭注的酬勞，蓋爾家也欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:247
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian won his duel with Sir Rowan. You were paid for holding the stakes, and Rowan owes you a favour for your honesty."
msgstr "卡西安勳爵在與羅文爵士的決鬥中獲勝。你拿到了保管賭注的酬勞，羅文也因你的正直欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:256
msgid "The Archive Fire"
msgstr "檔案館大火"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:257
msgid "Someone has set the Royal Archive alight, and the Chest Roll with it."
msgstr "有人放火燒了皇家檔案館，寶箱名冊也在火中。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:265
msgid ""
"A boy hammering at the back door: \"The Archive's burning! Master Quire's carrying the Roll out himself, and he can't lift the half of it!\""
msgstr "一個男孩使勁捶著後門：「檔案館著火了！奎爾大師正親手往外搬名冊，可他連一半都搬不動！」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:267
msgid ""
"You can see the glow over the rooftops from here. It'll take all night."
msgstr "從這兒就能望見屋頂那邊的火光。這得忙上一整夜。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:270
msgid "Run to help"
msgstr "跑去幫忙"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:275
msgid ""
"You ran to the Archive fire and carried the Chest Roll out with Master Quire, all night."
msgstr "你跑去檔案館的火場，和奎爾大師一起把寶箱名冊往外搬，搬了一整夜。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:276
msgid ""
"You're out of the door before the boy's finished. Nim will find the back door shut tonight."
msgstr "男孩話還沒說完，你就衝出了門。今晚尼姆來時，會發現後門關著。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:278
msgid "It's not my fire"
msgstr "這火與我無關"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:283
msgid ""
"Half the Chest Roll burned in the Archive fire. Master Quire is ruined, and won't be trading this season."
msgstr "寶箱名冊在檔案館大火中燒掉了一半。奎爾大師一蹶不振，這一季都不會再做買賣了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:284
msgid ""
"The glow lasts till dawn. In the morning, half of Crownhold smells of burnt parchment."
msgstr "火光一直亮到天明。到了早上，半個王冠堡都飄著燒焦羊皮紙的氣味。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:292
msgid ""
"We saved the Roll. Every volume. And the fire started in a lamp-oil cask with the Guild's own stamp on it."
msgstr "我們保住了名冊。一卷不少。而且火是從一個燈油桶燒起來的，桶上蓋著公會自己的戳。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:293
msgid ""
"The Guild wanted the Archive's ledgers of its seizures burnt. Here: a fair copy, in your hand and mine. Keep it somewhere they won't think to look."
msgstr "公會想把檔案館裡記錄它查封之事的賬簿燒掉。給你：一份謄清的副本，一半是你的筆跡，一半是我的。把它藏在他們想不到的地方。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:299
msgid ""
"Master Quire gave you a copy of the Archive's ledgers of the Guild's seizures. A paper for the case against the Guild. He owes you a favour."
msgstr "奎爾大師給了你一份檔案館賬簿的副本，上面記著公會的查封。這是一份指控公會的證據。他欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:326
msgid ""
"The Keyhold's bell hangs over the river stairs again, and I ring it for the ferry. A shard of the Key was in it. A mudlark heard it first!"
msgstr "鑰堡的鐘又掛回了河邊石階上頭，我敲它招呼渡船。鑰匙的一塊碎片就藏在裡面。最先聽見它的，可是個河灘拾荒人！"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:328
msgid ""
"The bell came up, and I ring it for the ferry now. The posh ones call me the bell-finder. I call me rich."
msgstr "鐘撈上來了，現在我敲它招呼渡船。那些體面人管我叫「尋鐘人」。我管自己叫「有錢人」。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:329
msgid ""
"It still rings down there, nights. You believed me, though. That's something."
msgstr "夜裡，它還在下面響。不過你信了我。這就不錯了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:335
msgid ""
"You owed me, dear, and I took what you owed off your shelf. No hard feelings. Business is business."
msgstr "你欠了我的錢，親愛的，我就從你的展架上拿走了抵債的東西。別往心裡去。生意歸生意。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:337
msgid ""
"Paid on the nail, every time. If you ever want to go into lending, dear, I'd take you as a partner."
msgstr "每回都按時還清，一天不拖。親愛的，哪天你想幹放貸這行，我收你當合夥人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:338
msgid ""
"You never borrowed a penny from me. I don't know whether to admire you or worry about you."
msgstr "你從沒向我借過一個子兒。我都不知道該佩服你，還是該替你擔心。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:344
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan left Crownhold after the duel that never was. Cassian tells everyone he won it. You know better."
msgstr "那場沒打成的決鬥之後，羅文爵士離開了王冠堡。卡西安逢人便說是他贏了。你心裡清楚得很。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:346
msgid ""
"Cassian apologised to the Gales in the Hall of Keys, in front of everyone. I've rarely enjoyed anything so much."
msgstr "卡西安在鑰匙大廳裡，當著眾人的面向蓋爾家道了歉。我很少這麼痛快過。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:348
msgid ""
"My brother won a duel. He's been insufferable ever since. Thank you for holding the stakes honestly, Keywright."
msgstr "我弟弟贏了一場決鬥。打那以後，他就得意得叫人受不了。謝謝你清清白白地保管了賭注，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:349
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan and Lord Cassian fought on the Aldwater steps. Nobody agrees who won."
msgstr "羅文爵士和卡西安勳爵在奧德河石階上打了一場。到底誰贏了，眾說紛紜。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:355
msgid ""
"The Roll's safe in a new vault, and the Guild's lamp-oil cask is in my office, as evidence. You carried half of it, Keywright."
msgstr "名冊已經安放在新的地庫裡，公會的那個燈油桶就擺在我的辦公室，作為證物。名冊有一半是你搬出來的，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:356
msgid ""
"Half the Chest Roll burned in the Archive fire. Half of Aldmark can't prove whose chests are whose. The Guild's delighted."
msgstr "寶箱名冊在檔案館大火裡燒掉了一半。半個奧德馬克的人都沒法證明哪個箱子是誰的了。公會樂壞了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:21
msgid "The King's Court"
msgstr "御前法庭"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:22
msgid ""
"The King has heard that the Emporium's Keywright has been collecting papers about his Guild."
msgstr "國王聽說，商行的那位鑰匠一直在收集與他的公會有關的文書。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:30
msgid ""
"They tell me the Emporium's Keywright has been collecting papers about my Guild. Ledgers. Registers. Old men's testimony."
msgstr "有人告訴我，商行的鑰匠一直在收集與我的公會有關的文書。賬簿。名冊。老人們的證詞。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:31
msgid ""
"Bring all of it to my court, three days from now. If it's what I think it is, the Guild will answer for it."
msgstr "三天後，把這些全都帶到我的法庭上來。如果真如我所想，公會就得為此負責。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:35 scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:69
msgid "The King's court"
msgstr "御前法庭"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:36
msgid ""
"The King asked for your papers against the Guild, at his court in three days: {0}."
msgstr "國王要你三天後把指控公會的證據帶到御前法庭：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:43
msgid ""
"Mister Vane at the back door, alone, which he never is. \"The Guild hears you've papers for the King. The Guild would much rather have them itself.\""
msgstr "韋恩先生獨自站在後門——他向來不是一個人來的。「公會聽說你有些文書要呈給國王。公會更希望把它們留在自己手裡。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:45
msgid ""
"\"{0}, tonight, and the Guild's friendship. Or keep them, and see how patient the Guild can be.\""
msgstr "「今晚就給你{0}，外加公會的友誼。要麼你就留著它們，看看公會能有多大的耐心。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:48
msgid "Sell them to the Guild ({0}g)"
msgstr "賣給公會（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:55
msgid ""
"You sold your papers against the Guild to Mister Vane, the night before the King's court."
msgstr "御前法庭開庭的前一晚，你把指控公會的證據賣給了韋恩先生。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:56
msgid ""
"\"A sensible Keywright. The Guild remembers its friends.\" He burns them in your grate before he goes."
msgstr "「明智的鑰匠。公會不會忘記它的朋友。」臨走前，他把那些文書丟進你的爐膛燒了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:58
msgid "They're for the King"
msgstr "這些是給國王的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:61
msgid ""
"Mister Vane offered to buy your papers against the Guild. You kept them for the King."
msgstr "韋恩先生想買下你手裡指控公會的證據。你把它們留給了國王。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:62
msgid "\"Then the Guild will see you in court, Keywright.\""
msgstr "「那麼，鑰匠，公會就在法庭上恭候你了。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:72
msgid ""
"My court has seen {0}. The Gilded Guild has robbed my subjects in my name, and fed the Maw with it."
msgstr "我的法庭已經看過了{0}。鍍金公會打著我的名號掠奪我的子民，再拿這些去餵養巨口。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:74
msgid ""
"The Guild is on trial from today, and while it's tried, it takes half its tithe. Mister Vane is to be my guest, in the palace cellars."
msgstr "從今天起，公會接受審判；審理期間，它只能收取一半的貢金。韋恩先生將作為我的客人，住進王宮的地窖。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:77
msgid ""
"My court has seen {0}. It's not enough to try the Guild: they'd call it a Keywright's grudge, and my advisers would agree."
msgstr "我的法庭已經看過了{0}。這還不足以審判公會：他們會說這不過是一個鑰匠的私怨，我的謀臣們也會附和。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:80
msgid "I've cut their tithe once already. Bring me more, and I'll do more."
msgstr "我已經削減過一次他們的貢金了。再給我帶來更多證據，我就能做得更多。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:81
msgid ""
"But it's enough for a decree: the Guild's tithe on Keywrights is cut by a fifth, from tonight."
msgstr "不過這足夠頒一道詔令了：從今晚起，公會向鑰匠徵收的貢金削減五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:90
msgid ""
"By the King's court: the Gilded Guild is on trial, and takes half its tithe while it's tried. Aldric IX, Rex."
msgstr "奉御前法庭之令：鍍金公會接受審判，審理期間只收一半貢金。此令。國王奧德里克九世"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:91
msgid ""
"The King's court put the Gilded Guild on trial. It takes half its tithe while it's tried."
msgstr "御前法庭將鍍金公會交付審判。審理期間，它只收一半貢金。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:98 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1005
msgid "By the King's decree"
msgstr "奉國王詔令"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:98 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1005
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild's tithe on Keywrights is cut by a fifth. Aldric IX, Rex."
msgstr "鍍金公會向鑰匠徵收的貢金削減五分之一。此令。國王奧德里克九世"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:99
msgid ""
"Your papers weren't enough for a trial, but the King cut the Guild's tithe by a fifth."
msgstr "你的證據不足以開審，但國王把公會的貢金削減了五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:101
msgid ""
"Your papers weren't enough for a trial, and the King had already cut the Guild's tithe."
msgstr "你的證據不足以開審，而國王早已削減過公會的貢金了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:110
msgid "The Maw's Bargain"
msgstr "巨口的交易"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:111
msgid ""
"In the debt's last week, the Maw himself comes to the counter with an offer."
msgstr "還債的最後一週，巨口親自來到櫃檯前，提出了一筆交易。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:120
msgid ""
"The air goes thick and sweet. A man in a borrowed body, dripping with rings, leans on your counter. \"Avarax. You know the name. Every coin you've ever touched has been my eye.\""
msgstr "空氣變得濃稠而甜膩。一個借了副軀殼的男人，渾身掛滿戒指，倚在你的櫃檯上。「阿瓦拉克斯。你知道這個名字。你碰過的每一枚錢幣，都是我的眼睛。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:122
msgid ""
"\"You owe my Guild {0}. I'll pay every coin of it tonight. All I want is the Key: the shards in your strongbox. Such a small thing.\""
msgstr "「你欠我的公會{0}。今晚我一文不少地替你付清。我只要那把鑰匙：你錢箱裡的那些碎片。區區小事而已。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:126
msgid "Take his bargain"
msgstr "接受他的交易"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:129
msgid ""
"You gave the Maw the Aldric Key's shards, and he paid Bram's debt. Every coin."
msgstr "你把奧德里克之鑰的碎片交給了巨口，他替布拉姆還清了債務。一文不少。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:130
msgid ""
"\"Done.\" He doesn't take the shards. They're simply gone, and the rings on his fingers are warmer."
msgstr "「成交。」他沒有伸手去拿碎片。碎片就那麼不見了，而他手指上的戒指變得更暖了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:132
msgid "Never"
msgstr "永不"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:136
msgid ""
"The Maw offered to pay the whole debt for the Key. You told him no, to his face."
msgstr "巨口提出替你還清全部債務，換那把鑰匙。你當著他的面拒絕了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:137
msgid ""
"\"Never is such a short word, for a mortal.\" The air clears. The sweetness stays a while."
msgstr "「『永不』二字，出自凡人之口，未免太短命了。」空氣清朗起來。那股甜膩卻久久不散。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:145
msgid ""
"Mara at the back door, white to the lips. \"He came to you himself. And you told him no.\""
msgstr "瑪拉站在後門，嘴唇都白了。「他親自來找你了。而你拒絕了他。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:146
msgid ""
"\"Take this. It was the Keyhold's, and it's waited three hundred years for someone who'd say no to him.\""
msgstr "「收下這個。它曾屬於鑰堡，等了三百年，就等一個敢對他說不的人。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:150
msgid "Mara gave you {0}, for refusing the Maw."
msgstr "因為你拒絕了巨口，瑪拉送了你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:174
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild is on trial in my court, and Mister Vane is my guest in the palace cellars. It will be a long trial. I intend to enjoy it."
msgstr "鍍金公會正在我的法庭上受審，韋恩先生則在王宮地窖裡當我的客人。這會是一場漫長的審判。我打算好好享受。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:176
msgid ""
"You sold the papers to Vane, the night before the King's court. He burned them in our grate. I can still smell it."
msgstr "御前法庭開庭的前一晚，你把那些文書賣給了韋恩。他在咱們的爐膛裡把它們燒了。我現在還聞得到那股味兒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:178
msgid ""
"Your papers weren't enough to try the Guild this time. Keep collecting, Keywright. So will I."
msgstr "這一次，你的證據還不夠審判公會。繼續收集吧，鑰匠。我也會的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:185
msgid ""
"You sold him the Key. The Gilded Gate stands open, and the Maw walks the palace halls in his borrowed body. The Locking won't hold another year."
msgstr "你把鑰匙賣給了他。鍍金之門大開，巨口藉著那副軀殼在王宮的殿堂裡走動。大封鎖再也撐不過一年了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Emporium.cs:187
msgid ""
"He offered you everything you owed, and you said never. I've waited three hundred years to hear someone say that to him."
msgstr "他提出替你還清所有的債，而你說了「永不」。我等了三百年，就為了聽到有人對他這麼說。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:15
msgid ""
"{0} was the Magpie, and she's in my cells. Every chest the Guild foreclosed on this year has gone home. Not a bad season, Keywright."
msgstr "{0}就是喜鵲，現在關在我的牢房裡。公會今年查封的每一個寶箱都物歸原主了。這一季過得不賴，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:19
msgid ""
"{0} spent the season in the Wardens' cells for the Magpie's thefts. The Magpie sends you a black feather now and then. I wouldn't keep them."
msgstr "{0}替喜鵲背了盜竊的黑鍋，在巡守的牢房裡蹲了一整季。喜鵲時不時給你送來一根黑羽毛。換作是我，可不會留著。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:22
msgid ""
"The Magpie still steals from the Guild, and you know her face. She left a black feather on the counter last night. Friends in low places, eh?"
msgstr "喜鵲還在偷公會的東西，而你認得她的臉。昨晚她在櫃檯上留了一根黑羽毛。道上有朋友，是吧？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:23
msgid ""
"The Magpie's still out there, and the Guild's foreclosed chests still won't open. I'll have her one day."
msgstr "喜鵲還在外頭逍遙，公會查封的寶箱也照樣打不開。總有一天我會抓到她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:29
msgid ""
"I swept your counter all season, master, and kept my hand in my pocket. I can hear a coin through an inch of oak now. One day I'll have a stall like yours!"
msgstr "我給你掃了一整季櫃檯，師父，手一直揣在兜裡。現在隔著一寸厚的橡木，我都聽得出裡面有錢幣。總有一天，我也要有個像你這樣的攤位！"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:31
msgid ""
"Pip Hollow opens the Guild's chests in a counting-house in Crownhold now. Wynn left the mill. Nobody at Brindle says your name the way they used to."
msgstr "皮普·霍洛如今在王冠堡的一間賬房裡，替公會開箱子。溫離開了磨坊。布林德爾再沒人像從前那樣唸叨你的名字了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:33
msgid ""
"The Guild found Pip Hollow at the fair. Wynn went after him to Crownhold, and nobody's heard from either of them since."
msgstr "公會在集市上找到了皮普·霍洛。溫追著他去了王冠堡，從那以後，母子倆都音訊全無。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:34
msgid ""
"I still fish the millpond, with my hand in my pocket. Nobody's looked at it yet. Mum says nobody will."
msgstr "我還在磨坊池塘裡撈東西，手一直揣在兜裡。還沒人看過我的手。媽媽說，永遠不會有人看的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:41
msgid ""
"Jory's home, and Rafe's sword is over the fire. The Kettles eat at their own table again, dear, and we owe it all to you."
msgstr "喬裡回家了，雷夫的劍掛在爐火上方。凱特爾家又在自家飯桌上吃飯了，孩子，這全都多虧了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:42
msgid ""
"Jory's home, dear, and working the Barrow road with a cart. We eat at our own table again, and we owe that to you."
msgstr "喬裡回家了，孩子，在古冢那條路上趕車跑活兒。我們又在自家飯桌上吃飯了，這多虧了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:44
msgid ""
"Jory Kettle's still in the Guild's debt-house. Ada goes up to Crownhold every week with bread, and comes back without it."
msgstr "喬裡·凱特爾還關在公會的債務監獄裡。艾達每週都帶著麵包上王冠堡去，回來時兩手空空。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:45
msgid ""
"Ada Kettle never found Rafe's sword, and Jory's still in the debt-house. Some seasons nobody wins."
msgstr "艾達·凱特爾始終沒找到雷夫的劍，喬裡也還關在債務監獄裡。有些季節，誰都不是贏家。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:51
msgid ""
"Half a hoard from behind the deep door, and I've never been down since. I've a farm now. Cows don't fall on you."
msgstr "深處之門後的寶藏我分到了一半，從那以後再也沒下去過。現在我有座農場了。奶牛可不會塌下來砸你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:53
msgid ""
"I limp now, and I laugh about it at the Crossed Keys. You paid to dig me out. I don't forget that, Keywright."
msgstr "我現在走路一瘸一拐的，還在交鑰酒館裡拿這個說笑。是你出錢把我挖出來的。這份情我忘不了，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:55
msgid ""
"Nobody's been down to the Barrow's deep door since Tobin. Bettany keeps a candle lit in the window for him."
msgstr "自從託賓出事以後，再沒人下到古冢的深處之門去了。貝塔妮在窗前為他點著一支蠟燭。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:56
msgid ""
"Tobin found somebody else to stake him for the deep door. Or didn't. Nobody at the Crossed Keys will say."
msgstr "託賓找了別人資助他去闖深處之門。也可能沒找到。交鑰酒館裡誰也不肯說。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:62
msgid ""
"The oaks are standing, and will stand. Twice you refused them. The Wood remembers its friends, Keywright, for a very long time."
msgstr "橡樹依然屹立，也將永遠屹立。你兩次拒絕了他們。古林會記住它的朋友，鑰匠，記很久很久。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:64
msgid ""
"The Guild's axes went into the Old Wood at the full moon. The druids don't come to market now, and the fair folk don't come at all."
msgstr "月圓之時，公會的斧頭砍進了古林。如今德魯伊們不來趕集了，仙靈更是一個都不來了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:66
msgid ""
"Your mark's on the Guild's deed for the Old Wood. They've felled the edge of it. Mother Sorrel looks through you at market."
msgstr "公會的古林契據上有你的鑰紋。他們已經把林子的邊緣砍光了。在集市上，索蕾爾婆婆看你的眼神就像看空氣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:67
msgid ""
"The Guild found another Keywright for the Wood's deed, or hasn't yet. The oaks are still standing, for now."
msgstr "公會為古林的契據另找了一位鑰匠，也可能還沒找到。橡樹暫時還屹立著。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:73
msgid ""
"Corvin's in the Wardens' cells, for a parcel you handed them. The Lockless won't forget that, and neither will he."
msgstr "科爾文因為你交出去的那個包裹，被關進了巡守的牢房。無鎖黨忘不了這件事，他也忘不了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:75
msgid ""
"I bought my boat, Keywright. If you ever need anything carried quietly down the Aldwater, ask for the Wet Hen."
msgstr "我買下自己的船了，鑰匠。哪天你要是有東西想悄悄順著奧德河運走，就找「溼母雞號」。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:77
msgid ""
"The Wardens found Corvin's parcel in our back room and fined us for it. Corvin says it wasn't our fault. It was, a bit."
msgstr "巡守在咱們後屋搜出了科爾文的包裹，罰了咱們的款。科爾文說這不怪咱們。其實嘛，多少也怪咱們。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:84
msgid ""
"By my decree, the Guild takes a fifth less from every Keywright in Aldmark. Master Quire says the Roll has never been so busy."
msgstr "依我的詔令，公會向奧德馬克每一位鑰匠收的錢都少了五分之一。奎爾大師說，名冊從來沒這麼忙過。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:86
msgid ""
"You sold the Roll's copy to the Guild. Tobias Fenn never came back to the counting-house. Nobody's looked for him."
msgstr "你把名冊的副本賣給了公會。託拜厄斯·芬恩再也沒回賬房。也沒人去找過他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:88
msgid ""
"The Roll's copy is still waiting for the King's eyes. The Guild's seized chests still won't open. One day someone will listen."
msgstr "名冊的副本還在等國王過目。公會查封的寶箱照樣打不開。總有一天會有人聽進去的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:89
msgid ""
"Half the chests the Guild forecloses on still won't open for anyone. Tobias Fenn still wonders why. So do I."
msgstr "公會查封的寶箱，仍有一半誰也打不開。託拜厄斯·芬恩還在納悶為什麼。我也納悶。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:95
msgid ""
"Orme never rebuilt her engine. I'm an archmage's apprentice still, and the Locking holds. I can live with both."
msgstr "奧姆再也沒有重造她的機器。我還是大法師的學徒，大封鎖也依然穩固。這兩樣我都能接受。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:97
msgid ""
"Orme's engine opens one chest in three for anybody, and the Maw's gilt leaks into every purse. That's on all of us."
msgstr "奧姆的機器讓三分之一的寶箱誰都能開啟，巨口的鍍金也滲進了每一個錢袋。這筆賬，咱們人人有份。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:99
msgid ""
"The Guild took Archmage Orme away, engine and all. Ilse runs the Arcanum's stores alone, and won't look at you."
msgstr "公會把大法師奧姆連人帶機器一起帶走了。伊爾絲獨自打理秘法院的庫房，連看都不願看你一眼。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:100
msgid ""
"Archmage Orme's still building something in the Arcanum's cellar. I'd keep my blood to myself."
msgstr "大法師奧姆還在秘法院的地窖裡造著什麼東西。換作是我，就把自己的血留好。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:106
msgid ""
"The Ironroot Crown is home, Keywright, under the mountain where it was forged. Every dwarf in Aldmark knows your name now."
msgstr "鐵根王冠回家了，鑰匠，回到了鍛造它的那座山底下。如今奧德馬克的每個矮人都知道你的名字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:107
msgid ""
"The crown's still in the King's treasury, and the Guild still calls our gold contraband. One day."
msgstr "王冠還在國王的寶庫裡，公會也還管我們的金子叫違禁品。總有一天。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:113
msgid ""
"Cassian has stopped playing cards, mostly, and grandmother's boxes are mine. House Vell owes you, Keywright, and we pay our debts."
msgstr "卡西安差不多已經戒了牌，祖母的盒子也都歸了我。維爾家族欠你的情，鑰匠，而我們有債必還。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:115
msgid ""
"A night in the Wardens' cells cured my brother of cards, for a month. That's a month more than anyone else managed."
msgstr "在巡守的牢房裡蹲了一晚，治好了我弟弟的牌癮，管了一個月。這比誰的法子都多管用了一個月。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:116
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian still sells his sister's chests for stakes at cards. They still won't open for anyone who buys them."
msgstr "卡西安勳爵還在變賣他姐姐的寶箱換賭本。誰買了都還是打不開。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:122
msgid ""
"Skrae's somewhere quiet, it said, where nobody's heard of the Maw. I hope it's true. It was a good sort, for a demon."
msgstr "斯克雷說它去了個清靜的地方，那兒沒人聽說過巨口。但願是真的。作為惡魔，它算是個好傢伙。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:124
msgid ""
"Tick took Skrae back through the Gate. You were paid for it. I don't like to think about what the Maw does to runaways."
msgstr "嘀嗒把斯克雷押回了大門那邊。你為此拿了錢。巨口會怎麼處置逃跑的傢伙，我想都不願想。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Endings.cs:125
msgid "Skrae still listens at the Gate, and still hates every word of it."
msgstr "斯克雷還在大門那邊偷聽，也還是厭惡聽到的每一個字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:19
msgid "The Reeve's Election"
msgstr "鎮長選舉"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:20
msgid ""
"Thornwick elects a reeve: the Guild's timber factor, or Martha Dunning the weaver. The winner sets the market's tolls."
msgstr "荊棘鎮要選鎮長：要麼是公會的木材代理商，要麼是織工瑪莎·鄧寧。誰當選，誰就定集市的過路費。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:28
msgid ""
"Thornwick chooses its reeve at the week's end, and I'm standing. The Guild would take it kindly if the market's Keywright spoke for me."
msgstr "荊棘鎮這週末選鎮長，我參選了。要是集市上的鑰匠肯替我說幾句話，公會會很領情的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:30
msgid ""
"A reeve keeps the roads, and roads want tolls. Nothing a busy shop would notice."
msgstr "鎮長要管道路，道路就得收過路費。生意興隆的店鋪壓根不會在意這點錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:33
msgid "I'll speak for you"
msgstr "我替你說話"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:37
msgid "You spoke for Harl Caskett in the reeve's election."
msgstr "你在鎮長選舉中替哈爾·卡斯克特說了話。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:38
msgid "Splendid. The Guild remembers its friends."
msgstr "妙極了。公會不會忘記它的朋友。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:40 scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:63
msgid "I'll keep out of it"
msgstr "我不摻和"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:42
msgid "You kept out of the reeve's election, so far."
msgstr "到目前為止，你沒有摻和鎮長選舉。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:43
msgid "As you like. It won't make any difference."
msgstr "隨你。反正也改變不了什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:51
msgid ""
"Martha Dunning, weaver, and Caskett's only rival for reeve. If he wins there's a toll on every cart into Thornwick, and every chest at this market costs a tenth more. And the Wood comes down."
msgstr ""
"我是織工瑪莎·鄧寧，卡斯克特競選鎮長的唯一對手。要是他贏了，每輛進荊棘鎮的車都得交過路費，這集市上的每個寶箱都要貴上十分之一。古林也會被砍光。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:53
msgid ""
"He's the Guild's money. I've my loom. Pay for my crier, {0}, and the market will hear my side."
msgstr "他有公會的錢撐腰。我只有我的織布機。替我出錢請個傳令員吧，{0}，好讓全集市都聽聽我的說法。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:56
msgid "Pay for her crier ({0}g)"
msgstr "替她請傳令員（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:60
msgid "You paid for Martha Dunning's crier in the reeve's election."
msgstr "在鎮長選舉中，你出錢替瑪莎·鄧寧請了傳令員。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:61
msgid "Then Thornwick will hear it from one end to the other. Thank you."
msgstr "那荊棘鎮從這頭到那頭，人人都會聽到了。謝謝你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:65
msgid "You wouldn't pay for Martha Dunning's crier."
msgstr "你不肯出錢替瑪莎·鄧寧請傳令員。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:66
msgid "Then it's the Guild's money against my loom. We know how that goes."
msgstr "那就是公會的錢對上我的織布機了。結果如何，大家心裡有數。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:74
msgid ""
"Martha Dunning is reeve of Thornwick, by forty votes. Her first act: the market stays open late, and every road in is free. You'll see more folk at your counter, while you trade here."
msgstr "瑪莎·鄧寧以四十票之差勝出，當選荊棘鎮鎮長。她上任頭一件事：集市開到深夜，所有進鎮的路一律免費通行。只要你還在這裡開店，櫃檯前就會多些客人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:76
msgid ""
"Harl Caskett is reeve of Thornwick. His first act: a toll on every cart into the market. Thornwick's traders will be asking a tenth more, and they'll tell you why."
msgstr "哈爾·卡斯克特當上了荊棘鎮鎮長。他上任頭一件事：每輛進集市的車都得交過路費。荊棘鎮的商販要價會貴上十分之一，他們也會告訴你為什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:84
msgid "Reeve Dunning's market"
msgstr "鄧寧鎮長的集市"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:84
msgid ""
"Thornwick's market stays open late, and every road in is free: one more customer a day while you trade at Thornwick."
msgstr "荊棘鎮集市開到深夜，所有進鎮的路一律免費：在荊棘鎮開店期間，每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:85
msgid ""
"Martha Dunning won. Thornwick's market stays open late: one more customer a day while you trade at Thornwick."
msgstr "瑪莎·鄧寧勝選了。荊棘鎮集市開到深夜：在荊棘鎮開店期間，每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:90
msgid "Reeve Caskett's tolls"
msgstr "卡斯克特鎮長的過路費"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:90
msgid ""
"A toll on every cart into Thornwick: Thornwick's regulars ask a tenth more."
msgstr "每輛進荊棘鎮的車都要交過路費：荊棘鎮的常客要價貴十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:91
msgid ""
"Harl Caskett won. His tolls put a tenth on everything Thornwick's regulars sell you."
msgstr "哈爾·卡斯克特勝選了。他的過路費讓荊棘鎮常客賣給你的每樣東西都貴了十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:101
msgid "The Goblin Bounty"
msgstr "哥布林懸賞"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:102
msgid ""
"The abbey has put a bounty on the hill goblins, and Rook wants to know where Nettle's clan burrows."
msgstr "修道院懸賞捉拿山裡的哥布林，魯克想知道蕁麻的部族把地洞打在哪兒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:110
msgid ""
"The abbey's put a bounty on the hill goblins for its crypt thefts. I'd sooner catch the Magpie, but a bounty's a bounty, and goblins don't run as fast."
msgstr "修道院為墓穴失竊的事，懸賞捉拿山裡的哥布林。我倒寧願去抓喜鵲，可賞金就是賞金，再說哥布林跑得也沒那麼快。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:112
msgid ""
"You trade with Nettle. Where does her clan burrow? I'll give you a share."
msgstr "你跟蕁麻做買賣。她的部族把地洞打在哪兒？我分你一份。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:115
msgid "Under the three stones on Crow Hill"
msgstr "在烏鴉崗的三塊石頭底下"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:118
msgid "You told Rook where Nettle's clan burrows."
msgstr "你告訴了魯克，蕁麻的部族把地洞打在哪兒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:119
msgid "Crow Hill. I'll have your share by the end of the week."
msgstr "烏鴉崗。週末之前，我把你那份送來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:121
msgid "Goblins don't tell me where they sleep"
msgstr "哥布林睡哪兒可不會告訴我"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:124
msgid "You wouldn't tell Rook where Nettle's clan burrows."
msgstr "你不肯告訴魯克，蕁麻的部族把地洞打在哪兒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:125
msgid "No? Then I'll find it the slow way."
msgstr "不說？那我就慢慢找。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:132
msgid ""
"Crow Hill, as you said. The clan ran before we got there, Nettle with them, over the hills and gone. The abbey paid anyway. Here's your share: {0}."
msgstr "就在烏鴉崗，跟你說的一樣。我們還沒趕到，那一族就跑了，蕁麻也跟著跑了，翻過山頭，沒影了。修道院照樣付了錢。這是你那份：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:140
msgid ""
"Rook raided Nettle's burrow. The clan's gone over the hills, and Nettle won't trade with you again."
msgstr "魯克突襲了蕁麻的地洞。那一族已經翻山走了，蕁麻再也不會跟你做買賣了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:147
msgid ""
"Rook is sniffing at our hill. The abbey thinks goblins took its chests. Goblins get the blame for everything!"
msgstr "魯克在我們山上到處嗅。修道院以為哥布林偷了它的箱子。什麼壞事都賴哥布林！"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:148
msgid ""
"You speak to the almoner? Brother Cadoc listens to Keywrights. He doesn't listen to goblins."
msgstr "你去跟施賑修士說？卡多克修士聽鑰匠的話。他不聽哥布林的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:151
msgid "I'll speak for your clan"
msgstr "我替你的部族說話"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:156
msgid "The abbey's bounty withdrawn"
msgstr "修道院撤回懸賞"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:156
msgid ""
"Brother Cadoc has withdrawn the abbey's bounty on the hill goblins, on a Keywright's word."
msgstr "憑著一位鑰匠的一句話，卡多克修士撤回了修道院對山中哥布林的懸賞。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:157
msgid ""
"You spoke for Nettle's clan to Brother Cadoc, and the abbey withdrew its bounty. Nettle charges you nothing for shaking now, and owes you a favour."
msgstr "你向卡多克修士替蕁麻的部族求情，修道院撤回了懸賞。如今蕁麻不收你搖箱子的錢，還欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:158
msgid ""
"A friend of the clan! Shake all you like. All strengths. Free! And when you need goblins, you call."
msgstr "部族的朋友！隨便搖。哪種力度都行。免費！要哥布林幫忙，你就叫。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:160
msgid "I'll stay out of it"
msgstr "我置身事外"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:163
msgid ""
"You stayed out of the abbey's bounty. Nettle's clan has gone to ground for a week."
msgstr "你沒有插手修道院的懸賞。蕁麻的部族躲進了地底下，要躲上一週。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:164
msgid "Then we go underground. Deep. A week, maybe more. Bye."
msgstr "那我們就鑽到地底下去。很深很深。一週，也許更久。拜拜。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:174
msgid "The Unopened"
msgstr "未啟派"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:175
msgid ""
"The Unopened stand at your door and tell your customers that every chest you open feeds the Maw."
msgstr "未啟派守在你的店門口，告訴你的顧客：你每開啟一個寶箱，都是在餵養巨口。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:183
msgid ""
"Sister Agathe, of the Unopened. Every chest you open loosens the Locking. Every coin you take out of one feeds the Maw."
msgstr "我是未啟派的阿加特修女。你每開啟一個寶箱，大封鎖就鬆動一分。你從箱子裡拿出的每一枚錢幣，都在餵養巨口。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:184
msgid ""
"We'll stand at your door and tell your customers so, until you stop. We are very patient."
msgstr "我們會守在你的店門口，把這些話告訴你的顧客，直到你停手為止。我們很有耐心。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:188
msgid "The Unopened stand at your door. One customer a day turns away."
msgstr "未啟派守在你的店門口。每天都有一位顧客掉頭離開。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:195
msgid ""
"They're ours, I'm afraid: the abbey's zealots. I can't order them off, but I can ask, if the abbey's had alms from you."
msgstr "恐怕他們是我們的人：修道院裡的狂熱信徒。我沒法命令他們走，但要是修道院收到過你的施捨，我可以去請求他們。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:196
msgid ""
"Or send for the Wardens, and they'll move them on. The abbey won't thank you for it."
msgstr "或者你報告巡守，他們會把人趕走。只是修道院不會因此感謝你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:199
msgid "Alms for the abbey ({0}g)"
msgstr "向修道院施捨（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:204
msgid ""
"You gave alms to the abbey, and Brother Cadoc asked the Unopened to leave your door."
msgstr "你向修道院施捨了錢財，卡多克修士請未啟派離開了你的店門口。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:205
msgid "Bless you. I'll speak to Sister Agathe tonight."
msgstr "願你蒙福。我今晚就去跟阿加特修女談談。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:208
msgid "Send for the Wardens"
msgstr "報告巡守"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:214
msgid "The Wardens moved the Unopened on. The abbey wasn't pleased."
msgstr "巡守把未啟派趕走了。修道院很不高興。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:215
msgid "If you must. I'll pray for you both."
msgstr "既然你非這樣不可。我會為你們雙方祈禱。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:218
msgid "Let them stand"
msgstr "讓他們站著吧"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:220
msgid "You let the Unopened stand at your door."
msgstr "你任由未啟派守在你的店門口。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:221
msgid "Patience is a virtue. Theirs, mostly."
msgstr "忍耐是一種美德。只不過多半是他們的美德。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:230
msgid ""
"Sister Agathe at the back door, alone, with a purse. \"Every week there was one of these in our alms box. Guild silver, with the Guild's seal. We were paid to stand at hedge-wrights' doors. I didn't know.\""
msgstr ""
"阿加特修女獨自站在後門，手裡拿著一個錢袋。「每週我們的施捨箱裡都會出現一個這樣的錢袋。公會的銀子，蓋著公會的印。我們是拿了錢，才去黑鑰匠門口站著的。我之前並不知道。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:232
msgid "\"I can't keep it. I can't give it back to them. You take it.\""
msgstr "「我不能留著它。也不能還給他們。你拿去吧。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:235
msgid "Keep it as proof"
msgstr "留作證據"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:240
msgid ""
"Sister Agathe gave you the Guild's purse from the Unopened's alms box: proof the Guild pays them. A paper for the case against the Guild."
msgstr "阿加特修女把未啟派施捨箱裡的公會錢袋交給了你：這證明公會在花錢收買他們。這是一份指控公會的證據。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:241
msgid "\"Then let it testify. I've stood at my last door.\""
msgstr "「那就讓它去作證吧。我再也不會站在誰家門口了。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:243
msgid "Give it to the poor box"
msgstr "投進濟貧箱"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:246
msgid "You sent the Guild's purse to the abbey's poor box."
msgstr "你把公會的錢袋投進了修道院的濟貧箱。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:247
msgid "\"The poor box. Yes. At least it'll feed someone.\""
msgstr "「濟貧箱。好。至少它能讓人吃上飯。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:257
msgid "The Disputed Dowry"
msgstr "嫁妝之爭"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:258
msgid ""
"Two families claim one dowry chest, and the court says: let the ward decide."
msgstr "兩戶人家爭一個嫁妝箱，法庭說：讓結界來裁決。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:266
msgid ""
"A wedding that never happened, dear, and two families who both say the dowry chest is theirs: the Ashbys and the Corlews. The court says let the ward decide."
msgstr "一場沒辦成的婚事，親愛的，還有兩戶都說嫁妝箱歸自己的人家：阿什比家和科爾盧家。法庭說，讓結界來裁決。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:268
msgid ""
"Each of them will bring it to you and offer to sell it. Your mark will know which of them it belongs to. Tell me after."
msgstr "兩家都會把箱子帶來，說要賣給你。你的鑰紋會知道它歸哪一家。之後來告訴我。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:271
msgid "Let the ward decide"
msgstr "由結界裁決"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:271
msgid ""
"The Ashbys and the Corlews both claim a dowry chest. Each will offer it to you: lay a hand on it, and your mark knows whose it is."
msgstr "阿什比家和科爾盧家都說一個嫁妝箱歸自己。兩家都會拿它來賣給你：伸手摸一摸，你的鑰紋就知道它歸誰。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:272
msgid ""
"Two families claim one dowry chest. Each will offer it to you, and your mark will know whose it is."
msgstr "兩戶人家爭一個嫁妝箱。兩家都會拿它來賣給你，你的鑰紋會知道它歸誰。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:278
msgid ""
"The Ashby dowry. My daughter's, by every right. Let the ward decide, they say: well, here it is. Buy it, if your mark agrees. {price}."
msgstr "阿什比家的嫁妝。怎麼說都是我女兒的。他們說讓結界來裁決：好啊，箱子就在這兒。你的鑰紋要是認可，就買下它。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:286
msgid ""
"Hal Corlew. The dowry's ours: my sister packed it herself. The court's let me bring it to you. {price}, and the ward will tell you I'm right."
msgstr "我是哈爾·科爾盧。嫁妝是我們家的：是我妹妹親手裝的箱。法庭允許我把它帶來給你。{price}，結界會告訴你我說得沒錯。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:294
msgid ""
"Well, dear? The court's waiting, and so are two very cross families. Whose is the dowry?"
msgstr "怎麼樣，親愛的？法庭在等著，兩家氣呼呼的人也在等著。嫁妝到底是誰家的？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:297
msgid "The Ashbys'"
msgstr "阿什比家的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:298
msgid "The Corlews'"
msgstr "科爾盧家的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:299
msgid "I couldn't say"
msgstr "我說不準"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:301
msgid "You couldn't tell the court whose the dowry was."
msgstr "你沒法告訴法庭嫁妝是誰家的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:302
msgid ""
"Then they'll go on suing each other until the chest rots. Thank you so much."
msgstr "那他們就會一直打官司，打到箱子爛掉為止。真是太感謝你了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:312
msgid "The Night Toll"
msgstr "夜守關卡"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:313
msgid ""
"Half the Wardens are down with the sweats, and Hollis wants a Keywright's hand on the carts at the forest toll."
msgstr "一半巡守染上了汗熱病，霍利斯想請一位鑰匠到林間關卡，幫忙摸一摸過往車輛上的箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:321
msgid ""
"Half my Wardens are down with the sweats, and the smugglers know it. Lend me your mark at the toll tonight: a hand on every cart, and tell me which chests are cold."
msgstr "我手下一半的巡守染上了汗熱病，走私販子們心知肚明。今晚把你的鑰紋借給我，到關卡來：每輛車都摸一遍，告訴我哪些箱子是涼的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:323
msgid "You'd miss your peddler. I'd owe you."
msgstr "你會錯過那個貨郎。我欠你個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:326
msgid "I'll come tonight"
msgstr "我今晚就去"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:331
msgid "You went to the Wardens' toll for the night, with your mark."
msgstr "你帶著鑰紋，去巡守的關卡守了一夜。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:332
msgid "Good. Bring a coat. The forest road's cold after dark."
msgstr "很好。帶件外套。天黑後林間大道冷得很。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:334
msgid "I've a shop to run"
msgstr "我還得看店"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:337
msgid "You wouldn't go to the Wardens' toll."
msgstr "你不肯去巡守的關卡。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:338
msgid "Course you have. So have the smugglers."
msgstr "那是當然。走私販子們也有買賣要照看。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:346
msgid ""
"Midnight at the toll. A carter you don't know, under a tarpaulin. Your hand on his chests: three of them are as cold as the grave. Hollis is watching your face."
msgstr "關卡，午夜。一個你不認識的車伕，車上蓋著油布。你把手放在他的箱子上：其中三個箱子冷得像墳墓。霍利斯正盯著你的臉。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:348
msgid ""
"Midnight at the toll, and Corvin Tallow's cart under a tarpaulin. Your hand on his chests: three of them are as cold as the grave. Corvin's watching your face, and so is Hollis."
msgstr "關卡，午夜，科爾文·塔洛的車蓋著油布。你把手放在他的箱子上：其中三個箱子冷得像墳墓。科爾文盯著你的臉，霍利斯也是。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:352
msgid "Tell Hollis they're cold"
msgstr "告訴霍利斯箱子是涼的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:360
msgid ""
"You told Hollis which of Corvin's chests were stolen. Corvin's in the cells; the Wardens paid you a finder's share."
msgstr "你告訴霍利斯科爾文的哪些箱子是贓物。科爾文進了牢房；巡守付了你一份發現者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:361
msgid ""
"You told Hollis which of the carter's chests were stolen. The Wardens paid you a finder's share."
msgstr "你告訴霍利斯那個車伕的哪些箱子是贓物。巡守付了你一份發現者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:362
msgid ""
"Three chests going home. That's a Keywright's work, that is. Here's your share."
msgstr "三個箱子能回家了。這才是鑰匠的本事。這是你那份。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:364
msgid "Say they're all warm"
msgstr "說箱子全是暖的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:370
msgid ""
"You told Hollis Corvin's chests were warm. They weren't. Corvin owes you a favour."
msgstr "你告訴霍利斯科爾文的箱子都是暖的。其實並不是。科爾文欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:371
msgid ""
"You told Hollis the carter's chests were warm. They weren't. The Lockless heard about it."
msgstr "你告訴霍利斯那個車伕的箱子都是暖的。其實並不是。無鎖黨聽說了這件事。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:372
msgid "All warm? Huh. Then on you go, carter."
msgstr "全是暖的？哼。那你走吧，車伕。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:390
msgid "the Ashby family"
msgstr "阿什比家"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:390
msgid "the Corlew family"
msgstr "科爾盧家"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:396
msgid "{0} offered you the dowry chest."
msgstr "{0}拿來了嫁妝箱，想賣給你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:413
msgid ""
"You told the court the dowry was the Ashbys', and the ward agreed. Aunt Hesper owes you a favour."
msgstr "你告訴法庭嫁妝歸阿什比家，結界也認可了。赫斯珀姑媽欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:414
msgid ""
"You told the court the dowry was the Corlews', and the ward agreed. Aunt Hesper owes you a favour."
msgstr "你告訴法庭嫁妝歸科爾盧家，結界也認可了。赫斯珀姑媽欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:415
msgid ""
"The ward agrees with you, and so does the court. Here's the court's fee, dear, and I owe you one."
msgstr "結界認同你的說法，法庭也是。這是法庭給的酬金，親愛的，我欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:419
msgid ""
"You told the court the dowry was the Ashbys'. It wasn't, and the Corlews won't forget it."
msgstr "你告訴法庭嫁妝歸阿什比家。其實並不是，科爾盧家不會忘記這件事。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:420
msgid ""
"You told the court the dowry was the Corlews'. It wasn't, and the Ashbys won't forget it."
msgstr "你告訴法庭嫁妝歸科爾盧家。其實並不是，阿什比家不會忘記這件事。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:421
msgid ""
"Hm. The other family swears blind it opened for their girl last night. Well. The court has your word."
msgstr "嗯。另一家賭咒發誓說，昨晚箱子為他們家姑娘開啟了。好吧。法庭已經採信了你的話。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:428
msgid ""
"Reeve of Thornwick, with a loom in the toll-house. The market's open till the lamps go out, and the roads are free."
msgstr "我當上了荊棘鎮鎮長，織布機就擺在關卡小屋裡。集市開到熄燈才收，道路也都免費通行。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:430
msgid ""
"Reeve Caskett, if you please. The tolls are paying for the new road to the Old Wood. The Guild's very pleased."
msgstr "請叫我卡斯克特鎮長。過路費正好拿來修通往古林的新路。公會非常滿意。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:437
msgid ""
"Our burrow has a door now! A real door, with a lock you can open. The clan says you're an honorary goblin. It's a big honour."
msgstr "我們的地洞有門啦！一扇真正的門，還帶一把你能開啟的鎖。部族說你是榮譽哥布林。這可是天大的榮譽。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:439
msgid ""
"Nettle's clan went over the hills after Rook's raid. The crypt thefts didn't stop. They were never the goblins."
msgstr "魯克突襲之後，蕁麻的部族翻山走了。墓穴的失竊案卻沒停。從來就不是哥布林偷的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:440
msgid ""
"We came up again after a while. Rook still sniffs about. Goblins get the blame for everything."
msgstr "過了一陣子，我們又鑽出來了。魯克還在到處嗅。什麼壞事都賴哥布林。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:446
msgid ""
"I preach on the abbey steps now, about who pays for whose bread. The Guild's very cross. The Unopened are fewer, and better."
msgstr "如今我在修道院的臺階上佈道，講的是誰在為誰的麵包掏錢。公會氣壞了。未啟派的人少了，也更好了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:448
msgid ""
"The Unopened stand at other doors now. Sister Agathe left them. She wouldn't tell me why."
msgstr "未啟派如今守在別人家門口了。阿加特修女離開了他們。她不肯告訴我為什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:449
msgid ""
"We stood at your door all season, and you kept opening chests. We are very patient. So, it seems, are you."
msgstr "我們在你的店門口站了一整季，你卻照樣開你的箱子。我們很有耐心。看來，你也一樣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:457
msgid ""
"The Ashby girl's married now, dowry and all, and the Corlews have stopped suing. I'm never doing another one of those."
msgstr "阿什比家的姑娘已經出嫁了，嫁妝也一併帶了去，科爾盧家也不再打官司了。這種事，我再也不攬了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:458
msgid ""
"The Corlew girl's married now, dowry and all, and the Ashbys have stopped suing. I'm never doing another one of those."
msgstr "科爾盧家的姑娘已經出嫁了，嫁妝也一併帶了去，阿什比家也不再打官司了。這種事，我再也不攬了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:460
msgid ""
"The court gave the dowry to the wrong family on your word, and it won't open for them. They're suing you now, dear."
msgstr "法庭聽了你的話，把嫁妝判給了錯的那一家，箱子根本不為他們開啟。現在他們在告你呢，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:461
msgid ""
"The Ashbys and the Corlews are still at law over that dowry. The chest will outlive them all."
msgstr "阿什比家和科爾盧家還在為那份嫁妝打官司。那個箱子會比他們所有人都活得長。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:467
msgid ""
"Three stolen chests home from one night at the toll. I've asked the Wardens' captain for a Keywright on the road for good."
msgstr "在關卡守了一夜，就有三隻贓物寶箱回了家。我已經請巡守隊長在路上常駐一位鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:469
msgid ""
"Hollis knows those chests at the toll were cold. He hasn't said so. He doesn't have to."
msgstr "霍利斯知道關卡上那些箱子是涼的。他沒說出來。他也不必說。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.Thornwick.cs:470
msgid "The smugglers had a good season. I hope your shop did too."
msgstr "走私販子們這一季過得不錯。希望你的店也是。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:41
msgid "the Chest Roll's copy"
msgstr "寶箱名冊的副本"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:42
msgid "a page of the Guild's ledger"
msgstr "公會賬簿的一頁"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:43
msgid "the debt-house tallies"
msgstr "債務監獄的賬目"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:44
msgid "the Mark-Finder's register"
msgstr "尋紋人的名冊"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:45
msgid "the witness copy of the Wood's deed"
msgstr "古林契據的見證副本"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:46
msgid "the Guild's purse from the Unopened's alms box"
msgstr "未啟派施捨箱裡的公會錢袋"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:47
msgid "the Archive's ledgers, saved from the fire"
msgstr "從大火中搶出的檔案館賬簿"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:48
msgid "Archmage Orme's notes"
msgstr "大法師奧姆的筆記"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:49
msgid "Skrae's word"
msgstr "斯克雷的證詞"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:117
msgid ""
"Fished it out for you, master! It's yours: you taught me the trade. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "給你撈上來的，師父！它歸你了：這門手藝是你教我的。一枚金幣，圖個吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:118
msgid ""
"From the millpond, and I didn't shake it. Well, a bit. One coin, for luck, like Bram says."
msgstr "從磨坊池塘裡撈的，我沒搖它。嗯，搖了一點點。一枚金幣，圖個吉利，布拉姆就是這麼說的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:147
msgid "The Shut Chests"
msgstr "緊閉的寶箱"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:148
msgid ""
"Someone's stealing chests around Thornwick: the Magpie, whom nobody's seen. The Wardens want a name."
msgstr "有人在荊棘鎮一帶偷寶箱：是那個誰也沒見過的喜鵲。巡守想要一個名字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:156
msgid ""
"Sergeant Hollis, Wardens of the Road, Thornwick post. Someone broke into the abbey crypt last night and took Saint Ide's reliquary chest: green, iron-bound, the saint's key on its lid."
msgstr "道路巡守荊棘鎮哨所，霍利斯中士。昨晚有人闖進修道院地下墓穴，偷走了聖伊德的聖物箱：綠色，包著鐵皮，蓋上有聖徒的鑰匙。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:158
msgid ""
"If it comes to your counter, you'll know it. A Keywright's mark goes cold on a chest that isn't the seller's to sell. Lay a hand on any chest and feel. Send for us, and the Wardens pay a finder's share."
msgstr ""
"要是它到了你的櫃檯上，你會知道的。賣家無權出售的寶箱，鑰匠的鑰紋一碰就會發涼。把手放在任何一個寶箱上，感受一下。報告我們，巡守會付你發現者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:160
msgid ""
"He's right. Shake anything, and your mark tells you whose it is: warm, the seller's; cold, stolen. A stolen chest won't open for whoever buys it."
msgstr "他說得對。隨便搖一搖，你的鑰紋就會告訴你東西是誰的：發暖，是賣家的；發涼，是偷來的。贓物寶箱不管誰買下都打不開。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:164
msgid "Wanted: Saint Ide's reliquary"
msgstr "懸賞：聖伊德的聖物箱"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:165
msgid ""
"Stolen from the abbey crypt: a green chest, iron-bound, with the saint's key on its lid. A finder's share for its return. Sergeant Hollis, Thornwick."
msgstr "修道院地下墓穴失竊：綠寶箱一隻，鐵皮包邊，蓋上有聖徒的鑰匙。尋回歸還者可得發現者分成。荊棘鎮，霍利斯中士。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:167
msgid ""
"Hollis posted a notice: Saint Ide's reliquary chest has been stolen from the abbey."
msgstr "霍利斯貼出告示：聖伊德的聖物箱從修道院失竊了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:171
msgid "I'll send for you."
msgstr "我會報告巡守的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:171
msgid "Good. The Wardens remember their friends."
msgstr "很好。巡守不會忘記朋友。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:173
msgid "I don't work for the Wardens."
msgstr "我不替巡守辦事。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:177
msgid "Then I'll be keeping an eye on your back room, Keywright."
msgstr "那我會盯著你的後屋的，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:187
msgid "the abbey of Saint Ide"
msgstr "聖伊德修道院"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:189
msgid ""
"A green one, iron-bound, with a pretty key on the lid. It came my way. {price}, quick."
msgstr "綠的，包著鐵皮，蓋上有把漂亮鑰匙。碰巧落到我手裡的。{price}，快點。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:191
msgid ""
"You bought the reliquary from Flick. It won't open: it's in your back room."
msgstr "你從弗利克手裡買下了聖物箱。它打不開，現在放在你的後屋裡。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:199
msgid ""
"Flick brought the reliquary, and you sent for the Wardens: it's gone home to the abbey."
msgstr "弗利克帶來了聖物箱，你報告了巡守：它已經回到了修道院。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:204
msgid "Flick brought the reliquary, and you let it go. It's gone."
msgstr "弗利克帶來了聖物箱，你放它走了。它從此下落不明。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:212
msgid ""
"Saint Ide's chest came home. The Wardens say it was your doing, Keywright. The abbey owes you, and it pays its debts: our restorers' bench is yours at half the price, whenever you want it."
msgstr "聖伊德的寶箱回家了。巡守說這是你的功勞，鑰匠。修道院欠你一份情，而修道院有債必還：我們的修復工作臺，你什麼時候想要，都只收半價。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:215
msgid ""
"Flick sold you the saint's chest? Then it's in your back room, and it will never open for you. Give it back to us: the abbey pays the finder's share, and blesses your door."
msgstr "弗利克把聖徒的寶箱賣給你了？那它就在你的後屋裡，永遠不會為你開啟。把它還給我們吧：修道院會付你發現者分成，還會為你的店門祝福。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:217
msgid ""
"The saint's chest is gone. Somewhere a Keywright will try to open it, and it won't, and they'll never know why. Pray for whoever has it."
msgstr "聖徒的寶箱沒了。某個地方會有個鑰匠想開啟它，卻怎麼也打不開，永遠不會知道為什麼。為拿著它的人祈禱吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:222
msgid "Give it back (+{0}g)"
msgstr "歸還（+{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:228
msgid "You gave the reliquary back to the abbey."
msgstr "你把聖物箱還給了修道院。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:229
msgid "Bless you. The saint will remember, and so will we."
msgstr "願你蒙福。聖徒會記得的，我們也會。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:231 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1212 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:476
#: scripts/Phases/DayEndPhase.cs:361 scripts/Ui/SongReveal.cs:173
msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "留著它"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:234
msgid "Then may it sit in the dark with you, Keywright."
msgstr "那就讓它陪你待在黑暗裡吧，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:251
msgid ""
"\"Keywright. The abbey's chest was my runner's mistake, and Flick has been told. I take back what the Guild took from families who couldn't pay its tithe, and I give it back to them. Leave me be, and I'll remember it. M.\" A black feather falls out of the letter."
msgstr ""
"「鑰匠：修道院那個箱子是我手下跑腿的失誤，弗利克已經捱過訓了。公會從交不起貢金的人家奪走的東西，我把它們拿回來，還給那些人家。別來管我，這份情我會記著。——鵲」一根黑色羽毛從信裡掉了出來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:256
msgid "Burn it"
msgstr "燒掉它"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:259
msgid "The feather curls up in the grate. Somewhere, somebody knows."
msgstr "羽毛在爐柵裡蜷縮起來，化成了灰。某處，有人知道了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:261
msgid "Show it to Hollis"
msgstr "拿給霍利斯看"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:265
msgid "Hollis turns the feather over. \"Her calling card. She's close, then.\""
msgstr "霍利斯把羽毛翻過來看了看。「這是她留的記號。看來她就在附近。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:272
msgid ""
"Three more thefts this week, every one a chest the Guild had foreclosed on. A carter saw the thief: {0}."
msgstr "這周又出了三起盜竊，每一起偷的都是公會查封過的寶箱。一個車伕看見了那個賊：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:276
msgid "The carter's word"
msgstr "車伕的證詞"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:276 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:277
msgid "A carter saw the Magpie: {0}."
msgstr "一位車伕看見了喜鵲：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:283
msgid ""
"Wardens say a goblin did the abbey! Nettle's cousin saw the thief on the burrow road: {0}. Not a goblin! Tell the sergeant."
msgstr "巡守說修道院是哥布林偷的！蕁麻的表親在地洞那條路上看見賊了：{0}。不是哥布林！你去告訴中士！"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:287
msgid "A goblin's word"
msgstr "哥布林的證詞"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:287
msgid "Nettle's cousin saw the Magpie on the burrow road: {0}."
msgstr "蕁麻的表親在通往地洞的路上看見了喜鵲：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:288
msgid "Nettle's cousin saw the Magpie: {0}."
msgstr "蕁麻的表親看見了喜鵲：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:295
msgid ""
"The Magpie's bounty is up to {0}. We've three names: Bettany Crane at the Crossed Keys, Aunt Hesper the matchmaker, and Rook Varga, who's hunting the bounty herself."
msgstr "喜鵲的賞金已經漲到{0}了。我們有三個名字：交鑰酒館的貝塔妮·克雷恩、媒婆赫斯珀姑媽，還有魯克·瓦爾加，她自己也在追這筆賞金。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:297
msgid ""
"You've heard what the carter saw, and the goblin. You've met all three. Who is it?"
msgstr "車伕看到了什麼，哥布林看到了什麼，你都聽說了。這三個人你也都見過。是誰？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:301
msgid "I won't name anyone"
msgstr "我誰也不指認"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:305
msgid "You wouldn't name anyone for the Magpie's bounty."
msgstr "你不肯為了喜鵲的賞金指認任何人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:306
msgid "Have it your way. The bounty stands, if you change your mind."
msgstr "隨你吧。要是你改了主意，賞金一直有效。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:313
msgid ""
"\"You sent an innocent woman to the Wardens' cells, Keywright. I'll get her out. And thank you for the diversion: it kept the Wardens busy all week. M.\""
msgstr "「鑰匠，你把一個無辜的女人送進了巡守的牢房。我會把她弄出來。還要謝謝你替我聲東擊西：巡守為此忙了一整週。——鵲」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:322
msgid ""
"A knock at the back door. A hooded woman: she lowers her hood, and smiles."
msgstr "後門傳來敲門聲。一個戴兜帽的女人：她放下兜帽，笑了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:323
msgid ""
"You didn't give them my name, Keywright. I'm grateful, and the Lockless pay their debts. Take this: from a Guild strongroom, so it's nobody's now but yours."
msgstr "你沒把我的名字告訴他們，鑰匠。我很感激，而無鎖黨有債必還。收下這個：從公會密庫裡拿的，所以如今它不屬於任何人，只屬於你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:330
msgid "The Magpie came to the back door: {0}. She left you {1}."
msgstr "喜鵲來到了後門：原來是{0}。她給你留下了{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:339
msgid "The Marked Child"
msgstr "鑰紋之子"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:340
msgid ""
"Pip Hollow has the Key-mark. The Guild's Mark-Finders take marked children into its counting-houses."
msgstr "皮普·霍洛身上有鑰紋。公會的尋紋人會把帶鑰紋的孩子帶進公會的賬房。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:347
msgid ""
"Mister? My hand's been itching ever since I fished up that last chest. Look: there's a mark on it. Like a key. Like yours."
msgstr "老闆？自從我撈上來上一個箱子，我的手就一直癢。你看：上面有個印記。像一把鑰匙。跟你的一樣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:351
msgid "Tell him what it means"
msgstr "告訴他這意味著什麼"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:354
msgid "Pip has the Key-mark, and you told him what it means."
msgstr "皮普有鑰紋，你告訴了他這意味著什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:355
msgid "A Keywright? Me? Mum'll faint."
msgstr "鑰匠？我？媽媽會暈過去的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:357
msgid "Tell him to keep it hidden"
msgstr "叫他藏好"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:359
msgid "Pip has the Key-mark. You told him to keep his hand in his pocket."
msgstr "皮普有鑰紋。你叫他把手揣在兜裡。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:360
msgid "In my pocket. Got it. Is it a bad thing, mister?"
msgstr "揣在兜裡。知道了。這是壞事嗎，老闆？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:368
msgid ""
"Mistress Aubel, Mark-Finder for the Gilded Guild. We test the children's hands at the fair tomorrow. The Guild takes the marked ones into its care: they want for nothing, all their lives."
msgstr "我是奧貝爾女士，鍍金公會的尋紋人。明天集市上，我們要檢查孩子們的手。帶鑰紋的孩子由公會照管：他們一輩子衣食無憂。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:370
msgid ""
"A Keywright knows the itch when it starts. If you know of a marked child, a name is worth {0} to the Guild."
msgstr "鑰紋剛開始發癢時，鑰匠是認得出來的。要是你知道哪個孩子有鑰紋，一個名字對公會來說值{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:373
msgid "Pip Hollow, the millpond boy"
msgstr "皮普·霍洛，磨坊池塘邊那個男孩"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:381
msgid ""
"You gave the Mark-Finder Pip's name. The Guild took him into its care, and Wynn left Brindle."
msgstr "你向尋紋人說出了皮普的名字。公會把他帶去照管了，溫也離開了布林德爾。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:382
msgid ""
"The Guild thanks you. He'll be well looked after. And the Guild remembers its friends: its bailiff calls on them first."
msgstr "公會感謝你。他會得到妥善照顧的。公會也不會忘記它的朋友：公會的法警會先去拜訪他們。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:384
msgid "None that I know of"
msgstr "據我所知沒有"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:386
msgid "You told the Mark-Finder you knew of no marked child."
msgstr "你告訴尋紋人，你不知道有哪個孩子帶鑰紋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:387
msgid "Hm. The fair will tell."
msgstr "嗯。到了集市自見分曉。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:395
msgid ""
"I'm Pip's mum. The Guild's men are going door to door, looking at children's hands. He told me what you are."
msgstr "我是皮普的媽媽。公會的人正挨家挨戶地查孩子們的手。他跟我說了你是什麼人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:396
msgid ""
"Will you hide him? He'd sleep in your back room and work for his keep, and he's a good boy. Please."
msgstr "你能把他藏起來嗎？他可以睡在你的後屋，幹活抵食宿，他是個好孩子。求你了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:399
msgid "He can stay, as my apprentice"
msgstr "他可以留下，當我的學徒"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:403
msgid "You took Pip on as your apprentice, and hid him in the back room."
msgstr "你收皮普做了學徒，把他藏在了後屋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:404
msgid "Bless you. Oh, bless you."
msgstr "老天保佑你。哦，老天保佑你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:406
msgid "I can't risk it"
msgstr "我不能冒這個險"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:411
msgid "You wouldn't hide Pip. The Guild found him at the fair."
msgstr "你不肯藏皮普。公會在集市上找到了他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:412
msgid "Then they'll find him. They always do."
msgstr "那他們會找到他的。他們總能找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:419
msgid ""
"A knock after dark. \"Mistress Aubel. Open up, Keywright. We're told there's a marked child under your roof.\""
msgstr "天黑後有人敲門。「我是奧貝爾女士。開門，鑰匠。有人告訴我們，你這屋簷下藏著一個帶鑰紋的孩子。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:424
msgid "There's no child here"
msgstr "這裡沒有孩子"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:428
msgid "You turned the Mark-Finder away. Pip's your apprentice now."
msgstr "你把尋紋人打發走了。皮普現在是你的學徒了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:429
msgid "We'll see. The Guild is patient, Keywright."
msgstr "走著瞧。公會很有耐心，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:431
msgid "Take him"
msgstr "帶他走吧"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:437
msgid "You let the Mark-Finder take Pip."
msgstr "你讓尋紋人帶走了皮普。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:438
msgid "A wise choice."
msgstr "明智的選擇。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:442
msgid "The Guild still takes Bram's word"
msgstr "公會仍認布拉姆的擔保"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:446
msgid ""
"Bram gave his word for you, and the Mark-Finder went away. Pip's your apprentice now."
msgstr "布拉姆為你作了擔保，尋紋人走了。皮普現在是你的學徒了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:447
msgid "Bram's word. Very well. The Guild will remember it was spent on this."
msgstr "布拉姆的擔保。很好。公會會記住，這份擔保用在了這件事上。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:457
msgid ""
"Pip says you stood in the door and told the Guild there was no child here. The whole mill knows it, and half of Brindle."
msgstr "皮普說，你站在門口，告訴公會這裡沒有孩子。整個磨坊都知道了，半個布林德爾也知道了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:458
msgid ""
"We haven't the coin to thank you. But we've neighbours, and every one of them will sell to you at a neighbour's price while my boy's safe with you: a sixth off."
msgstr "我們沒錢謝你。可我們有街坊，只要我兒子在你這兒平平安安，他們每一個都會按街坊價賣東西給你：便宜六分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:462
msgid "Thank your neighbours for me"
msgstr "替我謝謝街坊們"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:466
msgid ""
"Brindle's regulars sell to you at a neighbour's price now, a sixth off, while Pip's safe with you. Wynn owes you a favour."
msgstr "只要皮普在你這兒平平安安，布林德爾的常客就會按街坊價賣給你，便宜六分之一。溫欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:467
msgid ""
"And if the Guild ever comes for more than its due, send for me. The whole mill will come."
msgstr "要是公會哪天要的比該收的多，就叫我一聲。整個磨坊的人都會來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:469
msgid "Keep your neighbours' coin"
msgstr "街坊們的錢就留著吧"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:473
msgid ""
"You wouldn't take a neighbour's price for hiding Pip. Brindle hasn't stopped talking about it. Wynn owes you a favour."
msgstr "你藏了皮普，卻不肯收街坊價作回報。布林德爾的人一直在議論這件事。溫欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:474
msgid ""
"Then I'll tell everyone that too. And if the Guild comes for more than its due, send for me."
msgstr "那我也要把這件事告訴大夥兒。要是公會來要的比該收的多，就叫我一聲。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:482
msgid ""
"Master, the Mark-Finder was at the Thornwick fair. She keeps a book: every marked child's name, and where the Guild sent them. Some of them were six."
msgstr "師父，尋紋人去了荊棘鎮的集市。她有一本冊子：上面記著每個帶鑰紋的孩子的名字，還有公會把他們送去了哪兒。有些孩子才六歲。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:484
msgid ""
"She leaves it on her table while she eats her pie. I could copy a page. I'm quick, and I'm small."
msgstr "她吃餡餅的時候，就把冊子放在桌上。我可以抄一頁。我手腳快，個子又小。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:487
msgid "Copy one page, and run"
msgstr "抄一頁，然後快跑"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:491
msgid ""
"Pip copied a page of the Mark-Finder's register: children the Guild took, and where it sent them. A paper for the case against the Guild."
msgstr "皮普抄下了尋紋人名冊的一頁：上面是被公會帶走的孩子，還有他們被送去的地方。這是一份指控公會的證據。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:492
msgid "Done before she'd finished her crust! Forty names. I knew two of them."
msgstr "她餅皮還沒吃完，我就抄好了！四十個名字。其中兩個我認識。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:494
msgid "Too dangerous. Stay here"
msgstr "太危險了。待在這兒"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:496
msgid "You wouldn't let Pip near the Mark-Finder's register."
msgstr "你不讓皮普靠近尋紋人的名冊。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:497
msgid "Yes, master. I'll sweep, then."
msgstr "是，師父。那我去掃地。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:507
msgid "The Widow's Debt"
msgstr "寡婦之債"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:508
msgid ""
"Ada Kettle's son Jory is in the Guild's debt-house, and her husband's sword was pawned in Crownhold."
msgstr "艾達·凱特爾的兒子喬裡被關在公會的債務監獄裡，她丈夫的劍也在王冠堡被典當了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:516
msgid ""
"My boy Jory's in the Guild's debt-house in Crownhold, for his father's tithe: the Guild says Rafe owed it. Two years he's been in there."
msgstr "我兒子喬裡被關在王冠堡的公會債務監獄裡，就為了他父親的貢金：公會說那是雷夫欠下的。他在裡面已經兩年了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:518
msgid ""
"And if you ever find Rafe's sword in a chest, dear, KETTLE on the blade... it was pawned when he died. I'd give anything to have it back."
msgstr "還有，孩子，要是你哪天在箱子裡找到雷夫的劍，劍身上刻著「凱特爾」……他死後劍就被當掉了。只要能把它拿回來，我什麼都願意給。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:522
msgid "Ada Kettle seeks her husband's sword"
msgstr "艾達·凱特爾尋找亡夫之劍"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:523
msgid ""
"A soldier's sword with KETTLE on the blade, pawned in Crownhold years ago. Ada Kettle, at Brindle, would give anything for it."
msgstr "一把士兵的劍，劍身刻有「凱特爾」字樣，多年前在王冠堡被典當。布林德爾的艾達·凱特爾願不惜一切換回它。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:524
msgid ""
"Ada's son Jory is in the Guild's debt-house. Her husband Rafe's sword was pawned in Crownhold."
msgstr "艾達的兒子喬裡被關在公會的債務監獄裡。她丈夫雷夫的劍在王冠堡被典當了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:534
msgid ""
"A soldier's pledge, never redeemed. The ticket says \"Kettle: one sword, and sundries\". {articles} in all, it says. {price}."
msgstr "一位士兵的當品，一直沒人贖回。當票上寫著「凱特爾：劍一把，雜物若干」。上面說，一共{articles}。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:546
msgid ""
"You bought Silas Brass's pledge with Rafe Kettle's sword in it. Bram set the sword aside for Ada."
msgstr "你買下了賽拉斯·布拉斯那批裝著雷夫·凱特爾之劍的當品。布拉姆把劍取出來，留給了艾達。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:548
msgid ""
"You passed on Silas Brass's pledge with Rafe Kettle's sword in it. Someone else will have it."
msgstr "你沒有買賽拉斯·布拉斯那批裝著雷夫·凱特爾之劍的當品。它會落到別人手裡。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:553
msgid ""
"I came up to Crownhold to see Jory, and Bram sent word: you found Rafe's sword! Oh, dear. May I see it?"
msgstr "我上王冠堡來看喬裡，布拉姆捎信來說：你找到了雷夫的劍！哦，天哪。我能看看嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:556
msgid "It's yours"
msgstr "它是你的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:560
msgid ""
"You gave Ada her husband's sword. She owes you a favour, she says, and she means it."
msgstr "你把艾達亡夫的劍給了她。她說她欠你一個人情，而且是真心的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:561
msgid "Rafe's sword. Oh, Rafe. Thank you, dear. Thank you."
msgstr "雷夫的劍。哦，雷夫。謝謝你，孩子。謝謝你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:563
msgid "Sell it to her for what she has ({0}g)"
msgstr "按她手頭的錢賣給她（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:567
msgid "You sold Ada her husband's sword for what she had."
msgstr "你按艾達手頭的錢，把她丈夫的劍賣給了她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:568
msgid "It's all I have, but it's his. Thank you."
msgstr "這是我全部的錢，可這是他的劍。謝謝你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:570
msgid "Sell it on ({0}g)"
msgstr "轉賣出去（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:574
msgid "You sold Rafe Kettle's sword on."
msgstr "你把雷夫·凱特爾的劍轉賣了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:575
msgid "Oh. Of course. It's yours to sell, I suppose."
msgstr "哦。當然。我想，它是你的，你有權賣掉。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:581
msgid "Ada, about Jory"
msgstr "艾達，為喬裡的事"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:582
msgid ""
"The debt-house wants {0} for Jory, and I've saved half of it. If you could find the rest... he's a strong lad, and he'd work for you till it was paid."
msgstr "債務監獄要{0}才肯放喬裡，我攢了一半。要是你能補上剩下的……他是個壯小夥子，會給你幹活，直到還清為止。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:586
msgid "Pay the rest ({0}g)"
msgstr "付清餘款（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:591
msgid ""
"You paid the rest of Jory's debt. He'll carry chests in for you for a week, to pay you back: one more customer a day."
msgstr "你付清了喬裡剩下的債。他會幫你搬一週寶箱來報答你：每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:592
msgid ""
"Jory's free! He'll work a week for you to pay you back, dear. He'll carry anything."
msgstr "喬裡自由了！他會給你幹一周活來報答你，孩子。什麼他都搬得動。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:594 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:690
msgid "I can't"
msgstr "我付不起"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:596
msgid "You couldn't pay Jory's debt."
msgstr "你沒能替喬裡還債。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:597
msgid "I understand, dear. I'll keep saving."
msgstr "我明白，孩子。我會繼續攢錢的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:606
msgid ""
"Two years I scrubbed the debt-house floors, and the clerks never minded me reading over their shoulders. Half the debts in there were never owed: the Guild adds a tithe to a dead man's name and sends for his son."
msgstr "我在債務監獄裡擦了兩年地板，那些書記員從不介意我從他們肩膀後頭偷看。裡面的債有一半根本就不存在：公會往死人名下添一筆貢金，再派人去抓他兒子。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:608
msgid "I can write down what I saw, names and sums. Would it help anyone?"
msgstr "我可以把看到的寫下來，名字和數目都寫。這能幫上誰嗎？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:611
msgid "Write it all down"
msgstr "全都寫下來"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:615
msgid ""
"Jory wrote down the debt-house's tallies: debts the Guild made up. A paper for the case against the Guild. He owes you a favour."
msgstr "喬裡寫下了債務監獄的賬目：都是公會捏造的債。這是一份指控公會的證據。他欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:616
msgid "Every name I can remember. And I don't forget a sum."
msgstr "我記得的每個名字都寫上。數目我一個都不會忘。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:618
msgid "Put it behind you, Jory"
msgstr "把它忘了吧，喬裡"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:621
msgid "Jory put the debt-house behind him. He owes you a favour."
msgstr "喬裡把債務監獄的事拋在了腦後。他欠你一個人情。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:622
msgid "Maybe you're right. I'll carry chests and forget it."
msgstr "也許你說得對。我就搬搬箱子，把它忘了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:632
msgid "The Deep Door"
msgstr "深處之門"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:633
msgid ""
"Tobin has found a door at the bottom of the Barrow, sealed with the Key-mark."
msgstr "託賓在古冢底部發現了一扇門，門上封著鑰紋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:641
msgid ""
"There's a door at the bottom of the Barrow, Keywright: stone, with a keyhole shaped like your mark. Nobody's been through it since the Locking."
msgstr "古冢底下有一扇門，鑰匠：石頭做的，鎖孔的形狀和你的鑰紋一模一樣。自大封鎖以來，沒人進去過。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:643
msgid ""
"Stake me {0} for rope, lamps and two good men, and half of what's behind it is yours."
msgstr "你出{0}資助我，買繩子、燈，再僱兩個好手，門後的東西分你一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:646
msgid "Here's the money ({0}g)"
msgstr "錢給你（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:650
msgid "Tobin, back from the Barrow"
msgstr "託賓，從古冢歸來"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:651
msgid "You staked Tobin to go through the Barrow's deep door."
msgstr "你資助託賓去闖古冢的深處之門。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:652
msgid "You won't regret it. Four days, and I'll be back."
msgstr "你不會後悔的。四天後我就回來。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:654
msgid "Not this time"
msgstr "這次算了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:654
msgid "Someone at the Crossed Keys will stake me, then."
msgstr "那交鑰酒館總會有人資助我的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:666
msgid ""
"Behind the door: a vault nobody had touched since the Locking. Half's yours, like I said: this one, freely given. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "門後頭是一座地庫，自大封鎖以來就沒人碰過。說好的，一半歸你：這隻白送給你。一枚金幣，圖個吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:669
msgid ""
"Tobin came back from the deep door with a hoard, and gave you your half."
msgstr "託賓從深處之門後帶回了一批寶藏，把你那一半給了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:670
msgid ""
"Tobin came back from the deep door with a hoard. You wouldn't take your half."
msgstr "託賓從深處之門後帶回了一批寶藏。你不肯收下你那一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:677
msgid ""
"Tobin's men came back to the Crossed Keys without him. He's alive: they heard him calling, under a fallen arch past the door."
msgstr "託賓的人回到了交鑰酒館，可他沒回來。他還活著：他們聽見他在呼救，就在門後一道塌下來的拱門底下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:679
msgid ""
"A rescue wants a crew from Crownhold, and that's {0}. Nobody here has it, love."
msgstr "救人得從王冠堡請一隊人來，要{0}。這兒誰也拿不出這筆錢，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:682
msgid "Pay for the rescue ({0}g)"
msgstr "支付救援費用（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:686
msgid "Tobin, rescued"
msgstr "託賓，獲救歸來"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:687
msgid "Tobin was trapped past the deep door. You paid for his rescue."
msgstr "託賓被困在深處之門後面。你出錢救了他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:688
msgid "I'll send for the crew tonight. Bless you, love."
msgstr "我今晚就去叫救援隊。老天保佑你，親愛的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:695
msgid "Tobin was trapped past the deep door, and there was no rescue."
msgstr "託賓被困在深處之門後面，沒有人去救他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:696
msgid "Then I'll light a candle for him at the Crossed Keys."
msgstr "那我就在交鑰酒館為他點一支蠟燭吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:708
msgid ""
"You came for me. Half of what's behind that door is yours, freely given, and I'm never going down again. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "你來救我了。那扇門後的東西有一半歸你，白送的；我再也不下去了。一枚金幣，圖個吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:715
msgid ""
"Tobin came back alive, and gave you half of what was behind the door. He owes you his life, he says."
msgstr "託賓活著回來了，把門後的東西分了你一半。他說，他這條命是你給的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:724
msgid "The Woodcutters"
msgstr "伐木人"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:725
msgid ""
"The Guild's buying the felling rights on the Old Wood, and wants a Keywright's mark on the deed."
msgstr "公會要買下古林的採伐權，還要一位鑰匠在契據上按下鑰紋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:733
msgid ""
"Harl Caskett, timber factor for the Gilded Guild. The Guild's buying the felling rights on the Old Wood. The druids won't sign, so the deed wants a licensed Keywright's mark as witness."
msgstr "哈爾·卡斯克特，鍍金公會的木材代理商。公會要買下古林的採伐權。德魯伊們不肯簽字，所以契據需要一位持證鑰匠按下鑰紋作見證。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:735
msgid ""
"Put your mark to it, and the Guild pays a witness's fee: {0}, a tenth of your next due."
msgstr "按下你的鑰紋，公會就付你一筆見證費：{0}，相當於你下一筆應繳貢金的十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:738 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:795
msgid "Seal it"
msgstr "蓋印"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:745
msgid ""
"You put your mark to the Guild's deed for the Old Wood. The witness copy names the coin it was paid in: seized from families."
msgstr "你在公會的古林契據上按下了鑰紋。見證副本上寫明瞭付款所用的錢幣：都是從各家各戶查封來的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:746
msgid "A pleasure. The axes go in at the full moon."
msgstr "榮幸之至。月圓之時，斧頭就會落下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:748 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:812 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1035
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr "拒絕"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:753
msgid "You wouldn't put your mark to the Guild's deed for the Old Wood."
msgstr "你不肯在公會的古林契據上按下鑰紋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:754
msgid "The Guild will find another Keywright. It always does."
msgstr "公會會另找一位鑰匠的。它總能找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:762
msgid ""
"You put your mark to Caskett's deed, child. The axes come at the full moon, and the Wood will remember whose mark it was."
msgstr "你在卡斯克特的契據上按了鑰紋，孩子。月圓之時斧頭就會落下，古林會記住那是誰的鑰紋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:764
msgid ""
"You wouldn't put your mark to Caskett's deed. The Hawthorn Lady has heard of it, and she would speak with you. Leave your back door unlatched tonight."
msgstr "你不肯在卡斯克特的契據上按鑰紋。山楂夫人聽說了，她想和你談談。今晚別閂後門。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:771
msgid ""
"The door opens on its own, and the shop smells of hawthorn. \"Keywright. The Guild will find another mark for its deed, unless the one who refused it keeps refusing.\""
msgstr "門自己開了，店裡滿是山楂花的氣味。「鑰匠。公會會為它的契據另找一枚鑰紋，除非拒絕過的人一直拒絕下去。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:773
msgid ""
"\"Promise me you'll keep the Wood's oaks standing, and have this: a charm the Wood has kept since before the Locking. A promise to us is kept, or paid for.\""
msgstr "「向我承諾，你會讓古林的橡樹屹立不倒，然後收下這個：一件古林自大封鎖之前就珍藏至今的護符。對我們許下的承諾，要麼信守，要麼付出代價。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:777
msgid "I promise"
msgstr "我保證"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:782
msgid ""
"You promised the Hawthorn Lady to keep the Wood's oaks standing. She gave you {0}."
msgstr "你答應山楂夫人，要保住古林的橡樹。她送了你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:783
msgid "\"Kept, or paid for.\" She leaves {0} on the counter, and is gone."
msgstr "「要麼信守，要麼付出代價。」她把{0}留在櫃檯上，轉眼就不見了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:785
msgid "I can't promise that"
msgstr "我無法保證"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:785
msgid ""
"\"Then we'll speak no more of it.\" The hawthorn smell is gone by morning."
msgstr "「那此事便不必再提。」到了早上，山楂花的香氣已經散盡。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:791
msgid ""
"Last time, Keywright. The Guild will pay a fifth of your next due for your mark on the Wood's deed: {0}."
msgstr "鑰匠，這是最後一次了。只要你在古林的契據上按下鑰紋，公會就付你下一筆應繳貢金的五分之一：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:804
msgid " A promise broken: the Hawthorn Lady's charm is gone from your case."
msgstr "你背棄了諾言：山楂夫人的護身符從你的奇物匣裡消失了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:809
msgid ""
"You sealed the Guild's deed for the Old Wood after all. Mother Sorrel won't trade with you again."
msgstr "你最終還是在公會的古林契據上蓋了印。索蕾爾婆婆再也不會跟你做買賣了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:810
msgid "Sensible. The axes go in tomorrow."
msgstr "明智。斧頭明天就落下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:817
msgid "You refused the Guild's deed for the Old Wood a second time."
msgstr "你第二次拒絕了公會的古林契據。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:818
msgid "Then the Guild will remember it."
msgstr "那公會會記住這件事的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:825
msgid ""
"Hawthorn again, and a voice from nowhere: \"Twice you refused them. The Wood keeps its own.\" Something is left on the counter."
msgstr "又是山楂花香，還有一個不知從何而來的聲音：「你兩次拒絕了他們。古林不會虧待自己人。」櫃檯上多了一樣東西。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:830
msgid "The Hawthorn Lady thanked you with {0}."
msgstr "山楂夫人送你{0}以表謝意。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:839
msgid "The Parcel"
msgstr "包裹"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:840
msgid ""
"Corvin Tallow needs somewhere to keep a parcel for two nights, and the Wardens are searching the market."
msgstr "科爾文·塔洛要找個地方把一個包裹存放兩晚，而巡守正在搜查集市。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:847
msgid ""
"A favour, Keywright. Keep this parcel in your back room two nights. Don't open it: it isn't yours, so it wouldn't anyway. {0} when I collect."
msgstr "幫個忙，鑰匠。把這個包裹在你後屋放兩晚。別開啟：它不是你的，反正你也打不開。等我來取，給你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:851
msgid "Deal"
msgstr "成交"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:855
msgid "You're keeping Corvin's parcel in your back room."
msgstr "你把科爾文的包裹存在了後屋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:856
msgid "Good. Two nights. Nobody needs to know."
msgstr "好。兩晚。誰也不必知道。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:858 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1276 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1285
msgid "No"
msgstr "不"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:858
msgid "Pity. Forget I asked."
msgstr "可惜。就當我沒問。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:865
msgid ""
"Hollis at the door, after dark. \"We're searching every back room on the market tonight. Not yours: I told the lads you're a friend of the Wardens. Good night, Keywright.\""
msgstr "天黑後，霍利斯來到門口。「今晚我們要搜查集市上的每一間後屋。你的就免了：我跟弟兄們說過，你是巡守的朋友。晚安，鑰匠。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:867
msgid ""
"Hollis at the door, after dark. \"Wardens. We're searching every back room on the market tonight.\" He comes out with Corvin's parcel. \"And what's this?\""
msgstr "天黑後，霍利斯來到門口。「巡守辦事。今晚我們要搜查集市上的每一間後屋。」他拿著科爾文的包裹走了出來。「這是什麼？」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:871
msgid "It's Corvin Tallow's"
msgstr "是科爾文·塔洛的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:878
msgid ""
"The Wardens found Corvin's parcel, and you told them whose it was. Corvin's gone from the market."
msgstr "巡守找到了科爾文的包裹，你告訴了他們是誰的。科爾文從集市上消失了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:879
msgid ""
"Contraband brandy, and a chest off the Guild's foreclosure list. Thank you, Keywright."
msgstr "走私的白蘭地，還有一隻公會查封清單上的寶箱。多謝了，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:881
msgid "It's mine"
msgstr "是我的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:888
msgid ""
"The Wardens found Corvin's parcel. You said it was yours, and paid the fine."
msgstr "巡守找到了科爾文的包裹。你說那是你的，交了罰款。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:889
msgid "Contraband, Keywright. That's a fine of {0}, and it's confiscated."
msgstr "違禁品，鑰匠。罰款{0}，東西沒收。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:895
msgid "Corvin, for his parcel"
msgstr "科爾文，來取包裹"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:897
msgid ""
"My parcel, safe and sound. You're a friend, Keywright. Here's {0}, and something from my own pocket."
msgstr "我的包裹，完好無損。夠朋友，鑰匠。這是{0}，再加一點我自己掏腰包的心意。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:905
msgid "Corvin collected his parcel: he paid, and gave you {0}."
msgstr "科爾文取走了他的包裹：他付了錢，還送了你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:914
msgid "The Foreclosures"
msgstr "查封風波"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:915
msgid ""
"Half the chests the Guild forecloses on won't open for any Keywright it sells them to."
msgstr "公會查封的寶箱有一半，不管賣給哪個鑰匠都打不開。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:923
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn, clerk at the Guild's counting-house. Forgive me: I've a question I can't ask at work."
msgstr "我是託拜厄斯·芬恩，公會賬房的書記員。恕我冒昧：我有個問題，沒法在公會里問。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:924
msgid ""
"Half the chests the Guild forecloses on won't open for any Keywright it sells them to. The ledgers say they're sent \"below\", unopened. Why won't they open?"
msgstr "公會查封的寶箱有一半，不管賣給哪個鑰匠都打不開。賬簿上說，它們原封不動地被送去了「下面」。它們為什麼打不開？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:928
msgid "Seizure isn't a sale: they're still the families'"
msgstr "查封不算買賣：寶箱仍歸那些人家"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:931
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn asked why the Guild's foreclosed chests won't open. You told him: they're still the families'."
msgstr "託拜厄斯·芬恩問你，為什麼公會查封的寶箱打不開。你告訴他：寶箱仍歸那些人家所有。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:932
msgid ""
"Then the Guild's been selling stolen chests. For a hundred years. Oh dear."
msgstr "那公會一直在賣贓物寶箱。賣了一百年。天哪。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:934
msgid "Ask the Guild"
msgstr "去問公會"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:936
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn asked why the Guild's foreclosed chests won't open. You sent him back to the Guild."
msgstr "託拜厄斯·芬恩問你，為什麼公會查封的寶箱打不開。你讓他回去問公會。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:937
msgid "I... yes. Of course. Forget I asked."
msgstr "我……是的。當然。就當我沒問。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:945
msgid ""
"The Guild took my family's hall and sold its chests. I bought grandfather's war chest back, and it's mine to sell: it won't open for their Keywright. The sword's mine, for {fee}. The rest: {price}."
msgstr ""
"公會奪走了我家的宅邸，賣掉了裡面的寶箱。我把祖父的戰備箱買了回來，它是我的，我有權出售：公會的鑰匠根本打不開它。劍歸我，我付你{fee}。其餘的：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:947
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan sold you his grandfather's war chest, bought back from the Guild: it was his, so it opened for you."
msgstr "羅文爵士把他從公會買回的祖父戰備箱賣給了你：箱子本來就是他的，所以它為你開啟了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:953
msgid ""
"Master Quire, the Royal Archivist. Your clerk friend came to me. The Chest Roll agrees with you: every chest the Guild has seized is still in the families' names."
msgstr "我是奎爾大師，皇家檔案官。你那位書記員朋友來找過我。寶箱名冊印證了你的說法：公會查封的每一個寶箱，仍登記在原主人家的名下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:955
msgid ""
"By the ward's own law the Guild has been selling stolen chests for a century, and sending the ones that won't open down through the Gate. I've made you a copy of the Roll."
msgstr "按結界自身的法則，一百年來公會一直在賣贓物寶箱，打不開的就從大門送下去。我給你抄了一份名冊。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:959
msgid "I'll take it to the King"
msgstr "我會把它呈給國王"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:964
msgid ""
"Master Quire gave you a copy of the Chest Roll. You'll take it to the King."
msgstr "奎爾大師給了你一份寶箱名冊的副本。你要把它呈給國王。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:965
msgid "The King. Yes. If anyone can make the Guild answer for it, he can."
msgstr "國王。對。如果有誰能讓公會為此負責，那就是他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:967
msgid "Sell the copy to the Guild ({0}g)"
msgstr "把副本賣給公會（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:973
msgid ""
"You sold the copy of the Chest Roll to the Guild. Tobias Fenn hasn't been seen since."
msgstr "你把寶箱名冊的副本賣給了公會。從那以後，再也沒人見過託拜厄斯·芬恩。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:974
msgid "You'd... very well. It's yours to sell."
msgstr "你竟然……好吧。東西是你的，你有權賣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:982
msgid ""
"Tobias at the back door, with a travelling bag. \"They know I talked. I'm leaving Crownhold tonight. Take this: a page from the Guild's own ledgers. Every tithe, and where it goes. 'Below.'\""
msgstr "託拜厄斯提著旅行包站在後門。「他們知道我說出去了。我今晚就離開王冠堡。拿著這個：公會自己賬簿上的一頁。每一筆貢金，還有它的去向。『下面』。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:984
msgid ""
" Jory Kettle's with him: \"I'll swear to the King what the debt-house is full of.\""
msgstr "喬裡·凱特爾也跟他在一起：「我會向國王作證，債務監獄裡關的都是些什麼人。」"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:990
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn left Crownhold, and left you a page of the Guild's ledgers: where the tithe goes."
msgstr "託拜厄斯·芬恩離開了王冠堡，給你留下了公會賬簿的一頁：上面記著貢金的去向。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:995
msgid "The King, for the Roll"
msgstr "國王，為名冊而來"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:997
msgid ""
"You've something for the Crown, I hear. The Roll, and a page of the Guild's own ledgers. Let me see."
msgstr "聽說你有東西要呈給王室。名冊，還有公會自己賬簿上的一頁。讓我看看。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:998
msgid ""
"The Guild's been robbing my subjects in my name, and sending it to the Maw. My decree: the Guild's tithe on Keywrights is cut by a fifth, from tonight. Vane will be... displeased."
msgstr "公會一直打著我的名號掠奪我的子民，再把錢送給巨口。我的詔令：從今晚起，公會向鑰匠徵收的貢金削減五分之一。韋恩會……很不高興的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1006
msgid ""
"The King cut the Guild's tithe by a fifth. The Guild will remember who brought him the Roll."
msgstr "國王把公會的貢金削減了五分之一。公會會記住是誰把名冊呈給了他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1015
msgid "The Unlocking"
msgstr "大解封"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1016
msgid ""
"Archmage Orme is building an engine to copy the Key-mark: any chest would open for anyone."
msgstr "大法師奧姆正在打造一臺複製鑰紋的機器：有了它，任何寶箱都能為任何人開啟。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1023
msgid ""
"My mistress, Archmage Orme, asks a favour: one drop of a Keywright's blood, on a brass plate. That's all. She'll pay {0}."
msgstr "我師父，大法師奧姆，想請你幫個忙：在一塊黃銅板上滴一滴鑰匠的血。就這些。她會付{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1027
msgid "Give it"
msgstr "給她一滴血"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1032
msgid "You gave Archmage Orme a drop of your blood on a brass plate."
msgstr "你在一塊黃銅板上滴了一滴血，交給了大法師奧姆。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1033
msgid "Thank you! She'll be so pleased. I think."
msgstr "謝謝！她一定會很高興的。我想是吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1038
msgid "You wouldn't give Archmage Orme your blood."
msgstr "你不肯把血給大法師奧姆。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1039
msgid "Oh. She'll find someone else. She always does."
msgstr "哦。她會去找別人的。她總能找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1045
msgid "Ilse, worried"
msgstr "伊爾絲，憂心忡忡"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1048
msgid ""
"Your blood's in her engine. She's building something to copy the mark: with it, any chest would open for anyone."
msgstr "你的血用在了她的機器裡。她在造一樣能複製鑰紋的東西：有了它，任何寶箱都能為任何人開啟。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1049
msgid ""
"She found another Keywright's blood. She's building an engine to copy the mark: any chest would open for anyone."
msgstr "她找到了別的鑰匠的血。她在造一臺複製鑰紋的機器：有了它，任何寶箱都能為任何人開啟。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1050
msgid ""
"Mara came to the Arcanum last night. She says if the mark can be copied, the Locking's finished, and the realm with it. I don't know what to do."
msgstr "昨晚瑪拉來了秘法院。她說要是鑰紋能被複制，大封鎖就完了，整個王國也會跟著完蛋。我不知道該怎麼辦。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1054
msgid "Help her break it"
msgstr "幫她毀掉它"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1061
msgid ""
"You helped Ilse break Orme's engine. She gave you {0} from the Arcanum's stores."
msgstr "你幫伊爾絲毀掉了奧姆的機器。她從秘法院庫房裡拿了{0}送給你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1062
msgid ""
"Then I'll do it tonight. Take this, from the stores: {0}. She'll never miss it."
msgstr "那我今晚就動手。拿著這個，庫房裡的：{0}。她絕不會發現少了它。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1064
msgid "Tell the Guild"
msgstr "告訴公會"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1070
msgid ""
"You told the Guild about Orme's engine. They took her away, and paid you."
msgstr "你把奧姆的機器告訴了公會。他們把她帶走了，還付了你錢。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1071
msgid "The Guild? Oh no. Oh, no."
msgstr "公會？哦不。哦，不。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1073
msgid "Stay out of it"
msgstr "置身事外"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1076
msgid "You stayed out of Orme's engine."
msgstr "你沒有插手奧姆的機器。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1077
msgid "I... all right. I'll stay out of it too."
msgstr "我……好吧。我也不插手了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1085
msgid ""
"It works, Keywright. Partly: one chest in three opens for anyone at all. The Guild has offered me the moon for it."
msgstr "它成了，鑰匠。只是部分成功：每三個寶箱裡就有一隻，誰都能開啟。公會為它向我開出了天價。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1086
msgid ""
"And the Gate is cracking: the Maw's gilded iron is leaking into every purse in the realm. Here: {0}, your share, for the blood."
msgstr "而且大門正在開裂：巨口的鍍金鐵正滲進王國裡的每一個錢袋。拿著：{0}，這是你那滴血應得的一份。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1091
msgid ""
"Orme's engine works, partly, and the Gate is cracking: demon gold is everywhere now, in any purse of coin."
msgstr "奧姆的機器部分奏效了，大門也在開裂：如今魔金無處不在，任何一袋錢幣裡都可能有。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1100
msgid "Ironroot's Crown"
msgstr "鐵根之冠"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1101
msgid ""
"Ironroot's crown was locked in the Royal Treasury at the Locking, and the Guild bans dwarf-gold."
msgstr "大封鎖時，鐵根的王冠被鎖進了皇家寶庫，而公會禁止矮人金流通。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1109
msgid ""
"At the Locking, the King's men locked Ironroot's crown in the Royal Treasury with everything else. Three hundred years it's sat there."
msgstr "大封鎖那會兒，國王的人把鐵根的王冠跟別的東西一起鎖進了皇家寶庫。它在那兒一擱就是三百年。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1111
msgid ""
"The Guild calls our gold contraband because we won't pay its tithe. If the crown came home, every dwarf in Ironroot would remember who brought it."
msgstr "就因為我們不交它的貢金，公會就把我們的金子叫作違禁品。要是王冠能回家，鐵根的每個矮人都會記得是誰把它帶回來的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1115
msgid "I'll ask the King"
msgstr "我去求國王"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1119
msgid "You told Durgan you'd ask the King for Ironroot's crown."
msgstr "你告訴杜爾甘，你會去向國王討回鐵根的王冠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1120
msgid "Ha! A surface-dweller with a spine. We'll see."
msgstr "哈！有骨氣的地表人。走著瞧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1122
msgid "Nothing I can do"
msgstr "我無能為力"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1122
msgid "Hmph. Nobody ever can."
msgstr "哼。從來沒人能。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1133
msgid ""
"Ironroot's crown? It's in a chest I can't open, like everything I own. Here: I give it to you. Keep what else is in it, and give the dwarves their crown."
msgstr "鐵根的王冠？它在一隻我打不開的寶箱裡，就跟我擁有的一切一樣。給，我把它送給你。裡面別的東西歸你，王冠就還給矮人吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1141
msgid ""
"The King gave you the chest with Ironroot's crown in it. Bram set the crown aside for the dwarves."
msgstr "國王把裝著鐵根王冠的寶箱送給了你。布拉姆把王冠單獨收好，留給矮人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1147
msgid ""
"The crown! Ironroot owes you a debt it won't forget, Keywright. Our smiths will build you what you need, for nothing."
msgstr "王冠！鐵根欠你一份永世不忘的人情，鑰匠。我們的工匠會免費為你打造你需要的東西。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1157
msgid "Ironroot's smiths built you a {0}, for nothing."
msgstr "鐵根的工匠們免費為你打造了{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1157
msgid "Ironroot paid you for the crown in dwarf-gold."
msgstr "鐵根用矮人金為王冠酬謝了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1166
msgid "The Vell Inheritance"
msgstr "維爾家的遺產"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1167
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian Vell is selling his sister's chests, and they aren't his to sell."
msgstr "卡西安·維爾勳爵正在變賣他姐姐的寶箱，可那些寶箱輪不到他來賣。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1179
msgid ""
"Grandmother's trick box. I need it gone before the tables open tonight: {price}, and not a word to my sister."
msgstr "祖母的機關盒。今晚牌桌開張之前，我得把它脫手：{price}，別跟我姐姐提一個字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1182
msgid ""
"You bought a trick box from Lord Cassian. It won't open: it's his sister's."
msgstr "你從卡西安勳爵手裡買了一個機關盒。它打不開：那是他姐姐的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1187
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian tried to sell you his sister's trick box. You sent for the Wardens."
msgstr "卡西安勳爵想把他姐姐的機關盒賣給你。你報告了巡守。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1188
msgid "Lord Cassian tried to sell you his sister's trick box. You passed."
msgstr "卡西安勳爵想把他姐姐的機關盒賣給你。你沒有買。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1195
msgid ""
"My brother sold you grandmother's box. It's mine, by her will, so it won't open for you. Give it back to me, and I'll give it to you properly. Then it will."
msgstr "我弟弟把祖母的盒子賣給了你。按她的遺囑，那是我的，所以它不會為你開啟。把它還給我，我再正式送給你。那樣它就會開啟了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1198
msgid ""
"Cassian spent a night in the Wardens' cells over grandmother's box. It did him good. Thank you, Keywright."
msgstr "為了祖母的盒子，卡西安在巡守的牢房裡蹲了一晚。這對他有好處。謝謝你，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1199
msgid ""
"Cassian sold one of grandmother's boxes to someone. It will never open for them, and he knows it."
msgstr "卡西安把祖母的一個盒子賣給了別人。它永遠不會為那人開啟，這一點他心知肚明。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1203
msgid "Give it back"
msgstr "歸還"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1209
msgid "You gave Lady Isaura her grandmother's box back."
msgstr "你把祖母的盒子還給了伊索拉小姐。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1210
msgid ""
"Thank you. I'll bring it back tomorrow: freely given, it'll open for you."
msgstr "謝謝你。我明天把它帶回來：誠心相贈，它就會為你開啟。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1215
msgid "You kept Lady Isaura's box."
msgstr "你留下了伊索拉小姐的盒子。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1216
msgid "Then it sits in your back room forever. How very Vell of you."
msgstr "那它就永遠躺在你的後屋裡吧。你這做派，倒真像我們維爾家的人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1228
msgid "Isaura, with grandmother's box"
msgstr "伊索拉，帶著祖母的盒子"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1230
msgid ""
"Grandmother's box, freely given. Now it's yours, and it will open. One coin, for luck: she'd have insisted."
msgstr "祖母的盒子，誠心相贈。現在它是你的了，它會開啟的。收你一枚金幣，圖個吉利：她老人家一定會堅持這麼做的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1231
msgid "Lady Isaura gave you grandmother's box, and it opened."
msgstr "伊索拉小姐把祖母的盒子送給了你，它開啟了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1243
msgid ""
"Grandmother's last trick box. Her riddle: \"{clue}\" Whoever names her heart may keep it. {price}."
msgstr "祖母的最後一個機關盒。她的謎語：「{clue}」誰能道出她的心頭所愛，誰就能留下它。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1244
msgid ""
"Grandmother's last trick box, and you gave me the first one back. Her riddle: \"{clue}\" Whoever names her heart may keep it. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "祖母的最後一個機關盒，而你把第一隻還給了我。她的謎語：「{clue}」誰能道出她的心頭所愛，誰就能留下它。收你一枚金幣，圖個吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1248
msgid "You bought grandmother Vell's last trick box."
msgstr "你買下了維爾祖母的最後一個機關盒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1256
msgid "The Defector"
msgstr "叛逃者"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1257
msgid "Skrae has heard enough of the Maw, and wants out."
msgstr "斯克雷聽夠了巨口那一套，想要脫身。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1265
msgid ""
"I've heard enough of the Maw, Keywright. Every word he says to the Guild, I hear. I want out."
msgstr "巨口的話我聽夠了，鑰匠。他對公會說的每一個字，我都聽得見。我要脫身。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1266
msgid ""
"Hide me in your back room three nights, and I'll tell you what I've heard. You'll want to know."
msgstr "把我藏在你的後屋三晚，我就把聽到的告訴你。你會想知道的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1269
msgid "Hide it"
msgstr "把它藏起來"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1273
msgid "You hid Skrae in your back room."
msgstr "你把斯克雷藏在了後屋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1274
msgid "Three nights. I'll be quiet. I'm very good at quiet."
msgstr "三晚。我會很安靜。安靜我最在行了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1276
msgid "Then I'll go back. Forget you saw me."
msgstr "那我就回去。就當你沒見過我。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1282
msgid ""
"Seen a demon with bat's ears? Ran off from the Gate. The Maw pays {0} for runaways. Tick, tock."
msgstr "見過一個長著蝙蝠耳朵的惡魔嗎？從大門那邊逃出來的。巨口懸賞{0}，捉拿逃跑的傢伙。嘀嗒，嘀嗒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1287
msgid "Tick came looking for Skrae. You said nothing."
msgstr "嘀嗒來找斯克雷。你什麼也沒說。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1288
msgid "Tick, tock. We'll find it."
msgstr "嘀嗒，嘀嗒。我們會找到它的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1290
msgid "In my back room ({0}g)"
msgstr "就在我的後屋（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1295
msgid "You gave Skrae up to Tick, for the Maw's reward."
msgstr "為了巨口的賞金，你把斯克雷交給了嘀嗒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1296
msgid "Delicious. The Maw thanks you, mortal."
msgstr "美味。巨口感謝你，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1305
msgid ""
"They've stopped looking. Here's what I heard: the Maw's gaze is greed, and greed only catches where there's gold on show. Keep your counter bare when he comes, and his gaze slides right off."
msgstr "他們不找了。我聽到的是這樣：巨口的目光就是貪婪，而貪婪只盯得住擺在明面上的金子。他來的時候把櫃檯收拾乾淨，他的目光就會直接滑開。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1307
msgid ""
"And this, from his hoard. He won't miss it. Goodbye, Keywright. I'm going somewhere quiet."
msgstr "還有這個，從他的寶藏裡拿的。他不會發現少了。再見，鑰匠。我要去個清靜的地方了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1314
msgid ""
"Skrae went free. The Maw's gaze won't touch your counter again, and it left you {0}."
msgstr "斯克雷重獲自由，臨走時留給你{0}。巨口的目光再也不會落到你的櫃檯上了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1372
msgid "she held the lantern in her right hand and the crowbar in her left"
msgstr "她右手提著燈籠，左手握著撬棍"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1373
msgid "she left inky fingermarks all over the gate"
msgstr "她在門上留下了一片沾墨的指印"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1374
msgid "she went over the wall in riding boots, and rode off"
msgstr "她穿著馬靴翻過牆頭，騎馬跑了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1389
msgid ""
"You named {0}, and she was the Magpie. The Guild's foreclosed chests went home to their families."
msgstr "你指認了{0}，她正是喜鵲。公會查封的寶箱都送回了原來的人家。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1390
msgid ""
"We found her hoard under {0}: every chest the Guild foreclosed on this year. They're going home. Here's your bounty."
msgstr "她的藏寶找到了，就在{0}底下：公會今年查封的每一個寶箱都在。它們要物歸原主了。這是你的賞金。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1395
msgid ""
"You named {0} for the Magpie. The Wardens took her in. They found nothing."
msgstr "你指認{0}就是喜鵲。巡守把她抓了起來，卻什麼也沒找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1396
msgid "Then we'll take her in. If you're wrong, Keywright, it's on your head."
msgstr "那我們就把她抓起來。要是你錯了，鑰匠，這筆賬就算在你頭上。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1401
msgid "the Crossed Keys' cellar"
msgstr "交鑰酒館的地窖"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1402
msgid "a hayloft full of wedding chests"
msgstr "一座堆滿嫁妝箱的乾草棚"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1403
msgid "her hunting lodge in the Old Wood"
msgstr "她在古林裡的狩獵小屋"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:24
msgid "The commons"
msgstr "平民"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:25
msgid "The Gilded Guild"
msgstr "鍍金公會"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:26
msgid "The Wardens"
msgstr "巡守"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:27
msgid "The Lockless"
msgstr "無鎖黨"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:28
msgid "The Crown"
msgstr "王室"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:29
msgid "The abbey"
msgstr "修道院"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:30
msgid "The Old Wood"
msgstr "古林"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:31
msgid "The Arcanum"
msgstr "秘法院"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:32
msgid "Ironroot"
msgstr "鐵根"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:38
msgid ""
"Farmers, innkeepers, widows and children: everyone who pays the tithe by selling what their grandparents left them."
msgstr "農夫、旅店老闆、寡婦和孩子：所有靠變賣祖輩遺物來交貢金的人。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:39
msgid ""
"It licenses Keywrights, takes the tithe, lends to the Crown and forecloses on debtors."
msgstr "它給鑰匠頒發執照，收取貢金，借錢給王室，還查封欠債人的家產。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:40
msgid ""
"The road-wardens: tolls, the peace, the Chest Roll, and every stolen chest."
msgstr "道路巡守：掌管過路費、治安、寶箱名冊，還有每一隻贓物寶箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:41
msgid ""
"Thieves, fences, smugglers and hedge-wrights. Their queen is the Magpie."
msgstr "竊賊、銷贓人、走私販和黑鑰匠。他們的女王是喜鵲。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:42
msgid "King Aldric IX, his court, and a treasury he can't spend."
msgstr "國王奧德里克九世、他的宮廷，以及一座他花不掉的寶庫。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:43
msgid "The abbey of Saint Ide at Thornwick, its relics and its almoners."
msgstr "荊棘鎮的聖伊德修道院，以及它的聖物和施賑修士。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:44
msgid ""
"The fair folk and the druids, who trade in favours and keep their promises."
msgstr "仙靈和德魯伊，他們以人情做交易，也信守承諾。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:45
msgid "Crownhold's college of archmages, licensed by the Guild."
msgstr "王冠堡的大法師學院，持有公會頒發的執照。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:46
msgid "The dwarves, who forge the locks and won't pay the Guild's tithe."
msgstr "矮人，他們打造鎖具，卻不肯交公會的貢金。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:52
msgid "hated"
msgstr "仇視"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:53
msgid "a foe"
msgstr "敵對"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:54
msgid "wary"
msgstr "戒備"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:55
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "陌生"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:56
msgid "warm"
msgstr "友善"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:57
msgid "a friend"
msgstr "友好"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:58
msgid "an ally"
msgstr "盟友"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:64
msgid "They send their neighbours: one more customer a day."
msgstr "他們會介紹鄰居來光顧：每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:64
msgid "They stay away: one customer fewer a day."
msgstr "他們不再上門：每天少一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:65
msgid "It overlooks a twentieth of every due."
msgstr "公會網開一面：每筆應繳貢金減免二十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:65
msgid "It audits you: a twentieth more on every due."
msgstr "公會查你的賬：每筆應繳貢金多收二十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:66
msgid "Hollis warns you before a search, and returns pay a third more."
msgstr "霍利斯會在搜查前提醒你，歸還寶箱的報酬也多出三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:67
msgid ""
"They search your back room every Guild night: what's stolen is taken, and you're fined."
msgstr "每個公會之夜，他們都會搜查你的後屋：贓物一律沒收，你還要被罰款。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:68
msgid "Nim's friends pay half what a back-room chest cost you, not a quarter."
msgstr "尼姆的朋友會按你買後屋寶箱所花的一半收購，而不是四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:69
msgid "They rob you on the third night of every week: a tenth of your purse."
msgstr "他們每週第三晚都會來搶你：搶走你錢袋裡的十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:70
msgid "Their people offer their tools a quarter cheaper."
msgstr "他們的人賣工具給你，便宜四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:70
msgid "Their people ask half as much again for their tools."
msgstr "他們的人賣工具給你，要貴一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:91 scripts/Phases/OpeningPhase.cs:762 scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:79
#: scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:174
msgid "Go on"
msgstr "繼續"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:125 scripts/Phases/DuesPhase.cs:353 scripts/Phases/PeddlerPhase.cs:104
#: scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:174
msgid "Good night"
msgstr "晚安"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:558
msgid ""
"Send for the Wardens over a Guild sale? The Guild will hear of this, Keywright."
msgstr "為了公會的買賣去報告巡守？公會會聽說這件事的，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:693
msgid ""
"Wardens. Open up. We've a warrant for your back room, and we'll be back with one every Guild night until you give us a reason not to."
msgstr "巡守。開門。我們有你後屋的搜查令，往後每個公會之夜都會帶著搜查令再來，除非你給我們一個不來的理由。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:696
msgid "{0} that aren't yours, and a fine of {1}. Good night, Keywright."
msgstr "查出{0}不是你的，罰款{1}。晚安，鑰匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:696
msgid "{0} chest"
msgid_plural "{0} chests"
msgstr[0] "{0}只寶箱"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:697
msgid "Nothing this time. The fine's {0} all the same: for our trouble."
msgstr "這回什麼也沒搜到。不過罰款照樣是{0}：算我們跑這一趟的辛苦費。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:716
msgid ""
"The back shutter's been forced. {0} gone from the strongbox, and a black feather on the counter. The Lockless don't forget a Keywright who sets the Wardens on them."
msgstr "後窗板被人撬了。錢箱裡少了{0}，櫃檯上還留著一根黑羽毛。哪個鑰匠放巡守去抓無鎖黨，他們可不會忘。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:40
msgid "Move to Thornwick"
msgstr "遷往荊棘鎮"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:40
msgid ""
"Thornwick Market: 6 customers a day, better chests, locks, and two new sounds: potions and spells."
msgstr "在荊棘鎮集市開店：每天6位顧客，寶箱更好，開始出現鎖，還有兩種新聲音：藥水和法術。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:43
msgid "Painted Sign"
msgstr "彩繪招牌"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:43
msgid "One more customer every day."
msgstr "每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:44
msgid "Brass Scales"
msgstr "黃銅天平"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:44
msgid ""
"Honest weights, Warden-stamped, draw buyers who pay for them: everything sells for a fifth more."
msgstr "巡守蓋過戳的公道砝碼，能吸引肯為此掏錢的買家：所有東西售價提高五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:45
msgid "Oak Cabinet"
msgstr "橡木櫃"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:45
msgid "Room to display one more thing. Displays draw customers."
msgstr "可多陳列一件物品。陳列能吸引顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:46
msgid "Fine Lockpicks"
msgstr "精良撬鎖器"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:46
msgid "Goblin picks: a wider sweet spot when you pick a lock."
msgstr "哥布林做的撬鎖器：撬鎖時的綠區更寬。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:47
msgid "Oak Dresser"
msgstr "橡木櫥櫃"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:48
msgid "Restorer's Bench"
msgstr "修復工作臺"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:48
msgid ""
"Everything you buy gets cleaned and mended: each thing is 8% likelier to come out a step better than its chest."
msgstr "你買下的每樣東西都會被清洗修補：每件物品比寶箱品質高一級的機率提高8%。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:50
msgid "Move to Crownhold"
msgstr "遷往王冠堡"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:50
msgid ""
"A shop in the capital: richer customers, archmages with enchanted things, a dwarf, and gems."
msgstr "在都城開店：顧客更闊綽，有帶著附魔物品的大法師、一位矮人，還有寶石。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:53 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:599
msgid "Witchlight"
msgstr "巫燈"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:53
msgid ""
"Always lit: anything enchanted glows when it makes a sound. Nobody else can see it."
msgstr "長明不滅：任何附魔物品發出聲響時都會發光。別人都看不見。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:54
msgid "Town Crier"
msgstr "傳令員"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:54
msgid "Your name, shouted across Crownhold: one more customer every day."
msgstr "你的名號響徹王冠堡：每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:55
msgid "Auction Block"
msgstr "拍賣臺"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:55
msgid ""
"Buyers bid against each other for what you sell: everything fetches a quarter more."
msgstr "買家們爭相為你的貨出價：所有東西售價提高四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:56
msgid "Glass Cabinet"
msgstr "玻璃櫃"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:57
msgid "Crownhold Charter"
msgstr "王冠堡特許狀"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:57
msgid "Two synergies at once."
msgstr "可同時啟用兩個羈絆。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:58
msgid "Curio Case"
msgstr "奇物匣"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:58 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:76
msgid "Room for one more curio."
msgstr "多一個奇物欄位。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:59
msgid "Glass Case"
msgstr "玻璃展櫃"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:60
msgid "Restorer's Workshop"
msgstr "修復工坊"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:60
msgid ""
"A workshop and a journeyman: everything is another 10% likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "一間工坊和一名幫工：每件物品品質高一級的機率再提高10%。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:62
msgid ""
"By the Gilded Gate: 5 customers a day, the court, demons, and a fence for the Maw."
msgstr "緊鄰鍍金之門：每天5位顧客，有宮廷中人、惡魔，還有替巨口銷贓的人。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:65 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:812
msgid "Lodestone"
msgstr "磁石"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:65
msgid "Iron can't move near it: no clanking, and demon gold goes quiet."
msgstr "鐵器在它附近動彈不得：不會有哐啷聲，魔金也會啞然無聲。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:66
msgid "Gilded Cabinet"
msgstr "鍍金櫃"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:67
msgid "Royal Seal"
msgstr "皇家印璽"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:67
msgid "Three synergies at once."
msgstr "可同時啟用三個羈絆。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:68
msgid "Gilded Case"
msgstr "鍍金展櫃"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:71
msgid "Night Market"
msgstr "夜市"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:71
msgid "Open after dark: one more customer every day."
msgstr "入夜後照常營業：每天多一位顧客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:72
msgid "Royal Warrant"
msgstr "皇家認證"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:72
msgid "By appointment to the Crown: everything sells for a third more."
msgstr "王室御用：所有東西售價提高三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:73
msgid "Patrons' Book"
msgstr "委託人名冊"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:73
msgid "The regulars post two more commissions a week."
msgstr "常客每週多釋出兩個委託。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:74
msgid "Master Restorer"
msgstr "修復大師"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:74
msgid ""
"A master of the craft, from the palace workshops: nothing you buy comes out worse than its chest's colour."
msgstr "來自王宮工坊的修復大師：你買下的東西，品質絕不會低於寶箱顏色所示。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:76
msgid "Velvet Case"
msgstr "天鵝絨匣"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:79
msgid "Nim's Lantern"
msgstr "尼姆的燈籠"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:79
msgid ""
"A lantern over the back door, so Nim knows he's welcome: one more curio on his table every night."
msgstr "在後門上掛一盞燈籠，讓尼姆知道這裡歡迎他：他的桌上每晚多擺一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:81
msgid "A Stool for Nim"
msgstr "給尼姆的凳子"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:81
msgid ""
"Somewhere to sit by the counter: Nim stays longer, and lays out one more curio a night."
msgstr "櫃檯邊給他個坐的地方：尼姆會多待一會兒，每晚多擺出一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:83
msgid "Nim's Standing Order"
msgstr "尼姆的長期訂單"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:83
msgid ""
"A standing order: Nim keeps the best of his pack for you, one more curio a night."
msgstr "長期訂單：尼姆會把貨包裡最好的留給你，每晚多一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:87
msgid "Bookkeeping Engine"
msgstr "記賬機"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:87
msgid ""
"The Guild's clockwork reads every chest on your counter and ticks the slip for you. Costs all you owe."
msgstr "公會的發條機械會讀出你櫃檯上的每個寶箱，替你勾好估價單。價格是你欠下的全部債務。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:116
msgid "I've come back. {0}, and no hard feelings."
msgstr "我又回來了。{0}，之前的事一筆勾銷。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:116
msgid "I've come back. Make me an offer, then."
msgstr "我又回來了。那你出個價吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:125
msgid ""
"Bram's kin at the stall at last! One coin for it, for luck. Not a penny more, I won't hear of it."
msgstr "布拉姆的親人終於來看攤了！收一枚金幣，圖個吉利。多一個子兒都不要，別跟我爭。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:126
msgid ""
"Bram was good to us for forty years. One coin and it's yours. Welcome to the crossroads."
msgstr "布拉姆照應了我們四十年。一枚金幣，它就是你的了。歡迎來到十字路口。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:127
msgid ""
"A welcome present for the new Keywright. One coin, mind: it's bad luck to give a chest for nothing."
msgstr "給新鑰匠的見面禮。不過得收一枚金幣，記著：白送寶箱可不吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:163
msgid "Ah, you've had your hands on it. Then it's {0}."
msgstr "啊，你上手碰過了。那就得{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:276
msgid "Wardens? I'm off!"
msgstr "巡守？我溜了！"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:276
msgid "You'd shop me? Keep it, then!"
msgstr "你要告發我？那箱子歸你了！"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:276
msgid "Not today, Wardens. Not today."
msgstr "今天可不行，巡守。今天可不行。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:331
msgid ""
"King Aldric's own chest, sealed since the Locking. The Gate's gone quiet. Every bit of it is yours."
msgstr "奧德里克國王自己的寶箱，自大封鎖以來一直封存。大門已歸於沉寂。裡面的一切都歸你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:337
msgid ""
"Nothing rattled because there was nothing there, but {0}. Only a Keywright hears a Heartsong sing."
msgstr "什麼都沒響，因為裡面除了{0}，什麼都沒有。只有鑰匠聽得見心歌歌唱。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:338
msgid "Empty! Nothing rattled because there was nothing there."
msgstr "空的！什麼都沒響，因為裡面什麼都沒有。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:344
msgid ""
"{0}: gilded iron from the Maw's hoard. A lodestone would have silenced it."
msgid_plural ""
"{0}: gilded iron from the Maw's hoard. A lodestone would have silenced them."
msgstr[0] "{0}：來自巨口寶藏的鍍金鐵。用了磁石，就不會有這聲響了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:347
msgid "All genuine this time, and {0} sold it cheap."
msgstr "這次全是真貨，{0}還賣便宜了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:349
msgid ""
"The {0} sand: it pours at a gentle shake, where parchment never rustles."
msgstr "那{0}其實是沙子：輕搖就會流動，而羊皮紙輕搖時從不沙沙作響。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:349
msgid "rustle was"
msgstr "沙沙聲"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:349
msgid "rustles were"
msgstr "幾聲沙沙聲"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:353
msgid ""
"{0} charged the same for every rattle she heard: {1} of them, whatever they were."
msgstr "{0}聽到一聲響就收一份同樣的錢：一共{1}聲，不管裡面是什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:359
msgid "{0} went by weight: the {1} made it heavy."
msgstr "{0}看重量定價：{1}讓它變得沉甸甸的。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:360
msgid "The {0} weighed next to nothing to {1}."
msgstr "在{1}看來，{0}幾乎沒有分量。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:364
msgid "One coin for a {0} chest. The price comes later, from everyone after."
msgstr "一隻{0}寶箱，只收一枚金幣。代價在後頭：之後來的每個人都會跟你多要錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:367
msgid "{0} priced it as an ordinary {1} chest, without looking inside."
msgstr "{0}沒看裡面，只按一隻普通的{1}寶箱來定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:370
msgid ""
"{0}'s price came from a dream. Only the chest could tell you what it was worth."
msgstr "{0}的價格來自一場夢。它到底值多少，只有寶箱自己知道。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:373
msgid ""
"{0} priced her gems at what she paid for them; everything else came free."
msgstr "{0}按她買寶石時付的錢給寶石定價；其餘的東西都是白送的。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:378
msgid "{0} priced the {1} like a diamond fit for a crown."
msgstr "{0}把{1}當成配得上王冠的鑽石來定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:380
msgid "He priced the {0} at half."
msgstr "他把{0}按半價算了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:384
msgid "{0} let your slip set the price."
msgstr "{0}讓你的估價單來定價。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:387
msgid "{0} had no idea what was inside."
msgstr "{0}完全不知道里面有什麼。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:398
msgid "The clank drowned out the {0} for {1}"
msgstr "對{1}來說，哐啷聲蓋過了{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:399
msgid "Nothing stirs the {0} through straw"
msgstr "隔著稻草，怎麼搖也搖不出{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:400
msgid "Through the straw, {0}'s shake was too gentle to stir the {1}"
msgstr "隔著稻草，{0}搖得太輕，沒能搖出{1}聲"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:401
msgid "{0} didn't shake hard enough to stir the {1}"
msgstr "{0}搖得不夠用力，沒能搖出{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:402
msgid "{0} shook {1} and missed the {2}"
msgstr "{0}{1}搖過，卻漏掉了{2}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:403
msgid "{0}: {1}, unpriced."
msgstr "{0}：{1}未被計價。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:407
msgid "{0} heard the {1} but never counted: {2} for the price of one."
msgstr "{0}聽到了{1}聲，卻沒去數：{2}件只算了一件的錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:410
msgid "The ticket counted the false bottom, but {0} never reads tickets: {1}."
msgstr "當票把夾層裡的也算進去了，可{0}從來不看當票：{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:411
msgid "The Guild's tally counted the false bottom too: {0}."
msgstr "公會的清點把夾層裡的也算進去了：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:412
msgid "A false bottom nobody knew about: {0}."
msgstr "誰也不知道的夾層：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:415
msgid ""
"You named what the ward held, and it gave it up: the {0}. Nobody had priced it."
msgstr "你說出了結界封住的東西，它便交了出來：{0}。誰都沒給它定過價。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:417
msgid "Warded, silent and weightless: the {0}. {1}"
msgstr "被結界封住，無聲又無重：{0}。{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:419
msgid "Only a Keywright hears a Heartsong sing: nobody knew {0} was in it."
msgstr "只有鑰匠聽得見心歌歌唱：誰也不知道里面有{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:422
msgid ""
"Nobody can hear enchantment: the {0} went for the price of plain goods."
msgstr "附魔是聽不出來的：{0}只賣了普通貨的價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:425
msgid "{0} heard everything, and always asks a bit more than it's worth."
msgstr "{0}什麼都聽出來了，而且總是比實際價值多要一點。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:426
msgid "{0} heard everything. The deal was in the price you agreed."
msgstr "{0}什麼都聽出來了。劃不划算，全看你們談定的價錢。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:433
msgid "{0} in the dream, and nothing of the kind to hear: that was it."
msgstr "夢裡有{0}，卻聽不到那類東西的聲響：就是它了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:434
msgid "{0} on the tag that never made a sound: that was it."
msgstr "標籤上寫著{0}，卻從沒發出過聲音：就是它了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:435
msgid "The riddle was about it, and it never made a sound."
msgstr "謎語說的就是它，而它從沒發出過聲音。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:439
msgid "The dowry's coin never made a sound: the bride had warded it."
msgstr "嫁妝裡的錢幣從沒發出過聲音：新娘用結界把它封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:440
msgid "The dowry's cloak never made a sound: the bride had warded it."
msgstr "嫁妝裡的斗篷從沒發出過聲音：新娘用結界把它封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:441
msgid "The dowry's potion never made a sound: the bride had warded it."
msgstr "嫁妝裡的藥水從沒發出過聲音：新娘用結界把它封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:443
msgid "The roll's '{0}' was the {1}."
msgstr "結界名錄上的「{0}」就是{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:444
msgid "A {0} echo that never made a sound: that was it."
msgstr "回聲裡那個{0}東西從沒出過聲：就是它。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:445
msgid "{0} came up twice."
msgstr "{0}出現了兩次。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:446
msgid "Nobody could have known."
msgstr "誰也不可能知道。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:463
msgid "You have a feeling you dodged a cart."
msgstr "你覺得自己剛剛躲過了一劫。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:463
msgid "Somewhere, your purse sighs with relief."
msgstr "冥冥之中，你的錢袋鬆了一口氣。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:463 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:479
msgid "You have a feeling you made the right call."
msgstr "你覺得自己做了正確的決定。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:464 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:478
msgid "Nothing to lose sleep over."
msgstr "不值得為此失眠。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:464
msgid "Your gut shrugs. Fair enough."
msgstr "你的直覺聳了聳肩。也罷。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:464
msgid "It felt overpriced. It probably was."
msgstr "感覺要價太高。多半確實如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:465
msgid "Could have gone either way."
msgstr "怎麼選都說得過去。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:465
msgid "Your gut says nothing. It's sulking a little."
msgstr "你的直覺一言不發。它有點鬧彆扭。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:465
msgid "Meh. A wash, probably."
msgstr "嗯……大概不賺不賠吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:466 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:477
msgid "Maybe that wasn't the best idea."
msgstr "也許這不是什麼好主意。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:466
msgid "A small voice whispers: you should've bought that."
msgstr "一個細小的聲音低語：你本該買下它的。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:466
msgid "Your gut grumbles."
msgstr "你的直覺在嘟囔。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:467
msgid "You have a nasty feeling a bargain just walked out the door."
msgstr "你有種不妙的感覺：一筆便宜買賣剛剛走出了門。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:467
msgid "Your gut is writing you a strongly worded letter."
msgstr "你的直覺正在給你寫一封措辭嚴厲的信。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:468
msgid "Somewhere, a better shopkeeper is laughing."
msgstr "某處，一個更高明的店主正在偷笑。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:469 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:475
msgid "Even the heavens pity you."
msgstr "連老天都可憐你。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:469
msgid "Uncle Bram, somewhere, is weeping softly."
msgstr "布拉姆叔叔不知在哪兒輕聲啜泣。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:469
msgid "Your gut has stopped speaking to you."
msgstr "你的直覺已經不想理你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:475
msgid "You feel like you just paid for the privilege of being robbed."
msgstr "你感覺自己剛剛花錢買了個被搶的資格。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:476
msgid "You feel like you just got fleeced."
msgstr "你感覺自己剛被狠宰了一刀。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:476
msgid "Your purse feels lighter. Your heart, heavier."
msgstr "錢袋輕了。心卻沉了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:477
msgid "Close, but the house won. You are the house."
msgstr "差一點，可惜莊家贏了。而莊家就是你。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:478
msgid "A fair day's trade."
msgstr "一筆公道的買賣。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:479
msgid "Your gut does a little dance."
msgstr "你的直覺高興得跳起了舞。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:480
msgid "Highway robbery. The legal kind."
msgstr "簡直是攔路搶劫。合法的那種。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:480
msgid "The heavens smile on you. Don't let it go to your head."
msgstr "老天在對你微笑。可別得意忘形。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:493
msgid "Achievement: {0}"
msgstr "達成成就：{0}"

#: scripts/Main.cs:598
msgid "In the purse: {0}g."
msgstr "錢袋裡有{0}金。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:606
msgid ""
"The notebook and the collection are full: every regular, every thing, every curio, and all nine Heartsongs."
msgstr "筆記本和收藏都已填滿：所有常客、所有物品、所有奇物，以及全部九首心歌。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:611
msgid "Not now: finish what's in hand first."
msgstr "現在不行：先把手頭的事做完。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:725 scripts/Main.cs:888
msgid "THE LOCKING, SUNG WHOLE"
msgstr "大封鎖，完整唱響"

#: scripts/Main.cs:725 scripts/Main.cs:888
msgid "THE CROWN CHEST"
msgstr "王冠寶箱"

#: scripts/Main.cs:756
msgid "BRAM'S STALL"
msgstr "布拉姆的攤位"

#: scripts/Main.cs:756 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:382 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:586
msgid "WEEK {0}"
msgstr "第{0}周"

#: scripts/Main.cs:779
msgid "THE SEASON'S END"
msgstr "一季終了"

#: scripts/Main.cs:794
msgid "THE GILDED GUILD"
msgstr "鍍金公會"

#: scripts/Main.cs:797
msgid "THE ALDRIC KEY"
msgstr "奧德里克之鑰"

#: scripts/Main.cs:863
msgid "FREE AND CLEAR"
msgstr "無債一身輕"

#: scripts/Main.cs:911 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:393
msgid "DAY {0}"
msgstr "第{0}天"

#: scripts/Main.cs:914
msgid ", level {0}"
msgstr "（挑戰等級{0}）"

#: scripts/Main.cs:915
msgid "{0}Week {1}, day {2}{3}  -  {4}"
msgstr "{0}第{1}周，第{2}天{3}  -  {4}"

#: scripts/Main.cs:915
msgid " of {0}"
msgstr "（共{0}天）"

#: scripts/Main.cs:916
msgid "The Guild comes tonight for {0}g."
msgstr "公會今晚來收{0}金。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:917
msgid "The Guild comes for {0}g at the end of day {1}."
msgstr "公會將在第{1}天結束時來收{0}金。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:924
msgid "Uncle Bram slipped you {0}g from his secret stash ({1} left)."
msgstr "布拉姆叔叔從他的私房錢裡偷偷塞給你{0}金（還剩{1}次）。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:180
msgid "(back)"
msgstr "（腰傷）"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:181
msgid "(mare)"
msgstr "（母馬）"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:192
msgid "Hesk's scale. {0}"
msgstr "赫斯克的秤。{0}"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:193
msgid ""
"Rook's game scale. {0} What it weighs, less what you've ticked, is what you couldn't hear."
msgstr "魯克的獵物秤。{0}稱出的重量減去你所勾選東西的重量，就是你沒聽到的東西。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:195
msgid "ON THE SCALE"
msgstr "秤上重量"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:195
msgid "ROOK'S SCALE"
msgstr "魯克的秤"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:225
msgid "Shaken {0}."
msgstr "已搖：{0}。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:225
msgid " and "
msgstr "、"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:228
msgid "{0} Not {1} yet."
msgstr "{0}還沒試過：{1}。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:228
msgid " or "
msgstr "或"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:271
msgid "Lesson learned!"
msgstr "學會了！"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:293
msgid ""
"A black chest wrapped in iron chains: nothing inside can move. Drop it to feel how heavy it is."
msgstr "一隻纏著鐵鏈的黑箱子：裡面什麼都動不了。摔一下，感受它有多重。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:295
msgid ""
"Gilded, with the royal seal! A colour better than its seller thinks: expect {0} things."
msgstr "鍍了金，還蓋著皇家印記！比賣家以為的好一個顏色：內物應為{0}品質。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:296
msgid "A {0} chest: expect {1} things."
msgstr "{0}寶箱：內物應為{1}品質。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:297
msgid "{0} Locked: {1}, {2} pins."
msgstr "{0}上了鎖：{1}，{2}個鎖銷。"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:359
msgid "Price +{0}"
msgstr "價格+{0}"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:378
msgid "Coming apart: no more shaking"
msgstr "快散架了：不能再搖了"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:379
msgid "Rotten: {0}s of shaking left"
msgstr "已腐朽：還能搖{0}秒"

#: scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:382
msgid "Drag to shake it. Lift it high and let go to drop it."
msgstr "拖動來搖晃它。把它舉高再鬆手，就能摔一下。"

